<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">MATIE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ékel Matie</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matie</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ékel</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matie</para>
  <para style="imt">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃swɛn-ɔ̃nkaan wu ɛ̃kwel wa Nsia yi Ngesɛ wu eli mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu Ɔ̃yuda wu ási ekɔɔl li ela. Akiool ba tsɔɔn aliaal ndiri mbuul ondɛ Matie wu ɔ̃twal-mpal, ngɔmɔ̃ onse antam a Yeso kuun ye buaal. Ndɛ okel ol'Ayuda, bvool odzii k'asuo bɔ me nkuul a m'ákel onse Ondoo b'otsɔɔn kwɛn Yeso oyi me ndɔɔ yi asa m'élieel aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã. Anga-ãyal bakyɛ atsam ndiri Matie onge wu aswɛn mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a mvel wu ɛ̃nkuun-nsiaan (70) ye wu ɛ̃kuun-mpuɔ̃ (80) ke mbee a otsɔɔn o Nzɔ a Nziã yi Yelusalem.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wa Nsia yi Ngesɛ wu abɛɛn m'ɔ̃luo wu ankɔɔ a Yeso, oburu b'aburu ndɛ y'obwee o ndɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1-2">1–2</ref></char>) y'ãtee ã Dzaã Batis (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">3.1-12</ref></char>), opongo o Yeso y'ombio b'embio ɔ̃pfu ndɛ, obɛɛn b'ebɛɛn ndɛ ɔ̃sal ke Ngalile (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:16">3.13–4.16</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Akoo k'akab ɔ̃nkaan wu m'ebaal etaan bvi ela bvi ãtee ã Yeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebaal ki ɛ̃kwel eyɛɛn m'ãtee ã Yeso m'ãtal okaal b'ɛ̃kwal, y'emvieel bvi emfa bwɛn emfa. Ãtee m'ãnduru ola onse mɔ̃ mbueel mã «ke ywel a nkio» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 4:17-8:17">4.17–8.17</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebaal ki bviaal etal ãnkunkwa m'ewi Yeso ayio, ŋ'ɛ̃kwɛl ye k'etam ndɛ bɔ ontam (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 8:18-12:21">8.18–12.21</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebaal ki etyel esuo kwɛn Yeso nã ali, eyɛɛn m'ɛ̃tsuun ɛ̃ ndɛ y'Afalisaye, y'ayiool b'ãngel, y'ãmboo m'éketa ndɛ m'ãsuo emfa ki eli Okwɛn a ywel. Kyɛ hɛ̃ eyɛɛn m'emvieel y'oboo b'ãluu m'emfa bwɛn emfa(<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 12:22-16:20">12.22–16.20</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebaal ki enã eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ ãmpal ã Yeso ye mã b'anɔɔn a ndɛ. Ebaal okyɛ hɛ̃ eyɛɛn me b'otal emfa ki edzuu Ebvɔɔn ye ki bvoo a akiool. Kyɛ bvool eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ ãmboo ã Yeso m'ãtal Okwɛn o ywel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 16:21-20:34">16.21–20.34</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebaal ki etaan esuo osam o Yeso Yelusalem, y'otaal mpɛɛ̃-a-mpɛɛ̃ a ndɛ y'amfam b'Ayuda. Kyɛ hɛ̃ eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a emfa ki awal ɔ̃yɛɛl me ndɔɔ ãlio mã ntɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 21:1-25:46">21.1–25.46</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ŋ'eyii efa ɔ̃nkaan, Matie ayɛɛn m'osiin b'asiin Yeso, obiri b'abiri ndɛ ola Pilate, okwa y'osiool o ndɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 26:1-28:20">26.1–28.20</ref></char>). Ke mbee a ŋ'esiool Yeso onse b'ákwi, ndɛ otam antam otam ndiri: «Eyi, esa kwɛn onse ɛ̃kiri mvieel baal akal ayio a mɛ̃...» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 28:19-20">28.19-20</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Bɛɛn Abalayam tiil Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Tal ãnkuũ m'ankiɔɔn a Yeso-Mãsia: David oli nkiɔɔn a Yeso-Mãsia, Abalayam oli nkiɔɔn a David. <verse eid="MAT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abalayam oburu Isak. Isak oburu Dzakab. Dzakab oburu Yuda ye baan-ngoo a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda oburu Pales ye Dzala, ngoo a bɔ Tamaal. Pales oburu Esilom. Esilom oburu Alam. <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Alam oburu Aminadab. Aminadab oburu Naasɔ̃. Naasɔ̃ oburu Saleman. <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Saleman oburu Boodze, ngoo a Boodze Lahab. Boodze oburu Obed, ngoo a Obed Lut. <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Obed oburu Dzwese. Dzwese oburu ɔ̃kwɛn David.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">David oburu Salomɔ̃, ngoo a Salomɔ̃ wu áli ɔ̃kal a Uli. <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Salomɔ̃ oburu Loboham. Loboham oburu Abiya. Abiya oburu Asaf. <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asaf oburu Dzodzafat. Dzodzafat oburu Yolam. Yolam oburu Odzias. <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Odzias oburu Yohatam. Yohatam oburu Akadze. Akadze oburu Edzekias. <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Edzekias oburu Manase. Manase oburu Amose. Amose oburu Yosias. <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosias oburu Yekonia ye baan-ngoo a ndɛ. Me lio olɔ, li ábiri baan b'Isalayel m'ãnkɔɔl k'ɔ̃kiri wa Babilon.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Ke mbee a k'ábiri bɔ m'ãnkɔɔl k'ɔ̃kiri wa Babilon, Yekonia oburu Salatyel. Salatyel oburu Yolobabel. <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Yolobabel oburu Abihud. Abihud oburu Eliakim. Eliakim oburu Adzɔɔl. <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Adzɔɔl oburu Sadok. Sadok oburu Akim. Akim oburu Elihud. <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Elihud oburu Elehadzaal. Elehadzaal oburu Matan. Matan oburu Dzakab. <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Dzakab oburu Dzodzef wu ɔ̃lam a Mali. Mali oli ngoo a Yeso wu ata me Mãsia.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />M'emfa okyɛ, bɛɛn Abalayam tiil David, ãyam ã baal ã́bwel kuun y'ãnã (14). Bɛɛn David tiil k'ábiri baal a Yuda m'ãnkɔɔl k'ɔ̃kiri wa Babilon, ãyam ã baal ã́bwel kuun y'ãnã (14). Bɛɛn hɛ̃ tal olɔ tiil lio li Yeso, ãyam ã baal ã́bwel kuun y'ãnã (14).<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãnzwel ãwi nsia yi àburu Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Tal emfa ki áburu Yeso. Mali wu ngoo a ndɛ áli ɔ̃kaal wu ésɔɔn Dzodzef me ndɔɔ obaal o ndɛ. Kɛn a ye k'ebvool bɔ ntal, Mali obvi yam me waan li Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Dzodzef wu ɔ̃lam a ndɛ, áli mbuul wa dzu. Ndɛ k'ádzii k'afɛn ndɛ ke nkwel a baal wɛ. Ndɛ okuru k'abee ndɛ embeel-a-mwiĩ. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Ŋ'éketsam ndɛ obobɔ, ãnzwel ã Mfam Nziã ãpal ola ndɛ m'ɔ̃tswɛ a twal, ãlieel ndɛ ndiri: «Dzodzef, ɔ̃tiɔɔl a David, oyɛɛ ke bal k'abaal Mali wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, waan li Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal li esi kwɛn ndɛ abva yam olɔ. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Ndɛ àburu muaan wu bɔɔl wu èloo yɛ me Yeso. Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ kieel wu apaal baal a ndɛ onse ãbi ã bɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mam mbueel ãbwel m'emfa okyɛ, me ndɔɔ yi asa m'élieel Mfam m'ɔ̃nywã wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a ndɛ ndiri: <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />«Tal, nsam a ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn k'ayɛɛ abɔɔl wɛ akieel abva yam. Ndɛ akieel aburu muaan wu bɔɔl wu akieel ata m'Emanuɛɛn, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri: “Nziã oli ye bia-byɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Edz 7.14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:8">8.8</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 8:10">10</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="MAT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Ŋ'esiool Dzodzef, ndɛ osi b'etam ãnzwel ã Mfam ndɛ osa: Ndɛ owel ɔ̃kal a ndɛ Mali oyekal ye ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Kɛn a ndɛ k'abvool ntal ye Mali wɛ tiil ye k'eburu ndɛ muaan wu bɔɔl. Dzodzef oloo ndɛ me Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Anga-ãyal ayetal Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Áburu Yeso ke Betelehem, ke nsie yi Yude, me lio li éli Elode ɔ̃kwɛn. Ke mbee a ŋ'aburu ndɛ, anga-ãyal afi etswi ki epal tal, ayi Yelusalem. <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Bɔ afuul ndiri: «Ɔ̃kwɛn a Ayuda wu aburu, kwɛn ali? Bee emwɛn ngam-a-ngam a ndɛ opal k'etswi ki epal tal, bee bu eyelweel ndɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Ŋ'eyoo ɔ̃kwɛn Elode nsia oyɔ, ndɛ ebɔɔ e nsie edziɔɔn, ye baal bueel ba Yelusalem. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Ndɛ otam k'abvool amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'ayiool b'ãngel bam bueel ba yam, me ndɔɔ yi afuul bɔ bubu: «Mboo mã yi aburu Mãsia?» <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ke Betelehem, ke nsie yi Yude. Ke ngwel wɛ, ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nzian ákel bubu:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“Yɛ wu Betelehem, ke nsie a Yude,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">yɛ ke bvool mbee onse ãbviil m'ãnɛn mã nsie a Yude wɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">Ke ngwel wɛ, mfam wu akieel abiri Isalayel yam e mɛ̃ akieel afa ola yɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:1">Mis 5.1</ref></char></note>”.»<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Obobɔ, Elode otam anga-ãyal mbel ota m'edziɔɔn. Ndɛ ofuul bɔ bubu: «Lio emã li epal ngam-a-ngam ondɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ oyuɔɔl bɔ Betelehem, y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Eyi eyebii nsia a muaan wu ɔbwee ngesɛ-ngesɛ. Obobɔ, ŋ' emwɛn byɛ ndɛ, eya eyeyɛɛn mɛ̃, kwɛn mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ngyi ndɛ olweel.»<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Ke mbee a ŋ'eyoo anga-ãyal m'eyɛɛn ɔ̃kwɛn, bɔ ayɛn. Obobɔ, bɔ amwɛn ngam-a-ngam wu émwɛn bɔ k'etswi ki epal tal, ndɛ ákeyi ke nkwel a bɔ. Ndɛ atɔ ke ywel a nzɔ yi eli muaan, ndɛ otɛɛn. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Ŋ'emwɛn bɔ kwɛn ngam-a-ngam otɛɛn oŋɔ̃, bɔ aluul m'esɛ ki enduru. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Bɔ asam onse nzɔ, amwɛn muaan ye ngoo a ndɛ Mali. Bɔ abvi ãbuo ke nkwel a muaan, bu alweel ndɛ. Bɔ adzweel ãkab ã bɔ, bu awi ndɛ ãkab m'eluɔ bvi: Ɔɔl, y'ãnasi ye mbaal mã nswel yi mvɛ mã miil. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Nziã owi bɔ ãnkunkwa me nduaal kwɛn bɔ abee ol'Elode okɔɔl. Bɔ bu abvool ɔ̃kiri a bɔ me nkuul nkyam.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dzodzef ye Mali bwɛn a muaan abal k'Edzipito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Ŋ'eyɛn anga-ãyal, ãnzwel ã Mfam ãpal ola Dzodzef me nduaal, bu ãlieel ndɛ bubu: «Tɛɛn, wal muaan ye ngoo a ndɛ, bal k'Edzipito! Kal okɔ tiil lio li èliaal mɛ̃ yɛ wɛn kɔɔl, ke ngwel wɛ Elode àbii muaan wu abam.» <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Dzodzef otɛɛn, owel muaan ye ngoo a ndɛ, bu abal k'Edzipito me tsia. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Ndɛ bu akal okɔ tiil k'ekwi Elode. M'emfa okyɛ, ãndɔɔ ãbwel m'emfa ki élieel Mfam m'ɔ̃nywã wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a ndɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ nti muaan a mɛ̃ mbel k'apal onse Edzipito<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:11">Odz 2.11</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃kwɛn Elode obam baan b'abɔɔl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Ŋ'emwɛn Elode kwɛn anga-ãyal apfuru ndɛ, ndɛ oluul me mpuru fa. Ndɛ bu atam kwɛn ke Betelehem y'ãla m'ãnku-a-nkuu, abam baan b'abɔɔl bɛɛn b'aburu tu tiil b'ayii me mvel yuaal. Ndɛ osi obobɔ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ osiɔɔl ãtsoo fa lio li élieel anga-ãyal ndɛ tiil lio olɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />M'emfa okyɛ, oyɛɛn obwel onge b'élieel ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã Yelemi ndiri:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />«Ayoo nkii onse Lama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">elel y'ɛ̃nduɔɔl bibi ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Laswɛl mbuul wu alel baan a ndɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">ndɛ k'adzii kwɛn abweel ndɛ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ bvool k'abekal wɛ.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Dze 31.15</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dzodzef ye Mali bwɛn a muaan ambal k'Edzipito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Ke mbee epfu li Elode, ãnzwel ã Mfam ãpal ola Dzodzef me nduaal k'Edzipito. <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />Mɔ̃ bu ãlieel ndɛ bubu: «Tɛɛn, wal muaan ye ngoo a ndɛ, bvool k'ɔ̃kiri wu Isalayel, ke ngwel wɛ b'akebii muaan obam amaakwa.» <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Dzodzef otɛɛn, owel muaan ye ngoo a ndɛ, bu abvool k'ɔ̃kiri wu Isalayel. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Kɛn a ŋ'eyoo ndɛ ndiri Akelahos oyii ɔ̃kwɛn a Yude ke mboo a tal a ndɛ Elode, ndɛ oyoo buɔ k'ayi okɔ. Nziã oyɛɛn ye ndɛ me nduaal, ndɛ bu ayɛn ke nsie yi Ngalile. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Okɔ, ndɛ oyekal ke bviil ngemɔ̃ li ata me Nadzalet, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ asa ndɔɔ yi élieel aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ndiri: «Akieel ata ndɛ m'ɔ̃fi-Nadzalet.»<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ãtee ã Dzaã Batis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Me lio olɔ, Dzaã Batis opal onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛ wa nsie yi Yude, bu abvi otee bubu: <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />«Ekaal ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ, ke ngwel wɛ Okwɛn o ywel osyel tsotsoo a byɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Dzaã ondɛ, wu élieel Edzayi wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã me ndɔɔ a ndɛ ndiri: «Nkii ngamɔ̃ ebebiool nkal ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Efaal ɔ̃siɔɔn me ndɔɔ a Mfam Nziã!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">Eseel ãnkuul ã ndɛ ãkal dzu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Edz 40.3</ref></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Dzaã ákelaal ekɔ ki me mfu e nyam wu ɔ̃mbiri-ãpfuũ wu ata me swamo. Ndɛ hɛ̃ áli y'ɔ̃sii wa kwiil me luu. Bvi-odza bvi ndɛ éli ɛ̃nyɛɛ̃ ye mbaal ã nzoo. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Baal a Yelusalem, ye ba nsie a Yude yueel ye ba nku-a-nku a nzal yi Dzolodɛ̃ bueel ákeya ola ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Bɔ ákekiool ãbi ã bɔ ke nkwel a baal bueel, ndɛ ákewa bɔ opongo onse Dzolodɛ̃.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Onge bɛn Dzaã ámwɛn ɔ̃bɔbɔ wu Afalisaye y'Asaduseyɛ̃ áyi opongo owal, ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ abi-abi eli onge ampel! Wu osuo byɛ emfa ki abal mpuru a Nziã yi èyeya nã? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Obobɔ, esa ãndɔɔ mã ngesɛ m'ãsuo kwɛn byɛ ekaal ɛ̃kwal! <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Ebee byam-a-byam obeyɛɛn wɛn: “Abalayam oli nkiɔɔn a bee.” Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ bam eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ãnkɔɔn m'emwɛn byɛ mã, Nziã okoo k'asa kwɛn mɔ̃ ãkɔɔl atiɔɔl b'Abalayam. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Bam ŋ'eyɛɛn ŋã, ekuu amaayɛɛl me ndɔɔ yi akii ɛ̃ti bɛɛn k'ɛ̃dza ɛ̃ myɛ̃. Ɔ̃ti ndyam wueel wɛn k'aburu nsia yi mvɛ wɛ, àkii ndɛ bvool àtyal ndɛ onse mbaa. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Mɛ̃ wu ewa byɛ opongo b'ãdza kwɛn byɛ ekaal ɛ̃kwal. Kɛn a mbuul wu aya, wu onduru mɛ̃ me waan. Mɛ̃ ke mvaan m'odzuul b'asimpal a ndɛ wɛ. Ndɛ kieel wu awa byɛ opongo b'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal ye bo mbaa. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Mbuul ondɛ oli y'esiɔ onse mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi akab nsia e bele ye bviĩ bvi ebi-ebi. Ndɛ àbvool nsia e ndɛ onse nzɔ yi abekwɛɛ yɔ, kɛn a ndɛ àtyal bviĩ bvi ebi-ebi onse mbaa yɛn k'edzam wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu owel opongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Obobɔ, Yeso ofi nsie yi Ngalile oyi nzal yi Dzolodɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yi ayewal opongo ola Dzaã. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Kɛn a Dzaã obvi obee, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ mbuul wu ekeya ola yɛ, me ndɔɔ yi ewal opongo, yɛ bvool yi ola mɛ̃!» <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «kiool kwɛn esa obobɔ meba ŋã. Ke ngwel wɛ, okyɛ emfa kyɛn ebvaan bia-yɛ esa ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ãli dzu ke nkwel a Nziã.» Dzaã k'abebee wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Ŋ'ewel Yeso opongo, tswa-a-tswa oŋɔ̃, ndɛ opal onse ãdza. Ywel edzweel nzuru, ndɛ omwɛn Ɔ̃fel a Nziã ayesool m'emfa ki kuun, bvool ayebva nkal a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Nkii bu eyɛɛn ke ywel ndiri: «Wu bu Muaan a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃tio, mɛ̃ ndi y'esɛ ki bibi me ndɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Ɔ̃pfu ombio Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Ɔ̃fel obiri Yeso k'ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ, kwɛn Ɔ̃pfu akie ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Yeso osi ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal apipi ãku-ãnã (40) y'atsia ãku-ãnã (40). Ke mbee ãbuɛɛn omɔ̃, ndɛ nzal ewel. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Ɔ̃pfu-nga-ɔ̃mbio osyel tsotsoo a ndɛ, bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Okɛɛn yɛ li Muaan a Nziã, oŋɔ̃ tam kwɛn ãnkɔɔn mã ãkɔɔl nsuɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Esuɔ li Ayuda eli mampa.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Ákel bubu: “Elaã e mbuul k'eli kɛn a m'esuɔ wɛ, kɛn a lɔ eli m'Endɔɔ lueel li epal m'onywã a Nziã!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Det 8.3</ref></char></note>”»<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Obobɔ, Ɔ̃pfu obiri Yeso ke bviil li ngel, osuul ndɛ ke ywel a Nzɔ a Nziã, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Okɛɛn yɛ Muaan a Nziã li, tsio tiil nsie ku! Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“Ndɛ àtam ãnzwel ã ndɛ me ndɔɔ a yɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">Mɔ̃ ã̀biri yɛ nkal a mviɔɔl ɛ̃ mɔ̃,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">kwɛn yɛ bee tsa obɛɛl me nkɔɔn<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Ãnz 91.11-12</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="MAT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Ákel hɛ̃ bubu: “Oyɛɛ ke poo Mfam Nziã a yɛ wɛ!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Det 6.16</ref></char></note>”»<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Ɔ̃pfu bvool obiri ndɛ ke nkio yi nda yi nda, bu asuo ndɛ ãkwɛn m'ɔ̃kiri mam mbueel ye lweel e mɔ̃. <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Ndɛ bu alieel Yeso bubu: «Mɛ̃ èwa yɛ bvam bvieel bvi, ŋɛn yɛ bvi ãbuo ke nkwel a mɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yi alweel mɛ̃.» <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Yesu bu abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mbal ŋã Ɔ̃pfu! Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel bubu: “Yɛ àbva ãbuo kɛn a ke nkwel a Mfam Nziã wu Nziã a yɛ, yɛ àlweel kɛn a ndyam<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13-14">Det 6.13-14</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="MAT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Ɔ̃pfu bu ayɔɔl Yeso. Ãnzwel bu ãyii ãsal me ndɔɔ a ndɛ.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso obɛɛn ɔ̃sal ke Ngalile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Ŋ'eyoo Yeso ndiri alɔ Dzaã bwal, ndɛ odzuru nzuru oyɛn nsie yi Ngalile. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Ndɛ ombal Nadzalet, bu ayekal ke Kapelanahum, bviil li nku-a-nku a baã, me nsie yi Dzabulɔ̃ ye Nefitali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />M'emfa okyɛ, ŋ'asi ãndɔɔ m'élieel ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã Edzayi ndiri:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />«Yɛ wu nsie yi Dzabulɔ̃ ye yɛ wu nsie yi Nefitali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">nkuul ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa, ongwel a nzal yi Dzolodɛ̃.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">Yɛ wu Ngalile, ɔ̃kiri a baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Baal b'abvi nsɛn onse empeel</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">amwɛn mwiĩ wu ɔ̃nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">nkal a baal b'abvi nsɛn onse ɔ̃kiri wu empeel li epfu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">mwiĩ obal<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:23-9:1">Edz 8.23–9.1</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Bɛɛn lio olɔ, Yeso obɛɛn otee ndiri: «Ekaal ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ, ke ngwel wɛ Okwɛn o ywel osyel tsotsoo a byɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oti ayio anã b'ɛ̃kwel mbel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, Yeso ákedzuu nku-a-nku a baã li Ngalile, ndɛ omwɛn baan-ngoo buaal: Éli Simɔ̃ wu ata me Piɛɛl ye muaan-ngoo a ndɛ Ãndele. Bɔ áketyal okii onse nzal, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ áli aswal b'answi. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Enɔɔn a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ èsuul byɛ aswal a baal.» <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Alili oŋɔ̃, bɔ ayiri ãkii ã bɔ, bu aluɛɛn a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Ŋ'esyel ndɛ nkwel lala, ndɛ omwɛn baan-ngoo akyam buaal: Éli Dzak ye Dzaã, baan a Dzebede. Bɔ áli onse bvuaal ye tal a bɔ, ákefaal ãkii ã bɔ. Ndɛ oti bɔ mbel hɛ̃. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Alili oŋɔ̃, bɔ ayiri bvuaal ye tal a bɔ, bu aluɛɛn a ndɛ.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oyiool bvool obvuul embuul e baal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yeso ákedziɔɔn Ngalile wueel, ayiool onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn, atsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Okwɛn o Nziã, bvool aboo ãluu mam mbueel y'elyam bvam bvieel onse baal. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Obobɔ, nsia a ndɛ etsɔɔn m'etswi e nsie kieel ki Sili. Abiri ndɛ baal b'ákemwɛn fool li ãluu m'emfa bwɛn emfa: B'áli y'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi, ye b'áli y'ãluu m'esiɔ̃, y'ekal. Ndɛ obvuul bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Embuul e baal ékeluɛɛn a ndɛ. Bɔ ákefa Ngalile, ye nsie y'Ãbviil-Kuun, ye Yelusalem, ye Yude, y'etswi e nsie ki ongwel a Dzolodɛ̃.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ãtee ã Yeso ke ywel a nkio</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-26">Luk 6.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Ŋ'emwɛn Yeso embuul e baal, ndɛ onɔɔn nkal a nkio, bu abvi nsɛn. Ayio a ndɛ asyel tsotsoo a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Ndɛ awal oyɛɛn, obvi bɔ oyiool ndiri:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />«Esɛ ngamfɛn, ola baal b'ali aywal m'ãndɔɔ m'ɔ̃fel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:3">ke ngwel wɛ Okwɛn o ywel oli bo bɔ!<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Esɛ ngamfɛn, ola baal b'abelel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:4">ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã akieel abweel bɔ!<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Esɛ ngamfɛn, ola baal b'ali y'ɔ̃kwal-efyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:5">ke ngwel wɛ bɔ akieel abɔɔ nsie yi élieel Nziã ndiri awa bɔ!<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Esɛ ngamfɛn, ola baal b'ali ye nzal ye nzuaal yi asa ãndɔɔ mã dzu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:6">ke ngwel wɛ bɔ akieel ayool!<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Esɛ ngamfɛn, ola baal b'asio baal nyiĩ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:7">ke ngwel wɛ Nziã akieel asio bɔ nyiĩ!<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Esɛ ngamfɛn, ola baal b'ali ɛ̃kwal tsɛtsɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:8">ke ngwel wɛ bɔ akieel amwɛn Nziã!<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Esɛ ngamfɛn, ola baal b'asa kwɛn opi okal onse baal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:9">ke ngwel wɛ akieel ata bɔ me baan a Nziã!<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Esɛ ngamfɛn, ola baal bɛn abetuaal bɔ mpal me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ asa ãndɔɔ mã dzu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:10">ke ngwel wɛ, Okwɛn o ywel okieel okal bo bɔ!<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Esɛ ngamfɛn ola byɛ, ŋɛn baal abetoo byɛ ɛ̃tswɛ, abetuaal byɛ mpal bvool abeburu byɛ ãndɔɔ m'emfa bvieel, me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Esia mpal, bvool edzɔɔl m'esɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn, Nziã okwee byɛ ebvakab ki enɛn ke ywel. Ke ngwel wɛ, ási aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã b'átsɔɔn nkwel a byɛ abubu.»<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ɔ̃ngwa ye mwiĩ a ɔkiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mak 9.50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Byɛ, byɛ eli ɔ̃ngwa wu ɔ̃kiri. Kɛn ɔ̃ngwa okɛɛn oyii wel, emfa emã ki abveel obvie o ndɛ? Ndɛ ŋ'ayii ɔ̃sal pyɛ, esiil kɛn a k'ata ndɛ pfɛɛ ke nkwel-a-nzi, kwɛn baal adziaal ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Byɛ, byɛ eli mwiĩ a ɔ̃kiri. Ola b'atuu nkal a nkio k'okoo k'okal m'odziɔɔn wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Andɛɛl mbunda, k'akoo k'apfeel ndɛ kantin wɛ, kɛn andɔɔl ndɛ nkal eluɔ ki abesuul ndɛ, kwɛn ndɛ angal me ndɔɔ a baal bueel b'ali onse nzɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Emfa kiki, yɔɔl kwɛn mwiĩ a byɛ angal ke nkwel a baal, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ bɔ amwɛn ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ byɛ mi ngesɛ, bvool alweel Tal a byɛ wu oli ke ywel.»<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Yeso ke nkwel a Ngel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Ebee otsam wɛn mɛ̃ ngyi me ndɔɔ yi mbaal Ngel<note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngel ŋã esuo ãngel m'ãli onse ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃taan mi ékel Moyize.</char></note> y'ãyɛɛn m'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã. Mɛ̃ ke ngyi me ndɔɔ yi mbaal mɔ̃ wɛ, mɛ̃ ngyi me ndɔɔ yɛn otsɛn o mɔ̃ mbueel okoo. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, tiil ye k'èbwel ywel ye nsie, ekal si mpiɛɛl, ekal si elu-luɔ kyam k'emã ki embal me ngel pyɛ, ye k'ekoo ãndɔɔ mbueel. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, okɛɛn mbuul ombaal onkyam ngel yi ebvool mbee, bvool oyiool bakyɛ k'asa obobɔ, ndɛ akieel akal mbuul wu obvool mbee onse Okwɛn o ywel. Kɛn a okɛɛn mbuul olweel ãngel bvool oyiool bakyɛ k'asa obobɔ, ndɛ akieel akal mbuul wu ɔ̃nɛn onse Okwɛn o ywel. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, okɛɛn emfa ki esa byɛ ãndɔɔ mã dzu k'enduru emfa ki ayiool b'ãngel y'Afalisaye wɛ, byɛ k'ekoo k'esam Okwɛn o ywel wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Obveel b'ondoo y'ɔ̃taal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:25">Mak 11.25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luk 12.57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Byɛ eyoo k'álieel ankɔɔ ndiri: “Oyɛɛ ke bam mbuul wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Opa 20.13</ref></char></note>.” Mbuul wu abam ngaburu-mbuul, ndɛ àyetsuun ke nkwel antwel. <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Kɛn a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mbuul ndyam wueel wu aya mpuru ye ndoo a dzii, ndɛ àyetsuun ke nkwel antwel. Mbuul wu ata ngaburu-mbuul ndiri: “mbuul wa ngwel-a-ngwel”, àbiri ndɛ ke mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda. Mbuul wu atoo wumɔ̃ ndiri: “Ewool e mbuul”, àtyal ndɛ onse ywɛn e mbaa. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Obobɔ, okɛɛn yɛ biri kab e yɛ ke nkiin yi awa ãkab, ŋ'etɔ yɛ okɔ, okɛɛn yɛ yeel kwɛn ndoo a yɛ wa dzii oli ye ndɔɔ ye yɛ, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />siil kab e yɛ oŋɔ̃, ke nkwel a nkiin yi awa ãkab, kɔɔl kɛn y'abveel ondoo ye ndɛ. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, yɛ abvool kwɛn yɛ wa kab e yɛ ola Nziã. <verse eid="MAT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />Okɛɛn mbuul obvi yɛ mbal, ŋ'eyii eyi byɛ otsuun, ŋ'eli byɛ kɛn me nkuul, faal ndɔɔ oyɔ ye ndɛ tswa-a-tswa. Okɛɛn k'obobɔ wɛ, mbuul ondɛ ol'owi yɛ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ntwel, ntwel owi yɛ me mbwel-mbwel, mbwel-mbwel owel yɛ oywɛɛn me bwal. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɛ wɛn, yɛ k'àpal onse okɔ wɛ tiil ye k'efuru yɛ ebiin e yɛ kyam kieel.»<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Esio y'obal o mbuul onse obi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:8-9">Mat 18.8-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:43">Mak 9.43</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 9:47-48">47-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Byɛ eyoo k'álieel ndiri: “Oyɛɛ ke dzuu y'ɔ̃kal wuo y'ɔ̃lam a mbuul wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Opa 20.14</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Kɛn a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn: Mbuul ndyam wueel wu otal anga-ɔ̃kal y'efua, ŋ’amaadzuu ye ndɛ onse ɔ̃kwal a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Obobɔ, okɛɛn dziil e yɛ li elam ebiri yɛ onse obi, mbaal lɔ, ta lɔ pfɛɛ lala ye yɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, eli ngesɛ me ndɔɔ a yɛ k'aywɛn a elyam e nzuru ngemɔ̃, ye k'atyal nzuru a yɛ yam yueel onse ywɛn e mbaa. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Okɛɛn kuɔɔl e yɛ ki elam ebal yɛ onse obi, tsiil kyɛ, ta kyɛ pfɛɛ lala ye yɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, eli ngesɛ me ndɔɔ a yɛ k'aywɛn a elyam e nzuru ngemɔ̃, ye k'atyal nzuru a yɛ yam yueel onse ywɛn e mbaa.»<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Obam o bal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:7-9">Mat 19.7-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:4-5">Mak 10.4-5</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:10-12">10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Álieel hɛ̃ ndiri: “Mbuul wu abee ɔ̃kal, awa ndɛ ɔ̃nkaan wu ekwi bɔ bal<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1">Det 24.1</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Kɛn a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mbuul ndyam wueel wu abee ɔ̃kal, okɛɛn ke me ndɔɔ abɔɔl wɛ, ŋ'atam ɔ̃kaal ondɛ k'ayedzuu ye bɔɔl ɔ̃kyam. Mbuul wu abaal ɔ̃kaal wu ebee ɔ̃lam, ŋ'adzuu y'anga-ɔ̃kal.»<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Olab b'ɔ̃kyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Byɛ bvool eyoo k'álieel ankɔɔ ndiri: “Oyɛɛ ke lab ɔ̃kyel wa mfya wɛ. Kɛn a yɛ ebvaan asa ndɔɔ yi elab yɛ ɔ̃kyel ke nkwel a Mfam<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lev 19.12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:3">Ɛ̃bv 30.3</ref> ; <ref loc="DEU 23:22-24">Det 23.22-24</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:17">Dza 8.17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 15:4">Ãnz 15.4</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 1:10">1Ti 1.10</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Kɛn a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, eyɛɛ k’elab ɔ̃kyel ndyam wɛ, ekal me nkuũ a ywel, ke ngwel wɛ lɔ eli Kiri e Nzia li okwɛn, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />ekal me nkuũ a nsie, ke ngwel wɛ yɔ eli mboo yi ebesuul Nzia ntaã e ndɛ, wuo ekal me nkuũ a Yelusalem, ke ngwel wɛ olɔ eli bviil li Ɔ̃kwɛn wu ɔ̃nɛn. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Oyɛɛ hɛ̃ ke lab ɔ̃kyel m'ɔ̃tswɛ a yam wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ, yɛ ke koo k'asa kwɛn efu e yɛ ngemɔ̃ ekal fuu wuo pi wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Eyɛɛn kɛn a wɛn “hɛɛ̃” okɛɛn hɛɛ̃, wuo wɛn “hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃”, okɛɛn hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɔɔ yi abelweel ebefa ola Nga-ãyal ãbi.»<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Obee b'obi obveel m'obi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk 6.29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Byɛ eyoo k'álieel ndiri: “Okɛɛn mbuul obwel yɛ dziil, yɛ hɛ̃ bwel li ndɛ”, bvool ndiri “okɛɛn mbuul ombaal yɛ dziin, yɛ hɛ̃ mbaal li ndɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:24">Opa 21.24</ref> ; <ref loc="LEV 24:20">Lev 24.20</ref> ; <ref loc="DEU 19:21">Det 19.21</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Kɛn a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn: Okɛɛn mbuul osi byɛ obi, ebee ndɛ bɔ obveel. Ŋɛn mbuul obɛɛl yɛ empal me bal li elam, kaal ndɛ hɛ̃ bal li ekal. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Okɛɛn mbuul odzii k’abva yɛ mbal me ndɔɔ yi awal yɛ kadzaka, yɔɔl ndɛ hɛ̃ awal simisi. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Okɛɛn mbuul oywɛɛn yɛ k’abiri ndɛ pfuũ kilometele ngɔmɔ̃, biri ndɛ lɔ akilometele buaal ye ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Ŋɛn mbuul osɔɔ eluɔ ola yɛ, wa ndɛ kyɛ. Ŋɛn mbuul odzii k’asuɔɔn eluɔ ola yɛ, bee ndɛ kyɛ oluo.»<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Odzii b'ataal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luk 6.27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Byɛ eyoo k'álieel ndiri: “Yɛ adzii nga-ndoo a yɛ, kɛn a yɛ abyal ɔ̃taal a yɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Kɛn a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, edzii ataal a byɛ. Ebuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a b'atuaal byɛ mpal. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Obobɔ, byɛ èkal baan a Tal a byɛ wa ke ywel. Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ abepaal tal ol'abi y'abvɛ. Ndɛ bvool abesa kwɛn mvel andwɔɔ nkal a baal ba dzu ye baal b'ãbi. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn byɛ edzii kɛn a baal b'adzii byɛ, ebvakab ki awa byɛ ki efa kwɛn? Nzal-a-ŋɛn, Atwal-mpal hɛ̃ adzii b'adzii bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Okɛɛn baal b'ebio byɛ kɛn a baan-ngoo a byɛ, ndɔɔ yi esa byɛ yi nkwa oŋɔ̃ a yɔ? Baal bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ abesa obobɔ hɛ̃. <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Oŋɔ̃ ekal ɔ̃koo, onge Tal a byɛ wa ke ywel wu oli ɔ̃koo.»<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s2">Emfa ki awa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Ekal y’onkyab bɛn ŋ'esa byɛ ãndɔɔ m'ãli dzu ke nkwel a baal, ebee okal me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ atal byɛ. Okɛɛn k'obobɔ wɛ, byɛ k'ekoo k'ebɔɔ ebvakab ola Tal a byɛ wa ke ywel wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Obobɔ, okɛɛn yɛ awa ɔ̃ywal eluɔ, bee nkyal osa kwɛn baal atal yɛ. Baal a pfuru abesa bubu onse ãnzɔ m’ãbuɛɛn y'ababal, kwɛn baal atuɛɛn bɔ. Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, bɔ ŋ'amaabɔɔ ebva-kab ki bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Kɛn a yɛ, ŋ’ewa kuɔɔl e yɛ ki elam ɔ̃ywal eluɔ, ywɔɔl kwɛn kuɔɔl e yɛ ki ekal ebee oyɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />M’emfa okyɛ, ebvaan kwɛn kab e yɛ olɔ ekal m’odziɔɔn. Obobɔ, Tal a yɛ wu abemwɛn m’ãbwel m’edziɔɔn, àbveel yɛ kab olɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Emfa ki abuɛɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Byɛ eboobuɛɛn, ebee onge baal a pfuru okal, b'adzii k'abuɛɛn tɛ m'ɔ̃kiri k'ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn, ye k'ãmboo m'emwɛɛn ɛ̃siɔɔn, kwɛn baal atal bɔ. Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, bɔ oŋɔ̃ ŋ'amaabɔɔ ebva-kab ki bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Kɛn a yɛ, ŋ’eboobuɛɛn yɛ, sam bam onse ngwel-a-nzɔ, kuru ɔ̃nywa a yɔ, kwɛn yɛ buɛɛn Tal a yɛ wu oli oŋɔ̃ m’edziɔɔn. Obobɔ, Tal a yɛ wu amwɛn m’ãbwel m’edziɔɔn, àwa yɛ ebva-kab.»<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Byɛ, ŋ’eboobuɛɛn byɛ, ebee ãndɔɔ ãmamã oyɛɛn nsa bibi, onge baal bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ. Bɔ atsam wɛn Nziã ayoo bɔ, me ndɔɔ yi eyɛɛn bɔ boo-boo. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Ebee onge bɔ osa. Ke ngwel wɛ, Tal a byɛ oyɛɛ ki eli byɛ ye kɔɔ e kyɛ, ye k'esɔɔ byɛ kyɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ebuɛɛn e Mfam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11.2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Obobɔ, etal emfa ki ebuɛɛn byɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">“Tal a bee wu oli ke ywel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">yɔɔl nkuũ a yɛ ekal ye nsia,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />yɔɔl Okwɛn o yɛ oya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">yɔɔl kwɛn asa b’edzii yɛ me nsie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">onge b’asa bɔ ke ywel. <verse eid="MAT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Wa bee nonɔ̃ bvi-odza bvi tsoo bwɛn a tsoo.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Dzeel ãbi ã bee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:12">onge b'edzeel bee hɛ̃ baal b'asi bee obi.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Oyɛɛ ke yɔɔl kwɛn bee ebva m'ɔ̃mbio wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">kɛn a bvuul bee me mviɔɔl mi ɔ̃pfu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">[Ke ngwel wɛ omfam ye waan ye lweel eli bvi yɛ ɔ̃bu. Amɛn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ãndɔɔ mã k'ákel mɔ̃ onse ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ Nziã mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>.]”<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn byɛ edzeel baal b’asa byɛ obi, Tal a byɛ wa ke ywel àdzeel ãbi ã byɛ hɛ̃. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Kɛn a ŋɛn, byɛ k'edzeel baal b’asa byɛ obi wɛ, Tal a byɛ wa ke ywel hɛ̃ k'àdzeel ãbi ã byɛ wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Emfa ki asa ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ISA 58:3-8">Edz 58.3-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Byɛ eboosa ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal, ãsu ã byɛ ãbee ãwua-ãwua okal, onge b'ebesa baal a pfuru: Bɔ abesuul ãsu fel-fefel, kwɛn baal bueel ayɛɛ kwɛn bɔ aboosa ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal. Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, bɔ ŋ'amaabɔɔ ebva-kab ki bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Kɛn a yɛ, ŋ’eboosa yɛ ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal, suɔɔl osu o yɛ, kel ãnasi m'ɔ̃tswɛ a yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />M’emfa okyɛ, yɛ k'àsuo baal kwɛn yɛ abesa ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal wɛ, yɛ àsuo kɛn a Tal a yɛ wu oli oŋɔ̃ m’odziɔɔn. Obobɔ, Tal a yɛ wu amwɛn m’ãbebwel m’edziɔɔn, àwa yɛ ebva-kab.»<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Opfel bo ke ywel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Ebee opfel me nsie obvool. Me nsie ŋã, asieel adza bɔ, bɔ oburu nkoo, baal a pfuul abwel ãnzɔ me ndɔɔ yi ayeturu bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Ebvool opfel kɛn a ke ywel. Okɔ, asieel k'akoo k'adza bɔ wɛ, bɔ k'oburu nkoo wɛ, baal a pfuul k'akoo k'abwel ãnzɔ me ndɔɔ yi ayeturu bɔ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mboo yi eli opfel o yɛ, ɔ̃kwal a yɛ hɛ̃ àkal okɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mviil ãli mbunda a nzuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Mviil ã yɛ ãli mbunda a nzuru a yɛ. Okɛɛn mviil ã yɛ ãli ngesɛ, nzuru a yɛ yueel hɛ̃ èkal onse okal-a-kal. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Kɛn a ŋɛn mviil ã yɛ ãli y’ãluu, nzuru a yɛ yueel hɛ̃ èkal onse empeel. Obobɔ, okɛɛn okal-a-kal b'oli onse yɛ oyii empeel, empeel olɔ èkal li enduru ɔ̃ndel!»<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Nziã wuo Nzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16.13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Ɔ̃nkyal ngɔmɔ̃ k'akoo m'okal m'amfam buaal wɛ: Okɛɛn ndɛ abyal ngɔmɔ̃, ndɛ àdzii wukyɛ, okɛɛn ndɛ akuru nzuru me ngɔmɔ̃, ndɛ àfiɛɛn wukyɛ. Okɛɛn byɛ eli ankyal a Nzi, byɛ k'ekoo k'esal me ndɔɔ a Nziã wɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkuũ yi Nzi m'ɔ̃nywã wa gelek eli «Mamɔ̃», ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri nziã wa nzi.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ebee nguo okɛɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-32">Luk 12.22-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Obɔ otsɛn bɛn mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, me ndɔɔ elaã e byɛ, ebee nguo okɛɛ me bvi èdza byɛ, wuo bvi enywã byɛ. Me ndɔɔ a nzuru a byɛ, ebee nguo okɛɛ me bvi èlaal byɛ. Elaã e byɛ k'enduru bvi-odza m'ɔ̃bvɛn wɛ, nzuru a byɛ hɛ̃ k'enduru ekɔ m'ɔ̃bvɛn wɛ? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Etal anywɛn: Bɔ k'akwɛn wɛ, bɔ hɛ̃ k'atsam wɛ, bɔ k'ali y'ãmboo m'akwɛɛ nsia wɛ. Kɛn a Tal a byɛ wa ke ywel abeliil bɔ. Byɛ k'enduru bɔ me dzuun wɛ? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Ondɛ mbuul nã wɛn ŋ'ekɛɛ ndɛ nguo m'omwiĩ o ndɛ, okoo k'alweel bɔ elio-lio?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />Ndɔɔ mã yi ekɛɛ byɛ nguo m'olaal? Etal emfa ki ekwel bviĩ bvi ebvɛ-ebvɛ bvi ãnguun: Bvɛ k'esal wɛ, bvɛ hɛ̃ k'ebaan ekɔ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, okyam ɔ̃kwɛn Salomɔ̃ y'opfel bueel b'éli a ndɛ, k'álaal ekɔ bvi ebvɛ-ebvɛ onge bviĩ obvɛ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Bviĩ bvɛn nonɔ̃ ŋã eli, ɔ̃suu atsiil, atyel onse mbaa. Okɛɛn Nziã alaal bvɛ m'emfa okyɛ, oŋɔ̃ b'ekwɛɛn ndɛ olaal byɛ, baal b'okiool otsi-tsiri! <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Obobɔ, ebee nguo okɛɛ wɛn: “Ki edza bee emã?” Wuo “ki enywã bee emã?”, wuo bvool “ki elaal bee emã?” <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Baal b'abebii bvɛ owuun wɛ bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ. Kɛn a Taal wa ke ywel oyɛɛ kwɛn byɛ eli ye kɔɔ li eluɔ obvɛ. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel kɛn, ebii Okwɛn o Nziã ye m'edzii ndɛ, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ndɛ awa byɛ bvi esiil. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Obobɔ, ebee nguo okɛɛ me ndɔɔ ɔ̃suu, ke ngwel wɛ ɔ̃suu àkɛɛ nguo me ndɔɔ a ndyam. Tsoo bwɛn a tsoo eli y'ãmpal m'ãkoo me ndɔɔ a lɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s2">Obee b'ãndɔɔ ã bakyɛ otsiil</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk 6.37-38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Ebee ãndɔɔ ã bakyɛ otsiil, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ hɛ̃ abee mã byɛ otsiil. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Ke ngwel wɛ, àtsiil ãndɔɔ ã byɛ onge b'ebetsiil byɛ mã bakyɛ, àmvɛɛl ãndɔɔ ã byɛ m'emvɛɛl li ebemvɛɛl byɛ mã bakyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Ndɔɔ mã yi emwɛn yɛ efeel ki eli onse dziil e muaan-ngoo a yɛ, kɛn a yɛ k'amwɛn epaal ki ekwii ki eli onse dziil e yam wɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Emfa emã kyɛn yɛ koo k'ayɛɛn muaan-ngoo a yɛ wɛn: “Muaan-ngoo, sa mɛ̃ mbaal yɛ efeel ki eli onse dziil e yɛ”, kwɛn ŋɛn yɛ li y'epaal ki ekwii onse dziil e yam? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Mbuul a pfuru! Ŋ’ɛ̃kwel kɛn mbaal epaal ki ekwii ki onse dziil e yam! M'emfa okyɛ, yɛ ol'obvi omwɛn kal-a-kal, me ndɔɔ yi ambaal efeel ki eli onse dziil e muaan-ngoo a yɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Eluɔ bvi ngel y'ãnkɔɔn m'ɔ̃bvɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Ebee eluɔ bvi ngel ol'amva owa, owɛɛl bɔ ayekɔɔl me byɛ bvool atswi byɛ, ebee hɛ̃ ãnkɔɔn m'ɔ̃bvɛn ol'anguru otyal, kwɛn bɔ abee bvɛ me ntaã odziaal.»<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Esɔɔ, ebii, ebɛɛl nzɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11.9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Ebesɔɔ, àwa byɛ. Ebebii, byɛ èbɔɔ. Ebebɛɛl nzɔ, àdzweel byɛ yɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu abesɔɔ abeyɔɔ. Mbuul wu abebii abebɔɔ. Mbuul wu abebɛɛl nzɔ abedzweel ndɛ yɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Ondɛ tal nã onse byɛ wɛn muaan asɔɔ esuɔ ola ndɛ, ndɛ owi ndɛ nkɔɔn? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Wuo muaan asɔɔ nswi ola ndɛ, ndɛ owi ndɛ ntaal? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Obobɔ, okɛɛn byɛ b'eli bam abi-abi eyɛɛ k'ewa baan a byɛ eluɔ bvi ngesɛ, oŋɔ̃ Tal a byɛ wa ke ywel wu akwɛɛn k'awa eluɔ bvi ngesɛ ola baal b'asɔɔ bvɛ ola ndɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ngel yi nkiin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:31">Luk 6.31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Ãndɔɔ mbueel m'edzii byɛ kwɛn bakyɛ asa me ndɔɔ a byɛ, byɛ hɛ̃ esa mɔ̃ me ndɔɔ a bɔ: Omɔ̃ ãndɔɔ m’etam Ngel a Moyize y’ɛ̃nkaan mi aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã osa.»<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ɔ̃nywã a nzɔ ye nkuul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:23-24">Luk 13.23-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Esam m'ɔ̃nywã a nzɔ wu ɔ̃tsi-ɔ̃tsi. Ke ngwel wɛ ɔ̃nywa a nzɔ wu abiri baal k'epfu oli wu ɔ̃nɛn, nkuul yi ayi okɔ hɛ̃ eli yi nɛn. B'anɔɔn a yɔ ali bibi. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Kɛn ɔ̃nywa a nzɔ wu abiri baal k'elaã oli wu ɔ̃tsi-ɔ̃tsi, nkuul yi ayi okɔ hɛ̃ eli yi ntsi-ntsiri. B'abɔɔ yɔ k'ali bibi wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ɔ̃ti ye nsia e ndɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk 6.43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Ekyab m'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a mfya. Bɔ aya ola byɛ m’emfa bvi emɛmɛɛ̃. Kɛn a onse ɛ̃kwal, bɔ ali anyam a mpuru. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Byɛ ekieel eyɛɛ bɔ m'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ. Byɛ ekoo k'eka nsia e bvine m'ɔ̃ti wu ãnsiɛɛn? Wuo byɛ ekoo k'eka nsia e fig m'ɔ̃ti wu ãnsiɛɛn ɔ̃kyam? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Ɔ̃ti wa ngesɛ aburu nsia yi ngesɛ. Ɔ̃ti wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi hɛ̃ aburu nsia yi mbi-mbi. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Ɔ̃ti wa ngesɛ k'aburu nsia yi mbi-mbi wɛ. Ɔ̃ti wa y'oluu hɛ̃ k'aburu nsia yi ngesɛ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Ɔ̃ti ndyam wueel wɛn k'aburu nsia yi mvɛ wɛ, àkii ndɛ, bvool àtyal ndɛ onse mbaa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:10">Luk 3.10</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Obobɔ, byɛ èyɛɛ aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a mfya m’ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Oyɛɛn y'osa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:46">Luk 6.46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">13.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «K'eli bueel b'ata mɛ̃ me: “Mfam, Mfam!”, b'akieel asam onse Okwɛn o ywel wɛ, eli kɛn a ndɛ ondɛ wu asa ãndɔɔ m'etam Tal a mɛ̃ wa ke ywel osa. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Me tsoo li ekieel etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal, bibi akieel aliaal mɛ̃ ndiri: “Mfam, Mfam, ke me nkuũ a yɛ wɛ, k'ékeliaal bee ãndɔɔ m’ãfa ola Nziã? Ke me nkuũ a yɛ wɛ, k'éketswɛɛl bee ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi? Ke me nkuũ a yɛ wɛ, k'ékesa bee emvieel bibi?” <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ ekieel etsiil oyɛɛn kal-a-kal wɛn: “Mɛ̃ lɔɔ-okal ke ngyɛɛ byɛ wɛ, embal bam tsotsoo a mɛ̃, byɛ baal b'ebesa ãbi!”»<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ãnzɔ mbuaal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6.47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mbuul wu oyoo ãyɛɛn me ngyɛɛn mɛ̃, bvool osi mɔ̃, ndɛ àkal onge mbuul nga-ãyal wu otuu nzɔ a ndɛ nkal a nkɔɔn. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Mvel ondwɔɔ, ãnzal ãluul, mfel obwel me yɔ, kɛn a yɔ k'ebvi wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ átuu yɔ nkal a nkɔɔn. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Kɛn a mbuul wu oyoo ãyɛɛn me ngyɛɛn mɛ̃, bvool k'asi mɔ̃ wɛ, àkal onge mbuul wu ewool wu otuu nzɔ a ndɛ nkal a nsie ntu, k'abɛɛn yɔ otuu nkal a nkɔɔn wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Mvel ondwɔɔ, ãnzal ãluul, mfel obwel me yɔ, yɔ ebvi, bu etsɔɔn yam yueel.»<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Omfam o Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:22">Mak 1.22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:32">Luk 4.32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Ŋ'eman Yeso ãtee omɔ̃, esi baal ɛ̃kam bibi m'emfa ki éketee ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ áketee bɔ y'omfam bueel, k'onge ayiool b'ãngel a bɔ wɛ.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Yeso oboo mbuul wa y'ãluu me leba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mak 1.40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Ŋ'esool Yeso ke ywel a nkio, embuul e baal eluɛɛn a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wa y'ãluu me leba osyel tsotsoo a ndɛ, obvi ãbuo ke nkwel a ndɛ, bu aluɔɔn ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, okɛɛn yɛ dzii, sa kwɛn mɛ̃ nkal tsɛtsɛ<note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Tsɛtsɛ» ŋã, wu ebvuul mbuul wa y'ãluu me leba. Ndɛ ŋ'abɔɔ nkuul yi akɔɔl onse baal bvool asam Nzɔ a Nziã.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yeso onaan kuɔɔl, onywɛn me ndɛ, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ nzii obobɔ, kal tsɛtsɛ!» Bam kɛn alili oŋɔ̃, ndɛ oyii tsɛtsɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Yeso bu atam ndɛ bubu osa: «Bee mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ oliaal, yi y'asuo nzuru a yɛ ola ngaa-a-Nziã, kwɛn ndɛ atal yɛ ngesɛ. Wa kab hɛ̃, m'emfa ki ékel Moyize onse ɔ̃kaan wu ãngel, m'emfa okyɛ, baal bueel àyɛɛ kwɛn yɛ oluu ofi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:2-32">Lev 14.2-32</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso obvuul ɔ̃sal a mbiri a ambwel-mbwel wa Lom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:46-54">Dzã 4.46-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Ŋ'ékesam Yeso onse ola bo Kapelanahum, mbiri a mbwel-mbwel ɔ̃nkam ngɔ̃mɔ̃ wa Lom osyel tsotsoo a ndɛ, bu aluɔɔn ndɛ bubu: <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />«Mfam, ɔ̃sal a mɛ̃ oli bɔ ke nzɔ m’oluu b’emfaan, bvool amwɛn mpal yam bibi.» <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ èyebvuul ndɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Mbiri a mbwel-mbwel obveel ndɛ bubu: «Mfam, mɛ̃ ke mbvaan wɛ kwɛn yɛ sam onse nzɔ a mɛ̃. Yɛɛn kɛn a ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃, ɔ̃sal a mɛ̃ àbvuul! <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ebelweel amfam ba ke ywel a mɛ̃. Kɛn a mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ndi y'ambwel-mbwel ba ke nsɛn a mɛ̃ b'ayoo mɛ̃. Mɛ̃ ongyɛɛn ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn: “Yi!”, ndɛ oyɛn. Mɛ̃ ongyɛɛn wukyɛ wɛn: “Ya!”, ndɛ hɛ̃ oyi. Bvool okɛɛn mɛ̃ ntam ɔ̃sal a mɛ̃ wɛn: “Sa bubu!”, ndɛ hɛ̃ osi obobɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Ŋ'eyoo Yeso ãyɛɛn ã mbuul ondɛ, ndɛ okam, bu ayɛɛn ye baal b'ákeluɛɛn a ndɛ bubu: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ola mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'Isalayel, mɛ̃ kɛn amwɛn okiool bo bubu wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, baal bibi akieel afa etswi ki epal tal ye ki edziin lɔ. Bɔ akieel ayewal ãmboo, me ndɔɔ yi adza y'Abalayam, y'Isak ye Dzakab onse Okwɛn o ywel. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Kɛn akieel atyal baan b'Okwɛn onse empeel li onkwel-a-nzi. Oyɔ mboo yi elel y'otiɛɛn o miin.» <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso olieel mbiri a mbwel-mbwel ondɛ ndiri: «Yi ngesɛ, ki esɔɔ yɛ y’okiool, Nziã owi yɛ kyɛ!» Me lio alili, ɔ̃sal a ndɛ oyii nzuru kɛɛ-kɛɛ.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oboo anga-ãluu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mak 1.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oyɛn nzɔ a Piɛɛl. Oŋɔ̃, ndɛ oyebɔɔ okɔ o Piɛɛl wu ɔ̃kaal bɔ, ndɛ áli ye baa. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Yeso osiin ndɛ me kuɔɔl, ndɛ baa bu efi. Ndɛ otɛɛn, bu abvi osal me ndɔɔ a Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />M'ãnkunkwal, ayi Yeso ye baal bibi b'áluul m'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi. Ndɛ otswɛɛl ɛ̃fel omyɛ̃ kɛn a m'eyɛɛn ngelemɔ̃, bvool obvuul anga-ãluu bueel. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />M’emfa okyɛ, ŋ'ãsi m'élieel ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn Nziã Edzayi, ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">«Ndɛ owel elyam e bia-byɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">bvool obiri ãluu ã bia-byɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Edz 53.4</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">B'adzii k'anɔɔn a Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-60">Luk 9.57-60</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Ŋ'emwɛn Yeso embuul e baal ki édzii ndɛ, ndɛ otam ayio k’abwel ye ndɛ ongwel a baã. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Ɔ̃yiool-ãngel ngɔmɔ̃, osyel tsotsoo, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee, mɛ̃ ènɔɔn a yɛ ãmboo mam mbueel m'èyi yɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Ambwel ali y'ãywɛn m'akal, anywɛn hɛ̃ ali y'ãnzɔ. Kɛn a Muaan a mbuul k'ali ye mboo yi awuun wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Mbuul ɔ̃kyam onse ayio olieel Yeso bubu: «Mfam, mewa mɛ̃ kɛn nkuul yi eyedziool taal.» <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Kɛn a Yeso olieel ndɛ bubu: «Luɛɛn a mɛ̃, yɔɔl b'ákwi-ákwi adziool ebiĩ e bɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ oyɔ edzii k'eyɛɛn ndiri: Ɔ̃sal a yɛ ke w'adziool b'amakwa wɛ!</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:60">Luk 9.60</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso otɛɛl mfel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mak 4.35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso osam onse ebɛɛ, ayio a ndɛ aluɛɛn a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Enseel oŋɔ̃, mfel ndyam wa kokɔ obvi opob me nzal, m’emfa kyɛn epoo ebvi ebɛɛ oluul m'ãdza. Kɛn a Yeso áli me twal. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Ayio asyel tsotsoo a ndɛ, aseel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, Mfam, syool, bvuul bee, bee ol’ekwi!» <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yeso olieel bɔ ndiri: «Otsɛn omã b'eli byɛ ye buɔ, baal b'okiool otsi-tsiri!» Ndɛ bu atɛɛn apɛɛn mfel y'ãdza. Ɔ̃lii wa kokɔ bu abvi. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Ayio ɛ̃kam ɛ̃si, bu abvi ofuul bam-a-bam ndiri: «Wu mbuul wa bwɛn-a-bwɛn? Onkyam mfel ayoo ndɛ, ãdza hɛ̃ ãyoo ndɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso obvuul baal buaal b'áluul m'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Yeso otɔ ongwel a nzal k'ɔ̃kiri wu eli bviil li Ngelasa. Baal buaal b'áluul m'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi apal onse ãmpiɛɛn, ayemwɛɛn ye ndɛ. Baal obɔ áli ye kyal li bibi, m’emfa kyɛn k'éli ye mbuul wɛn al'okoo k'abwel me nkuul oyɔ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Bɔ bu abvi ɛ̃sɔɔl okuaal bubu: «Muaan a Nziã, yɛ ye bee ndɔɔ mã? Yɛ bee mpal yi otuaal ye k'ekoo lio li ètsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal?»<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, éli y'ɔ̃kel wu anguru wu ákedza m’opal obɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi ɛ̃lɛɛn Yeso ndiri: «Okɛɛn yɛ dzii k'atswɛɛl bee, meyuɔɔl bee onse ɔ̃kel wu anguru wu!» <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yeso bu alieel myɛ̃ ndiri: «Eyesam!» Myɛ̃ ɛ̃pal bu ɛ̃yesam onse anguru. Obobɔ, anguru bam bueel akuul nzuru nkal a nkio, ayeyiool onse nzal, bu adziin onse ãdza. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Baal b'ákekiaal anguru obɔ abal. Bɔ ayɛn ayetsal nsia a ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ã́bwel onse bviil, bvel-bvel m’ãbwel me baal b'áluul m'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Obobɔ, baal a bviil bueel ayemwɛɛn ye Yeso. Ŋ'emwɛn bɔ ndɛ, bɔ aluɔɔn ndɛ k'apal onse nsie a bɔ.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Yeso oboo ekal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mak 2.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yeso osam onse ebɛɛ, otsiil nzal, bu ayɛn bviil e ndɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bviil li aliaal ŋã, li Kapɛrnahum.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Etɔ oŋɔ̃, baal ayi ndɛ ye mbuul wu ekal wu áli bɔ nkal a ekal. Ŋ'emwɛn Yeso okiool o bɔ, ndɛ olieel mbuul ondɛ bubu: «Muaan a mɛ̃, kal ye mpɛn! Adzeel ãbi ã yɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Ayiool b'ãngel ke kwɛ abvi bam-a-bam oyɛɛn bubu: «Ngaburu wu asiaan Nziã!» <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Onge bɛn Yeso otaal ãtsam m'ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ, ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Ndɔɔ mã yi eli byɛ y'ãtsam m'ãbi-ãbi? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Ayɛɛn ndiri: “Adzeel ãbi ã yɛ”, oyɔ k'eli ndɔɔ yi mpal m'oyɛɛn wɛ, kɛn ayɛɛn ndiri: “Tɛɛn yi”, oyɔ ndɔɔ yi enduru mpal m'oyɛɛn! <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Ngesɛ, ebvaan byɛ eyɛɛ kwɛn Muaan a mbuul oli y'omfam b'adzeel ãbi me nsie yi.» Obobɔ, ndɛ wu Yeso olieel ekal okyɛ ndiri: «Tɛɛn, wal ekal e yɛ, bvool yi nzɔ!» <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Mbuul ondɛ hɛ̃ otɛɛn, bu ayɛn nzɔ. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Ŋ'emwɛn baal obobɔ, bɔ buɔ obɔɔ, bu alweel Nziã wu owi baal omfam b'obobɔ.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso oti Lebvi mbel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mak 2.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Ŋ'ékebwel Yeso, ndɛ omwɛn mbuul wu awal mpal wɛn nkuũ Lebvi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkuũ Lebvi hɛ̃ Matie.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 2:14-15">Mak 2.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27">Luk 5.27</ref></char></note>. Ndɛ áli me nsɛn ke mboo a ndɛ yi ɔ̃sal. Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Luɛɛn a mɛ̃.» Lebvi otɛɛn, bu aluɛɛn a ndɛ.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, Yeso ákedza onse nzɔ a Lebvi. Baal bibi b'awal mpal, ye baal b'ãbi akyam, ákedza ye ndɛ y'ayio a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Afalisaye ayemwɛn obobɔ, bɔ alieel ayio a ndɛ bubu: «Ndɔɔ mã yi edza Mfam a byɛ ye baal b'awal mpal, ye baal b'ãbi?» <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yeso ayoo obobɔ, olieel ndiri: «Baal ba kɛɛ-kɛɛ k'ali ye kɔɔ li ɔ̃boo wɛ, abieel b'ali ye kɔɔ e ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Eyefuul otsɛn b'ãndɔɔ m'ákel onse ɛ̃nkaan ndiri: “Mɛ̃ nzii osio o baal nyiĩ, k'ãkab wɛ.” Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ke ngyi me ndɔɔ yi eta baal ba dzu mbel wɛ, be yenta mɛ̃ mbel, baal b'ãbi.»<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oyɛɛn me ndɔɔ ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mak 2.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Obobɔ, ayio a Dzaã ayefuul Yeso bubu: «Bee y’Afalisaye ebesa ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal ɛ̃nswɛɛl-ɛ̃nswɛɛl. Ke ndɔɔ mã yɛn ayio a yɛ k’abesa mɔ̃ wɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yeso bu abveel bɔ bubu: «Andoo b’ɔ̃baal ol’akal me mpiri ŋ'eli ndɛ kɛn ye bɔ? Kɛn ãtsoo ãkieel ãya m'ambaal ɔ̃baal onse bɔ. Obobɔ, bɔ akieel obee odza m'ãlio omɔ̃.»<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />«K'eli ye mbuul wu abaan ekɔ ki tsɔɔn me mpɛɛl ekɔ ki enyiɔɔn wɛ. Ndɛ asa obobɔ, mpɛɛl ekɔ ki enyiɔɔn ol’embaal mpɛɛl ekɔ ki tsɔɔn. Pfee li ekɔ ki etsɔɔn bu eyii lam wuɔɔn. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Emfa kiki, k'abekaal mbal m'ãlili onse ãmfel m'ãmaayiil wɛ. Asa obobɔ, mbal m'alili ol’ãbwel ãmfel omɔ̃: Ãmfel ol’ãbool, mbal bu ãtsɔɔn me nsie. Mbal m'alili, ebvaan alɔ mɔ̃ kɛn onse ãmfel m'alili, obobɔ ãmfel ye mbal, àkwɛɛ mɔ̃ mam mbueel ngesɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Awi otsɛn b'ãmboo omɔ̃ onse ɔ̃nkaan wa Luk. </char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:33-38">Luk 5.33-38</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oboo ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ bvool oseel nsam ɔ̃kaal ngamɔ̃</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mak 5.21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Ŋ'ékeliaal Yeso bɔ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, pfa, mfam ngɔmɔ̃ oyi. Ndɛ obvi ãbuo ke nkwel a ndɛ, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Muaan a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃kaal otsuul mwĩi alili ŋã. Oŋɔ̃ ya, ndɔɔl ndɛ mviɔɔl, kwɛn ndɛ abvuul.» <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yeso otɛɛn, bu aluɛɛn a ndɛ y’ayio a ndɛ wu Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, éli y'ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ wu áli y'ãluu m'ékepal ndɛ ãkel. Ãluu omɔ̃ ál'ãmaayiil ye ndɛ mvel kuun ye yuaal. Ndɛ oyi ke mbee a Yeso, onywɛn me nswɛ a ekɔ e ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ ákeyɛɛn ndyam-a-ndyam ndiri: «Okɛɛn mɛ̃ nywɛn kɛn a m'ekɔ e ndɛ, mɛ̃ olɔ mvuul!» <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yeso atal mbee, omwɛn ndɛ, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Muaan a mɛ̃, kal ye mpɛn! Okiool o yɛ obvuul yɛ.» Kɛn a me lio alili, ɔ̃kaal ondɛ obvuul.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Ŋ'etɔ Yeso ke nzɔ a mfam ondɛ, ndɛ omwɛn baal b'ákefel ãnsiɛɛn ke ndwɔɔ ye b'ákesa nkyal. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Epal, ke ngwel wɛ nsam a ɔ̃kaal k'akwi wɛ, ndɛ twal alaal.» Kɛn a bɔ abvi ndɛ osyob. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Ŋ’apaal baal nkwel-a-nzi, Yeso osam onse nzɔ, osiin nsam ɔ̃kaal me kuɔɔl, ndɛ bu asiool. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Nsia oyɔ bu etsɔɔn m'etwi e nsie kyam kieel.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oboo baal buaal b'ékwi mviil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Ŋ’embal Yeso oŋɔ̃, ɛ̃nkwa-mviil mviaal ɛ̃yii ɛ̃luɛɛn a ndɛ, bvool ɛ̃yii ɛ̃biool ndiri: «Muaan a David<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Muaan» wu ayɛɛn ŋã, ɔ̃tiɔɔl. </char></note>, sio bee nyiĩ!» <verse eid="MAT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Ŋ'etɔ Yeso nzɔ, baal b'ɛ̃kwa-mviil o bɔ asyel tsotsoo a ndɛ, ndɛ bu afuul bɔ bubu: «Byɛ ekiool wɛn mɛ̃ nkoo k'esa obobɔ?» Bɔ akiool ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃, Mfam!» <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Obobɔ, Yeso osiin mviil ã bɔ, bu alieel ndiri: «Yɔɔl kwɛn asa byɛ ãndɔɔ m’emfa ki ekiool byɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Ɛ̃kiri-anka oŋɔ̃, mviil ã bɔ ãdzweel nzuru. Yeso bu awi bɔ ãnkunkwa ndiri: «Mbuul ndɔɔ oyɔ oyɛɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Kɛn a ŋ'epal baal obɔ onse nzɔ, bɔ atsal nsia a Yeso m'etswi e nsie kieel.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oboo nkɛn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:14-15">Luk 11.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Ŋ'eyii eyi bɔ, ayi a Yeso mbuul wu áluul m'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi wu ákesa kwɛn ndɛ k’ákeyɛɛn wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Ŋ'etswɛɛl Yeso ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi, mbuul ondɛ obvi oyɛɛn. Baal akam bvool ayɛɛn ndiri: «Ndɔɔ yi bubu, lɔɔ-okal kɛn emwɛn yɔ m'Isalayɛl wɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Kɛn Afalisaye ayɛɛn ndiri: «Ndɛ abetswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi me waan e mfam a myɛ̃!»<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso y'embuul e baal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mak 6.34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:2">Luk 10.2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yeso ákedzuu m'ãla y'ãbviil mbueel, ndɛ ákeyiool m'ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn ã bɔ, áketsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Okwɛn o Nziã bvool ákeboo ãluu mbueel y'elyam bvieel. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ embuul e baal, ndɛ nyiĩ a bɔ yam ebɔɔ, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ al'ayii ɛ̃kwal ke ywel bvool nzuru alemeesool, onge emɛ̃mɛɛ̃ bvi eywɛn a ɔ̃nkiaal. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Obobɔ, ndɛ olieel ayio a ndɛ ndiri: «Nsia yi aka onse nguun eli bibi, kɛn asal ali atsi-tsiri! <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Oŋɔ̃ ebuɛɛn nga-nguun kwɛn ndɛ ayuɔɔl asal onse nguun a ndɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Antam kuun ye buaal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mak 3.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Ŋ'eti Yeso ayio a ndɛ kuun ye buaal mbel, ndɛ owi bɔ waan li atswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi, bvool aboo ãluu mbueel y'elyam bvieel. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Tal ãnkuũ m'antam kuun ye buaal: wu ɛ̃kwel Simɔ̃ wu ata me Piɛɛl, y'Andele wu muaan-ngoo a ndɛ, ye Dzak wu muaan a Dzebede, ye Dzaã wu muaan-ngoo a ndɛ, <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />ye Filipe, ye Balatelemi, ye Toma, ye Matie wu ɔ̃twal-mpal, ye Dzak wu muaan a Alefe, ye Tade, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />ye Simɔ̃ wa nkel yi Adzelot, ye Yuda wu Isikaliot wu átiɔ Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oyuɔɔl antam ange-kuun ye buaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yeso otam baal ange-kuun ye buaal obɔ, bu awi bɔ ãluo y’ãnkunkwa mã: «Ebee ola baal bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ oyi, ebee hɛ̃ onse bviil li Afi-Samali osam. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Eyi ol’emɛmɛɛ̃ bvi nzɔ a Isalayɛl bvi edziɔɔn. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Me nkuul a nkuul, eyi etee wɛn Okwɛn o ywel osyel tsotsoo. <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Eboo ba y'ãluu, eseel b'ákwi, esuul ba y'ãluu me leba akal tsɛtsɛ, etswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ẽbi-ẽbi. Awi byɛ ngwel, ewa hɛ̃ ngwel. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Ebee ɔɔl obiri, ekal nzi, ekal nzi yi ãbvieel, onse posi. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Ebee ɔ̃paa a dzwɛ obiri, ekal ekɔ bviaal, ekal asimpal, ekal ɔ̃mpaã, ke ngwel wu asal obvaan k’abɔɔ bvi-odza e ndɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />«Onse bviil lam lueel wuo onse ola bam bueel b'èsam byɛ, efuul mbuul wu obvaan m'oyɔɔ o byɛ, oŋɔ̃ ekal ola ndɛ tiil ye k'eyi byɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Ŋ’èsam byɛ onse nzɔ, ebio baal a nzɔ oyɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Okɛɛn bɔ ayɔɔ byɛ, opi o byɛ òkal ye bɔ. Okɛɛn bɔ k'ayɔɔ byɛ wɛ, opi o byɛ òkɔɔl ola byam. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Okɛɛn, onse nzɔ ngamɔ̃ wuo onse bviil ngelemɔ̃, k'ayɔɔ byɛ wɛ, wuo k'ayoo ãyɛɛn ã byɛ, embal oŋɔ̃ bvool ekweel ɔ̃fel a ntaã e byɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, me tsoo li ètsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal, fool li baal a Sodome ye Gomɔɔl ekieel ekal nkuual-a-nkuaal a fool li baal b'ãmboo omɔ̃.»<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãmpal m'akieel atuual baal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mak 13.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21.12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />Etal, mɛ̃ ngyuɔɔl byɛ onge emɛmɛɛ̃ onse anyam a mpuru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anyam obɔ ali onge amva b'edzwa.</char></note>: Ekal angɔ-mwiĩ onge antaal, ekal ankinkyam onge ãkuun. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Ekal y’onkyab, ke ngwel wɛ baal akieel abiri byɛ k'ãmbal m'ãnɛn m'Ayuda bvool apfel byɛ ɔ̃dzii onse ãnzɔ ã bɔ m'ãbuɛɛn. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Akieel abiri byɛ ke nkwel ambiri y'akwɛn, me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃. Obobɔ, byɛ ekieel eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ ke nkwel a bɔ bvool ke nkwel a baal bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Ŋ'akieel abiri byɛ k’ãmbal, ebee nguo okɛɛ me b'èyɛɛn byɛ wuo m'emfa ki eyɛɛn byɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, kɛn a me lio alili, Nziã ndyam akieel awa byɛ ãyɛɛn m’èyɛɛn byɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ ke b'ekieel eyɛɛn wɛ, Ɔ̃fel a Tal a byɛ wu akieel ayɛɛn onse byɛ.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />«Muaan-ngoo akieel atiɔ muaan-ngoo kwɛn abam ndɛ. Tal akieel atiɔ muaan. Baan akieel akal ataal a tal ye ngoo, bvool akieel asa kwɛn awa bɔ etumbu ki lepfu. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Baal bueel akieel abyal byɛ me ndɔɔ a nkuũ a mɛ̃. Kɛn a wu akieel akuru ɔ̃kwal tiil ntɔ, wu akieel abvuul.»<verse eid="MAT 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />«Ŋ'akieel atuaal byɛ mpal onse bviil ngelemɔ̃, ebal onse likyɛ. Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ye k'eya Muaan a mbuul, byɛ olɔ kɛn eman k'edziɔɔn ãbviil mbueel m'Isalayel wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />«Ɔ̃yio k'anduru ɔ̃yiool a ndɛ wɛ, ɔ̃nkyal hɛ̃ si ngɔmɔ̃ wu onduru mfam a ndɛ pyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Ki ebvaan m’ɔ̃yio, ki àkal onge ɔ̃yiool a ndɛ, ki ebvaan m’ɔ̃nkyal hɛ̃ ki àkal onge mfam a ndɛ. Okɛɛn mfam a nzɔ ati me Beledzebule, oŋɔ̃ yɛn k'àyɛɛn me baal a nzɔ a ndɛ wɛ mã!»<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuul wɛn ebvaan abal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luk 12.2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />«Obobɔ, ebee ye buɔ o baal okal, ke ngwel wɛ ndɔɔ yam yueel yi eli m'odziɔɔn ekieel epal kal-a-kal. Ndɔɔ yam yueel hɛ̃ yi eli m'ofoo, akieel ayɛɛ yɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Ndɔɔ yi eyɛɛn mɛ̃ byɛ onse empeel, eyɛɛn yɔ me mwiĩ. Ndɔɔ yi eyɛɛn mɛ̃ byɛ m'ãmfi-mfya, etee yɔ ke ywel a sɛɛ e nzɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Ebee baal b'abam nzuru a mbuul obal. Bɔ k'akoo k'abam omwiĩ wɛ. Wu ebal byɛ Nziã wu koo k'abam nzuru a mbuul y'omwiĩ o ndɛ onse ywɛn e mbaa. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />«K'abetiɔ answiĩ buaal m'enzi-nzi etsi-tsiri wɛ? Kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ k'akoo k'abva me nsie wɛ, okɛɛn Tal a byɛ k'awi nkuul wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Me b'otal byɛ, onkyam mpfu y'ɔ̃tswɛ a byɛ, Nziã oyɛɛ ɔ̃bvɛn a yɔ. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Oŋɔ̃ ebee ye buɔ okal. Byɛ eli y'ɔ̃bvɛn, enduru ɔ̃bɔbɔ wu answiĩ.»<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />«Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mbuul wu akiool ke nkwel a baal ndiri ndɛ oli wa mɛ̃, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ekieel ekiool ndɛ ke nkwel a Tal a mɛ̃ wa ke ywel. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Kɛn a mbuul wu abee mɛ̃ ke nkwel a baal, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ekieel ebee ndɛ ke nkwel Tal a mɛ̃ wa ke ywel.»<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">K'opi wɛ, epwel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12.51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />«Ebee otsam wɛn mɛ̃ ngyi y’opi onse ɔ̃kiri: Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, mɛ̃ ke ngyi y’opi wɛ, ki ngyi mɛ̃ ye kyɛ epwel e mvel. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Taa-taa, mɛ̃ ngyi ye ndɔ eka mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a muaan ye tal, mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a muaan wu ɔ̃kaal ye ngoo, mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ ɔ̃kal a muaan y'okɔ wu ɔ̃kaal: <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Ataal a mbuul akieel akal baal a nzɔ a ndyam.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mis 7.6</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuru o nzuru me Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:34-35">Mak 8.34-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23-24">Luk 9.23-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />«Mbuul wɛn dzii li edzii ndɛ tal a ndɛ wuo ngoo a ndɛ enduru li edzii ndɛ mɛ̃, k'abvaan me mɛ̃ wɛ. Mbuul wɛn dzii li edzii ndɛ muaan a ndɛ wu bɔɔl wuo wu ɔ̃kaal enduru li edzii mɛ̃, k'abvaan me mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Mbuul wɛn k'abiri enkulusu e ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi anɔɔn a mɛ̃ wɛ, k'abvaan me mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Mbuul wu odzii k'abvuul elaã e ndɛ, àywɛn a lɔ. Kɛn a mbuul wu àywɛn a elaã e ndɛ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃, àbɔɔ lɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebvakab</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mak 9.41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />«Mbuul wu ayɔɔ byɛ, mɛ̃ ayɔɔ. Mbuul wu ayɔɔ mɛ̃, ŋ’ayɔɔ wu oyuɔɔl mɛ̃. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Mbuul wu ayɔɔ ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ oli ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn, ndɛ àbɔɔ ebvakab kiki y’ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn. Mbuul wu ayɔɔ mbuul wa dzu me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ oli dzu, ndɛ àbɔɔ ebvakab kiki ye mbuul wa dzu. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mbuul wu awa onkyam mbiɔ a ãdza m’efyɛ ola ngɔmɔ̃ onse b’atsi-atsi ba, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ oli ɔ̃yio a mɛ̃, taa-taa bam, ndɛ k’akoo k’aywɛn ebvakab ki ndɛ wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Ayio b'etam Dzaã Batis ola Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luk 7.18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Ŋ'eman Yeso k'atam ayio a ndɛ kuun ye buaal ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ osa, ndɛ ombal oŋɔ̃, bu ayɛn oyiool y'otee m'ãbviil ã bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Dzaã onse bwal, oyoo nsia a ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ Mãsia. Obobɔ, ndɛ oyuɔɔl ayio a ndɛ ayefuul ndɛ ndiri: <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />«Yɛ Mãsia wu àya, wuo bee ekiaal mbuul ɔ̃kyam?» <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Eyeyɛɛn Dzaã ãndɔɔ m'emwɛn byɛ ye m'eyoo byɛ: <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />B'ékwi mviil ayii amwɛn ngesɛ, b'adzuu tetɔɔ̃ abvi odzuu ngesɛ, ba y'ãluu me leba ayii tsɛtsɛ, ankɛn ayii ayoo, b'ákwi ayii asiool, aywal hɛ̃ ayii ayoo Nsia yi Ngesɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:18-19">Edz 29.18-19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">35.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">61.1-2</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Esɛ ola mbuul wɛn k'ayɔɔl okiool o ndɛ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ wɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Ŋ'ekɔɔl ayio a Dzaã, Yeso obvi oyɛɛn ye baal b'áli oŋɔ̃ me ndɔɔ a ndɛ wu Dzaã. Ndɛ ofuul bɔ ndiri: «Ki eyetal byɛ nkal ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ emã? Ɔ̃mbɛɛl wa tyob-tyob wu enziool mfel? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Byɛ nã eyetal? Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu olaal ekɔ bvi ɔ̃bvɛn? Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃! Ke ngwel wɛ, baal b'abelaal ekɔ bvi ɔ̃bvɛn, bɔ abekal onse ãnzɔ m'akwɛn! <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />K'obobɔ, wu eyetal byɛ nã? Ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã? Hɛɛ̃, taa-taa! Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ndɛ bam onduru ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã! <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Dzaã oli mbuul wɛn ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã me ndɔɔ a ndɛ ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">“Tal, mɛ̃ èyuɔɔl ntam a mɛ̃ atsɔɔn nkwel a yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">me ndɔɔ yi ayɛɛl ɔ̃siɔɔn ke nkwel a yɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="MAT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, onse baal bam bueel b'áburu m'oburu, k'eli ye mbuul wu ánduru Dzaã wɛ. Kɛn a onse Okwɛn o Nziã, mbuul wu obvool mbee wu ondruru ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Bɛɛn me lio li Dzaã Batis tiil nonɔ̃ ŋã, Okwɛn o ywel oyii ndɔɔ a mpɛn, anga-mpɛn baal b'awɛɛl bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Ke ngwel wɛ, tiil lio li Dzaã, aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã bueel ye ngel a Moyize álieel ãndɔɔ m'ã́fi ola Nziã. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Okɛɛn byɛ edzii k'ekiool b'eyɛɛn mɛ̃, Dzaã oli Eli wu ákeya ondɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Yɔɔl kwɛn wu oli y'ãtswi m'ayoo, ayoo!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ baal ba nonɔ̃ ba y'anã emvɛɛl bɔ? Bɔ ali onge baan b'abvi nsɛn ke taan, abiool bakyɛ ndiri: <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />“Bee efel byɛ nsiɛɛn, byɛ k'ekɛn wɛ! Bee eyam byɛ ãnziĩ m'ãwua, byɛ hɛ̃ k'elel wɛ!” <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Dzaã oyi, ndɛ k'ákedza wɛ, ndɛ k'ákenywã wɛ, bɔ atɔ m'oliaal ndiri: “Ndɛ oli y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi!” <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Muaan a mbuul oyi, adza, anywã, bɔ bvool atɔ m'oliaal ndiri: “Etal ngaburu wu! Ndɛ ɔ̃sal kɛn odza y'onywã! Ndɛ oli ndoo a atwal-mpal y'ãnga-ãbi!” Kɛn ãyal ã Nziã ãmɔɔn m'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãbviil m'ãbee Yeso okiool</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:15">Mat 10.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12-15">Luk 10.12-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Obobɔ, Yeso obvi ãmbyel mã kokɔ owa m'ãbviil m'ési ndɛ emwã bibi onse mɔ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, baal a mɔ̃ k'ákaal ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />Ndɛ olieel ndiri: «Ãwua ola yɛ, yɛ wu bviil li Koladzin! Ãwua ola yɛ, yɛ wu bviil li Betesayida! Ke ngwel wɛ, emwã bvi esi Nziã ola byɛ, okɛɛn ndɛ asi bvɛ ke bviil li Tiil ye li Sidɔ̃, kɛn baal b'okɔ ol'akaalaal angɔrɔ, bvool akaakel efuru me nzuru, me ndɔɔ yi asuo kwɛn bɔ akaal ɛ̃kwal<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Edz 23.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26">Ezk 26</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 4:4-8">Dzo 4.4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo 1.9-10</ref></char></note>! <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, me tsoo li ekieel etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal, fool li baal ba Tiil ye ba Sidɔ̃ ekieel ekal nkuaal-a-nkuaal a li byɛ. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Me b'otal yɛ, yɛ wu bviil li Kapelanahum, yɛ atsam wɛn àndɛɛl yɛ tiil ke ywel? Mfya, Nziã akieel akweel yɛ tiil k'ola o b'ákwi-ákwi. Ke ngwel wɛ, emwã bvi esi Nziã ola yɛ, okɛɛn ndɛ asi bvɛ ke Sodom, kɛn bviil olɔ ol'eli tiil nonɔ̃ ŋã<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Obɛ 19.24-28</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, me tsoo li ekieel etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal, fool li baal ba Sodom ekieel ekal nkuaal-a-nkuaal a li yɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eya ola mɛ̃ kwɛn byɛ ebɔɔ owuun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk 10.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Me lio olɔ, Yeso abvuru oyɛɛn, olieel ndiri: «Taal, Mfam a ywel ye nsie, mɛ̃ mveel yɛ ãtuɛɛn, ke ngwel wɛ yɛ alwɔɔn ãndɔɔ mã ol'anga-ãyal y'anga-ɛ̃nkaan. Kɛn a yɛ suo mɔ̃ ola baal b'ali onge baan b'abwee. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Taa-taa Taal, yɛ ádzii bam kwɛn ekal obobɔ. <verse eid="MAT 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Tal a mɛ̃ owi mɛ̃ eluɔ bvam bvieel. Mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'ayɛɛ Muaan wɛ, okɛɛn ke Taal wɛ, mbuul hɛ̃ si ngɔmɔ̃ k'ayɛɛ Taal wɛ, okɛɛn ke Muaan wɛ, ye mbuul wɛn Muaan odzii k'asuo ndɛ Taal.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Eya ola mɛ̃, byɛ bam bueel b'emeefa ɛ̃wuun m'olyam b'ãpfuũ, obobɔ mɛ̃ ndyam esa kwɛn byɛ ewuun. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Ebiri pfuũ e mɛ̃, bvool eyɔɔl kwɛn mɛ̃ ngyiool byɛ! Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ndi mbuul wu ɔ̃kwal ngesɛ bvool ke ndi y'ondɛɛl o nzuru wɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ èbɔɔ owuun. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Ke ngwel wɛ, pfuũ li endɔɔl mɛ̃ nkal a byɛ, k'eli ye mpal m'obiri wɛ, ki ewa mɛ̃ byɛ obiri hɛ̃ eli yɛɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso olieel me ndɔɔ a saba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mak 2.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />M'ãtsoo omɔ̃, Yeso ákebwel onse nguun a bele, éli me tsoo li saba. Ayio a ndɛ ayoo nzal. Bɔ abvi nsia e bele oka, bvool abvi yɔ odza. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Afalisaye amwɛn obobɔ, alieel ndɛ bubu: «Tal, ayio a yɛ abesa ãndɔɔ m'eluo ãngel baal osa me tsoo e saba.» <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Kɛn a ndɛ obveel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ k'etsiɔ m'ési David wɛ? Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, ndɛ ye b'áli ye ndɛ ayoo nzal. <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Ndɛ osam onse Nzɔ a Nziã, bu adzi amampa b'áwi Nziã ãkab, ndɛ ye b'áli ye ndɛ, okyam ŋɛn ãngel ã Moyize ãliaal ndiri ekal ndɛ, ekal b'áli ye ndɛ, k'akoo k'adza amampa obɔ wɛ, b'adza bɔ kɛn angaa-a-Nziã. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Byɛ kɛn etsiɔ hɛ̃ wɛ kwɛn onse Ngel, me tsoo e saba, angaa-a-Nziã b'abesal onse Nzɔ a Nziã abefel ngel a saba? Onkyam ŋɛn bɔ asi obobɔ, bɔ k'ali y'obi oŋɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, eli ye mbuul ŋã wu onduru Nzɔ a Nziã bvɛɛ! <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Okɛɛn byɛ al'ebɔɔ otsɛn o ndɔɔ yi: “Ki nzii mɛ̃ k'esio mɛ̃ baal nyiĩ, k'ãkab wɛ”,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Odz 6.6</ref></char></note> kɛn byɛ k'ekeewa ansoo ba mbyel wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Muaan a mbuul oli Mfam a tsoo e saba.»<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuul wu ékwi kuɔɔl</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mak 3.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yeso ombal oŋɔ̃, bu ayɛn onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn a bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Oŋɔ̃, éli ye mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu ékwi kuɔɔl. Obobɔ, afuul Yeso ndiri: «Me tsoo li saba, akoo k'aboo mbuul?» Bɔ afuul obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yi abii elyal ki afɛn ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Nã onse byɛ wɛn okɛɛn ndɛ oli y'emɛ̃mɛɛ̃ kɛn a ngemɔ̃, ŋɛn kyɛ ebvi onse ywɛn me tsoo li saba, ndɛ k'ayesiin kyɛ, me ndɔɔ yi apaal kyɛ onse okɔ wɛ? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Mbuul k'anduru emɛmɛɛ̃ m'ɔ̃bvɛn wɛ! Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, me tsoo li saba, akoo k'asa obvɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Obobɔ, Yeso olieel mbuul wu ékwi kuɔɔl ondɛ ndiri: «Naan kuɔɔl e yɛ!» Ndɛ onaan kyɛ, kyɛ bu ebvaan onge kimɔ̃. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Afalisaye apal ayekuru mfoo me ndɔɔ yi abii ãyal m'abam Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃sal wu esueel Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Ŋ'ebɔɔ Yeso nsia oyɔ, ndɛ odzuru nzuru osyel lala ye mboo oyɔ. Ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal aluɛɛn a ndɛ. Ndɛ oboo anga-ãluu bueel. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Kɛn a ndɛ owi bɔ ãnkunkwa bam kokɔ ndiri: «Ebee baal oliaal ndiri mɛ̃ nã ndi.» <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Oŋɔ̃ ŋ’ekoo ndɔɔ yi élieel ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã Edzayi ndiri:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />«Tal ɔ̃sal a mɛ̃ wu nsueel mɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">mbuul a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃tio, wu ndi mɛ̃ y’esɛ me ndɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Mɛ̃ èndɔɔl Ɔ̃fel a mɛ̃ nkal a ndɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">bvool ndɛ àtee ãndɔɔ mã dzu ola baal b'ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃kyam.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Ndɛ k'àbii ɛ̃tsuun wɛ, ndɛ k’àbiool wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">bvool mbuul k'àyoo nkii a ndɛ m'abal-bal wɛ.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Ndɛ k'àbuɔɔl ɔ̃mbɛɛl wu amaayiɔɔn wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">bvool k'àdzeel mbunda wu oyii adzam wɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">tiil ye k'esa ndɛ kwɛn ãndɔɔ mã dzu ãbvel mpɛn.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />M’emfa okyɛ, ɛ̃kiri mvieel ɛ̃kieel ɛ̃ta kaã ɛ̃ myɛ̃ me nkuũ a ndɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Edz 42.1-4</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso atswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi m'Ɔ̃fel a Nziã</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:22-30">Mak 3.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Obobɔ, abiri Yeso mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu ékwi mviil bvool áli nkɛn, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ áli y’ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi. Yeso oboo ndɛ, obobɔ ndɛ obvi oyɛɛn bvool obvi omwɛn. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Embuul ki éli oŋɔ̃ ekam bibi, bvool eyɛɛn bubu: «Mbuul wu ke Muaan a David wɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Ŋ'eyoo Afalisaye obobɔ, bɔ ayɛɛn ndiri: «Mbuul wu atswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi kɛn a me mpɛn a Beledzebul wu mfam a myɛ̃!» <verse eid="MAT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Kɛn onge bɛn Yeso ákeyɛɛ ãtsam ã bɔ, ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Okɛɛn baal b'okwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ adzwaan bam-a-bam, okwɛn obɔ osiɛɛn k'obva, bvool bviil lueel wuo nzɔ yɛn baal adzwaan bam-a-bam, bviil wuo nzɔ oyɔ k'ekoo k'esiɛɛn wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Okɛɛn Ɔ̃pfu atswɛɛl Ɔ̃pfu, ndɛ ŋ'akab nzuru ndyam-a-ndyam. M’emfa okyɛ, okwɛn o ndɛ otɛɛn bwɛn-a-bwɛn? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Emfa kiki, okɛɛn mpɛn yi etswɛɛl mɛ̃ ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi yi ewa Beledzebule mɛ̃, ke baan a byɛ, bɔ myɛ̃ me mpɛn a nã abetswɛɛl? Obɔ otsɛn bɛn bɔ bam àsuo kwɛn byɛ k'eli y'ɔ̃dzoo wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Kɛn okɛɛn mɛ̃ etswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi m'Ɔ̃fel a Nziã, ŋ'esuo kwɛn Okwɛn o Nziã oyi ola byɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Emfa emã kyɛn mbuul okoo k'asam onse nzɔ a nga-mpɛn bvool owɛɛl eluɔ e ndɛ, okɛɛn ndɛ tsɔɔn k'akuru nga-mpɛn ondɛ ebwal wɛ? Ndɛ akuru ndɛ ebwal, ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ fu akuaal opfel o nzɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Mbuul wɛn k'ali ye mɛ̃ wɛ, ɔ̃taal a mɛ̃ ali. Mbuul hɛ̃ wɛn k'abvool baal ye mɛ̃ wɛ, wu atsal. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, obi bueel y'osiaan bueel, akieel adzeel bɔ. Kɛn osiaan b’Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, k'akieel adzeel bɔ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Mbuul wu ayɛɛn obi-obi me mɛ̃ wu Muaan a mbuul, akieel adzeel ndɛ. Kɛn a wu asiaan Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, k'akieel adzeel ndɛ wɛ, ekal me lio li, ekal me lio li ekieel eya.»<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abeyɛɛ ɔ̃ti me nsia e ndɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />«Okɛɛn ɔ̃ti oli ngesɛ, nsia e ndɛ hɛ̃ èkal ngesɛ. Okɛɛn ɔ̃ti oli y'oluu, nsia e ndɛ hɛ̃ èkal mbi-mbi. Ke ngwel wɛ, abeyɛɛ ɔ̃ti me nsia e ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Byɛ yam li ebi-ebi eli onge ampel! Byɛ baal b'abi-abi, emfa emã kyɛn byɛ ekoo k'eyɛɛn ãndɔɔ mã ngesɛ? Ke ngwel wɛ, ɔ̃nywã a mbuul apaal ãndɔɔ m'ãluul tɔ onse ɔ̃kwal a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Mbuul wa ngesɛ abepaal eluɔ bvi ngesɛ onse nkab a ndɛ yi mvɛ. Mbuul wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi hɛ̃ abepaal eluɔ bvi ebi-ebi onse nkab a ndɛ yi mbi. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ bubu: Me tsoo li ekieel etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal, baal kieel ayeyɛɛn m'ãndɔɔ mɛn otsɛn pyɛ m'élieel-élieel bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Ke ngwel wɛ, m'ãyɛɛn ã yɛ, yɛ akieel apal ɔ̃nkikyam, m'ãyɛɛn ã yɛ hɛ̃, yɛ akieel abva.»<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emvieel ki Yonas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mak 8.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11.29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Obobɔ, ayiool b'ãngel y'Afalisaye ke kwɛ alieel Yeso ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee, bee edzii k'emwɛn emvieel ki efa ola yɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Baal b'alio li ali baal b'abi-abi bvool k'akuru nzuru me Nziã wɛ, bɔ abii emvieel, k'eli y'emvieel ekyam ki asuo bɔ wɛ, emvieel ki asuo bɔ kɛn a ki Yonas<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1">Dzn 1</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Taa-taa bam, emfa ngemɔ̃ kyɛn Yonas ásii apipi atyel y'atsia atyel onse mwiĩ a nswi wu ɔ̃nɛn, emfa kiki hɛ̃, Muaan a mbuul akieel asii apipi atyel y'atsia atyel onse nsie. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Me tsoo li ekieel etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal, baal ba Ninibve akieel atɛɛn me ndɔɔ yi awa baal ba lio li etumbu, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ ákaal ɛ̃kwal ke mbee ãtee ã Yonas. Etal, ŋã eli ye wu onduru Yonas. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Me tsoo li ekieel etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal, ɔ̃kwɛn wu ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃kiri wu etswi ki nsɛn akieel atɛɛn, me ndɔɔ yi awa baal ba lio li etumbu, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ áfi lala me ndɔɔ yi ayeyoo ãndɔɔ m'ékeyɛɛn Salomɔ̃<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1Ak 10.1-10</ref></char></note> y'ɔ̃nyia wueel. Etal, ŋã eli ye wu onduru Salomɔ̃!»<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obvool b'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11.24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />«Ŋɛn ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi opal onse mbuul, ndɛ ayi ayebii mboo yi awuun onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ, kɛn a ndɛ k'abɔɔ yɔ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />Obobɔ, ndɛ ayɛɛn ndyam-a-ndyam ndiri: “Mɛ̃ èbvool ke onse nzɔ yi epal mɛ̃ onse yɔ tsɔɔn.” Ŋ'ebvool ndɛ, ndɛ oyebɔɔ yɔ amaakuɔɔn, bvool amaafaal eluɔ ngesɛ-ngesɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Obobɔ, ndɛ akɔɔl ayebii ɛ̃fel ɛ̃kyam nsiaan mi ɛ̃nduru ndɛ obi. Ndɛ abiri myɛ̃, ɛ̃yesam onse nzɔ oyɔ. Elaã e mbuul ondɛ enduru li eli tsɔɔn me fool.»<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngoo ye baan-ngoo a Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mak 3.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Me lio li ékeyɛɛn Yeso kɛn y'embuul, tal ngoo ye baan-ngoo a ndɛ b'áli ke nzi ákedzii k'ayɛɛn ye ndɛ. Kɛn a bɔ k'akoo k'amwɛɛn ye ndɛ wɛ, me ndɔɔ embuul. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Mbuul bu ayɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: «Ngoo ye baan-ngoo a yɛ ali okwel-a-nzi, bɔ adzii k'ayɛɛn ye yɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Kɛn a Yeso obveel mbuul wu ákeyɛɛn ye ndɛ ndiri: «Ngoo a mɛ̃ nã? Baan-ngoo a mɛ̃ anã?» <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Obobɔ, nde onaan kuɔɔl ola ayio a ndɛ, bu alieel ndiri: «Tal ngoo a mɛ̃ ye baan-ngoo a mɛ̃! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu asa b'edzii Tal a mɛ̃ wu oli ke ywel, ondɛ muaan-ngoo a mɛ̃, nkyel a mɛ̃, ngoo a mɛ̃.»<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso atee m'ãmboo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-52">13.1-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s2">Mboo a ɔ̃kwɛn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mak 4.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Tsoo olɔ, Yeso opal onse nzɔ, bvool oyebva nsɛn nku-a-nku a baã. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Embuul ki bibi edzii ndɛ, m'emfa kyɛn ndɛ osam onse ebɛɛ, bu abvi nsɛn. Embuul éli k'ekwel. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Ndɛ obvi bɔ ãndɔɔ bibi oliaal m'ãmboo. Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Ɔ̃kwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ opal me ndɔɔ yi akwɛn nsia. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Me lio li ékeyiri ndɛ yɔ, yinkyɛ ebvi me pyɛ e nkuul, anywɛn ayedza yɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Nsia yinkyɛ ebvi ke mboo yi eli y'ãnkɔɔn, oŋɔ̃ nsie k'éli bibi wɛ. Yɔ emɛn tswa-a-tswa, nzal-a-ŋɛn yɔ k'ebɔɔ nsie yi eli ye dzio wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Kɛn a ŋ'epal mwiĩ, ɛ̃swɛɛn ɛ̃dzio, myɛ̃ bu ɛ̃kɛɛ, ke ngwel wɛ myɛ̃ k'ɛ̃́li y'ɛ̃dza wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Nsia yinkyɛ bvool ebvi onse ekwɛn bvi ãnsiɛɛn. Ekwɛn obvɛ ekwel bvool efoo ɛ̃swɛɛn omyɛ̃. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Kɛn a nsia yinkyɛ ebvi nkal a nsie yi ngesɛ. Yɔ emɛn, bvool eburu. Lɛn eburu nsia ɔ̃nkam, lɛn ãku-ãsɛɛn, lɛn ãku-ãtyel.» <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Ndɛ bvool olweel ndiri: «Yɔɔl kwɛn wu oli y'ãtswi m'ayoo, ayoo!»<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otsɛn b'ebeyɛɛn Yeso m'ãmboo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mak 4.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Ayio asyel tsotsoo a Ndɛ, bu afuul ndɛ bubu: «Otsɛn omã b'ebeyɛɛn yɛ ye bɔ m'ãmboo?» <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ, awi byɛ nkuul yi eyɛɛ ãndɔɔ m'ãli m'elwɔɔn, m'ãtal Okwɛn o ywel. Kɛn a bɔ, bɔ k'abɔɔ nkuul oyɔ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Ke ngwel wɛ, wu oli y'eluɔ, àlweel ndɛ ekyam, kwɛn ndɛ abɔɔ bvi enduru. Kɛn a wu oywɛn a eluɔ, àwɛɛl ndɛ onkyam ki etsi-tsiri ki eli a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Obɔ otsɛn b'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ ye bɔ m'ãmboo, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ atal, ki amwɛn pyɛ, bɔ apio tswi, ki ayoo pyɛ, ki akwaal otsɛn hɛ̃ pyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />M'emfa okyɛ, me ndɔɔ a bɔ, ŋ'ekoo ndɔɔ yi élieel ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã Edzayi ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“Byɛ eyoo bam ngesɛ, ki ekwaal byɛ otsɛn kyam pyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">Byɛ etal, ki emwɛn byɛ kyam pyɛ.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ɔ̃kwal a yam li oyii y'olyam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">ãtswi ã bɔ ãyii embi, bɔ akuru mviil,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">kwɛn bɔ abee omwɛn me mviil ã bɔ, abee oyoo m'ãtswi ã bɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">abee otsɛn okwaal m'ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">abee ɛ̃kwal okaal, kwɛn mɛ̃ mbee hɛ̃ bɔ oboo<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Edz 6.9-10</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />«Kɛn a byɛ, esɛ eli ola byɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mviil ã byɛ ãmwɛn bvool ãtswi ã byɛ ãyoo! <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã bibi ye baal ba dzu ádzii k'amwɛn m'emwɛn byɛ, kɛn a bɔ k'ámwɛn mɔ̃ wɛ! Bɔ ádzii k'ayoo m'eyoo byɛ, kɛn a bɔ k'áyoo mɔ̃ wɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otsɛn o mboo a ɔ̃kwɛn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mak 4.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />«Oŋɔ̃ eyoo otsɛn o mboo a ɔ̃kwɛn: <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Ŋ'eyoo mbuul endɔɔ li Okwɛn, k'abɔɔ lɔ otsɛn wɛ, ŋɛn Ɔ̃taal oyi bvool ombaal nsia yi akwɛn onse ɔ̃kwal a ndɛ. Obɔ otsɛn o nsia yi ebvi me pyɛ e nkuul. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Nsia yi ebvi onse nsie yi y'ãnkɔɔn, eli mbuul wɛn ŋ'eyoo ndɛ Endɔɔ, okiool lɔ tswa-tswa y’esɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Kɛn a ndɛ k’ayɔɔl lɔ elɔ ɛ̃dza wɛ, ndɛ okiool lɔ kɛn a me lio etsi-tsiri. Me lio li eyii emwɛn ndɛ fool wuo li ayii atuaal ndɛ mpal me ndɔɔ Endɔɔ olɔ, tswa-a-tswa oŋɔ̃ ndɛ k'abekiool lɔ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Nsia yi ebvi onse ɛ̃ti mi ãnsiɛɛn, eli mbuul wɛn, ŋ'eyoo ndɛ Endɔɔ, lɔ k'eburu nsia yi eyel onse ndɛ wɛ, me ndɔɔ ãtsam me ndɔɔ eluɔ bvi ɔ̃kiri, ye pfuru li epfuru opfel baal efoo lɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Mbuul wu oyɔɔ nsia yi ebvi me nsie yi ngesɛ, mbuul wɛn, ŋ'eyoo ndɛ Endɔɔ e Nziã, ndɛ obɔɔ lɔ otsɛn. Ndɛ oburu nsia: Lɛn oburu nsia ɔ̃nkam, lɛn ãku-ãsɛɛn, lɛn ã ku-ãtyel.»<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mboo a ekwɛn bviaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yeso oti mboo yinkyɛ bubu: «Okwɛn o ywel oli onge mbuul wu ákwɛn ekwɛn bvi ngesɛ onse nguun a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Kɛn a me lio li éli baal me twal, ɔ̃taal a ndɛ oyi, okwɛn ekwɛn bvi ebi-ebi onse bvi ngesɛ, bu ayɛn li ndyam. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Ŋ'ekwel ekwɛn bvool eburu nsia, bviĩ bvi ebi-ebi hɛ̃ apal. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Asal a nga-nguun ayeyɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: “Mfam, yɛ mpii nsia yi ngesɛ akwɛn onse ãnguun ã yɛ! Ke bviĩ bvi ebi-ebi kwɛn efi ?” <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ bubu: “Ɔ̃taal mbuul wu osi obobɔ.” Asal bu afuul ndɛ ndiri: “Yɛ dzii kwɛn bee eyeyeb bviĩ bvi ebi-ebi obvɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: “Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃! Ke ngwel wɛ, owɛɛl onse k'eyeb byɛ bviĩ bvi ebi-ebi, byɛ hɛ̃ eyeyeb bvi ngesɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Eyɔɔl bvɛ ekwel mboo mɔ̃ tiil lio li àka nsia. Me lio olɔ, mɛ̃ èliaal baal b'àka nsia wɛn: Eyeb kɛn bviĩ bvi ebi-ebi bvool ekuru bvɛ m'ãpfoo-m'ãpfoo kwɛn oŋɔ̃ atsoo bvɛ mbaa, bvool ebvool nsia yi ngesɛ onse nzɔ a mɛ̃ yi ebekwɛɛ mɛ̃ nsia”.»<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mboo yi esia li mutaade</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mak 4.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yeso bvool oti bɔ mboo nkyam ndiri: «Okwɛn o ywel oli onge esia li mutaade li ewel mbuul, bu akwɛn onse nguun a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Lɔ eli esia li enduru otsiaal onse nsia yueel. Kɛn a lɔ emɛn, lɔ enduru eluɔ bvieel bvi akwɛn onse nguun, eyii ɔ̃ti, bvool anywɛn ayetuu ãnzɔ onse ãpɔɔ̃ ã ndɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mboo a lebviil</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk 13.20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yeso bvool oti bɔ mboo nkyam ndiri: «Okwɛn o ywel oli onge lebviil li ewel ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃, bu anzoo lɔ onse faline li boo-boo, pɔtɔ-pɔtɔ ndyam wueel bu afel.»<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Emfa ki éketa Yeso ãmboo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mak 4.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yeso olieel embuul ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel m'ãmboo. K'éli ye ndɔɔ yi élieel ndɛ kyɛ yi eywɛn a mboo wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />M'emfa okyɛ, ŋ'ekoo ndɔɔ yi élieel ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">«Mɛ̃ ekieel edzweel ɔ̃nywã a mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ yi eyɛɛn ye bɔ m'ãmboo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">mɛ̃ ekieel etee ãndɔɔ m'ã́li m'edziɔɔn fa obɛɛn b'ɔ̃kiri<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Ãnz 78.2</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Otsɛn o mboo a bviĩ bvi ebi-ebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Obobɔ, Yeso osiil embuul, bu asam onse nzɔ. Ayio a ndɛ asyel tsotsoo a ndɛ, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mewa bee otsɛn o mboo a bviĩ bvi ebi-ebi onse nguun.» <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Wu okwɛn bviĩ bvi ngesɛ, eli Muaan a mbuul. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Nguun, eli ɔ̃kiri. Bviĩ bvi ngesɛ, eli baan b'Okwɛn. Bviĩ bvi ebi-ebi, eli baan b'Ɔ̃taal. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Ɔ̃taal wu okwɛn bviĩ bvi ebi-ebi, eli Ɔ̃pfu. Lio li aka nsia, eli ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri. Baal b'aka nsia, eli ãnzwel. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Emfa ngemɔ̃ ki ayeb bviĩ bvi ebi-ebi, bvool atyal bvɛ onse mbaa, akieel asa emfa kiki ke ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Muaan a mbuul akieel ayuɔɔl ãnzwel ã ndɛ. Mɔ̃ ãkieel ãmbaal onse Okwɛn o ndɛ baal bueel b'abebal baal onse obi ye baal b'abesa obi. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Ndɛ akieel atyal bɔ onse ywɛn e mbaa. Oyɔ mboo yi elel y'odza o miin. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Obobɔ, baal ba dzu akieel angal onge tal onse Okwɛn o Tal a bɔ. Yɔɔl kwɛn wu oli y'ãtswi m'ayoo, ayoo!»<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Opfel bom'olwɔɔn y'ãnkɔɔn m'ɔ̃bvɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />«Okwɛn o ywel oli onge opfel bo m'odziɔɔn onse nguun. Mbuul wu omwɛn bɔ, olwɔɔn bɔ hɛ̃. M'esɛ okyɛ, ndɛ oyetiɔ eluɔ bvieel bvi eli a ndɛ, bvool osuun nguun oyɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />«Okwɛn o ywel oli bvool onge mbuul wu asa obɔɔ̃, wu abii ãnkɔɔn m'ɔ̃bvɛn m'ãbvɛ-ãbvɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Ŋ'ebɔɔ ndɛ yɔ yi atiɔ nzi bibi, ndɛ oyetiɔ eluɔ bvieel bvi eli a ndɛ, bu asuun yɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mboo a okii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />«Okwɛn o ywel oli bvool onge okii b'atyel onse ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa, bɔ osiin answi b'emfa bwɛn emfa. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Ŋ'eluul bɔ, aswal adzuru bɔ k'ekwel, abvi nsɛn, m'osuaal b'answi: Ba ngesɛ, bɔ alɔ onse nkuru, b'abi-abi, bɔ ati pfɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Ekieel ekal emfa kiki ke ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri: Ãnzwel ãkieel ãyekab abi y'abvɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />Mɔ̃ ãkieel ãtyal abi onse ywɛn e mbaa. Oyɔ mboo yi elel y'odza o miin.»<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Opfel b'alili ye bo tsɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yeso ofuul bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ ŋ'ebɔɔ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel otsɛn?» Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃!» <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ɔ̃yiool-ãngel wueel wu oyio ãndɔɔ m'ãtal Okwɛn o ywel oli onge mfam a nzɔ wu awal onse opfel o ndɛ eluɔ bvi alili ye bvi tsɔɔn.»<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baal a Nadzalet k'akiool Yeso wɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mak 6.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Ŋ'eman Yeso ãmboo omɔ̃ ota, ndɛ ombal oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />Ndɛ obvool bviil e ndɛ li Nadzalet, ke mboo yi ékwel ndɛ. Ndɛ obvi baal otee onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn yi oŋɔ̃, m'emfa kyɛn b'ákeyoo ndɛ ákekam bibi, bvool ákefuul ndiri: «Ndɛ ãyal ye waan li asa emvieel bvi bubu kwɛn abɔɔ? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Ndɛ wu ke muaan a wu abesa ãbɛɛ wɛ? Ngoo a ndɛ ke Mali wɛ? Baan-ngoo a ndɛ ke Dzak, Dzedzef, Simɔ̃ ye Yude wɛ? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Ankyel a ndɛ bueel, ke b'abekal ye bia-byɛ ŋã wɛ? Ke ndɛ mã mbueel kwɛn abɔɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ã́kesa kwɛn bɔ k'akoo m'okiool o ndɛ wɛ. Obobɔ, Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «Abewa Ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã dzuun ãmboo mbueel, k'onse ola o ndyam y'onse nzɔ a ndyam wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Ndɛ k'asi emvieel bibi ke Nadzalet wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn baal a bviil olɔ áywɛn a okiool.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Epfu e Dzaã Batis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mak 6.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Me lio olɔ, Elode Antipas wu áli mfam k'etswi e nsie ki Ngalile oyoo nsia a Yeso. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Ndɛ olieel asal a ndɛ ndiri: «Ondɛ Dzaã Batis! Ndɛ ŋ'asiool onse b'ákwi, obɔ otsɛn b'eli ndɛ ye waan li asa emvieel.» <verse eid="MAT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Elode oyɛɛn obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ átam k'ásiin Dzaã, ákuru ndɛ, bvool álɔ ndɛ bwal. Éli me ndɔɔ a Elodiade, wu ɔ̃kal a muaan-ngoo a ndɛ Filipe. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Me ndɔɔ yɛn Dzaã álieel ndɛ wu Elode ndiri: «Yɛ ke koo k'abaal ndɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Obobɔ, Elode ákebii k'abam ndɛ, kɛn a ndɛ ákebal baal, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ákewal Dzaã onge ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã. <verse eid="MAT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Me tsoo li ákebɛɛl pfuun li áburu Elode, muaan a Elodiade wu ɔ̃kaal ákekɛn ke nkwel a baal b'éti ndɛ wu Elode mbel. Ndɛ ási Elode esɛ kyam bibi. <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />M'emfa okyɛ Elode olab ndɛ ɔ̃kyel ndiri: «Mɛ̃ èwa yɛ ki èbii yɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Ngoo bu awi ndɛ ãtsam m'ayɛɛn ndiri: «Wa mɛ̃ ɔ̃tswɛ a Dzaã Batis nkal a saan ŋã!» <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Ɔ̃kwɛn Elode ãwua bu ãbɔɔ. Kɛn onge bɛn ndɛ álab ɔ̃kyel ke nkwel a baal b'éti ndɛ mbel, ndɛ otam k'awa ndɛ ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Ndɛ bu atam k'ayetsiil Dzaã Ɔ̃tswɛ onse bwal. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Ayi y'ɔ̃tswɛ a Dzaã nkal a saan, awi nsam a ɔ̃kaal ndɛ, ndɛ bu abiri ndɛ ola ngoo. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Ayio a Dzaã ayewal ebiĩ e ndɛ, bu adziool kyɛ. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, bɔ ayewa Yeso nsia oyɔ.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oliil baal amiil ataan (5.000)</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mak 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Dzã 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Ŋ'eyoo Yeso nsia oyɔ, ndɛ owel ebɛɛ, ombal oŋɔ̃, odzuru nzuru oyɛn me pyɛ k'ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ. Kɛn a ŋ'eyoo baal nsia yi eyɛn ndɛ, bɔ afi m'ãbviil mã nku-a-nku, bu anɔɔn a ndɛ me nsie. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Ŋ'epal Yeso onse ebɛɛ, ndɛ omwɛn embuul, ndɛ nyiĩ a bɔ ebɔɔ, bvool oboo anga-ãluu b'áli onse bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Ŋ'eyii ekwal bviil, ayio asyel tsotsoo a Yeso, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Ŋã eli ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ, tal hɛ̃ emeeyel. Bveel baal ba, kwɛn bɔ ayi onse ãla me ndɔɔ yi ayesuun bvi-odza.» <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Kɛn a Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Bɔ k'ali ye kɔɔ li ayi okɔ wɛ, ewa bɔ bvi-odza byam!» <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Bɔ bu abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Bee ŋã eli kɛn a y'amampa ataan y'answi buaal.» <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yeso olieel bɔ ndiri: «Eya mɛ̃ ye bɔ ŋã.» <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Ndɛ bu atam baal k'abva nsɛn nkal a bviĩ. Ndɛ owel amampa ange-ataan y'answi ange-buaal, oseel mviil ke ywel, otuɛɛn Nziã me ndɔɔ a bɔ. Ndɛ otsiil amampa, owi ayio, ayio bu akab baal bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Baal bueel adzi ayool. Bɔ abiri etswel-etswel bvi esiil. Bvɛ eluul etsaka kuun ye bviaal (12). <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Baal b'ádzi áli abɔɔl nku-a-nku amiil ataan (5.000), oŋɔ̃ ŋɛn k'atsiɔ akaal ye baan b'atsi-atsi wɛ.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso odzuu nkal ãdza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mak 6.45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Dzã 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso otam ayio a ndɛ k'asam onse ebɛɛ, kwɛn bɔ atsɔɔn ongwel a baã. Kwɛn ŋɛn ndyam abebveel embuul e baal. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Ŋ'eman ndɛ bɔ obveel, ndɛ oyɛn nkal nkio me ndɔɔ yi abuɛɛn me pyɛ. Tsia obvi ndɛ oŋɔ̃ ndyam sii. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, ebɛɛ al'eyii muaan-lala y'ekwel. Kyɛ ékedzwaan y'epoo, ke ngwel wɛ mfel ákebveel kyɛ mbee. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Ŋ'eyii etsa bviil, Yeso oyii aya ol'ayio, adzuu nkal ãdza. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Ŋ'emwɛn ayio ndɛ adzuu nkal ãdza, esi bɔ buɔ bo bibi, bvool bɔ ayɛɛn ndiri: «Eli ɔ̃kwii!» Me buɔ obɔ, bɔ abvi ɛ̃sɔɔl okuaal. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Kɛn a alili oŋɔ̃, Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «Ekal ye mpɛn! Eli mɛ̃, ebee buɔ oyoo!» <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Piɛɛl obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, okɛɛn bam eli yɛ, tam mɛ̃ kwɛn mɛ̃ ngya ola yɛ, nkal ãdza.» <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ya!» Piɛɛl opal onse ebɛɛ, bu abvi odzuu nkal a ãdza m'oyi ola Yeso. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Kɛn a ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ k'epob mfel ye mpuru, ndɛ buɔ obɔɔ. Ndɛ oyii adziin, bu abiool ndiri: «Mfam, bvuul mɛ̃!» <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Ɛ̃kiri-anka oŋɔ̃, Yeso onaan kuɔɔl, osiin ndɛ, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mbuul wu okiool otsi-tsiri, ki esi yɛ enkyam emã?» <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Bɔ bu asam onse ebɛɛ. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, mfel ofi. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />B'áli onse ebɛɛ ayebva ãbuo ke nkwel a Yeso, bvool ayɛɛn ndiri: «Ngwanyã, yɛ li Muaan a Nziã!»<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oboo baal ke Ngenadzalet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Ŋ'eman bɔ nzal otsiil, bɔ atɔ etswi e nsie ki Dzenedzalet. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Baal b'etswi okyɛ ayeyɛɛ ndiri ondɛ Yeso. Bɔ atsal nsia a oya o ndɛ m'ãla mbueel m'ãku-a-nku oŋɔ̃. Obobɔ, ayi ndɛ ye baal bueel ba y'ãluu. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Bɔ aluɔɔn ndɛ kwɛn ndɛ awa bɔ nkuul yi anywɛn onkyam me nswɛ a ekɔ e ndɛ. Baal bueel b'anywɛn me yɔ abvuul.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso bwɛn onkɔɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-23">Mak 7.1-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Obobɔ, Afalisaye y'ayiool b'ãngel afi Yelusalem ayebɔɔ Yeso, bu afuul ndɛ ndiri: <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />«Otsɛn omã b'ebesiaan ayio a yɛ onkɔɔ b'ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ? Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ aboodza, k'abesuɔɔl mviɔɔl wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Ke byɛ, otsɛn omã b'ebefel byɛ ãngel ã Nziã me ndɔɔ yi elweel onkɔɔ o byam? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã áyɛɛn ndiri: “Lweel tal a yɛ ye ngoo a yɛ”, bvool ndiri: “Mbuul wu ayɛɛn obi-obi me tal wuo me ngoo a ndɛ, àwa ndɛ etumbu ki epfu.” <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Kɛn a byɛ, byɛ ebeyiool baal ndiri mbuul okoo k'aliaal tal wuo ngoo a ndɛ ndiri: “Mɛ̃ al'olɔ mbɔɔ eluɔ ki ewa yɛ m'owuaal o yɛ. Kɛn a kyɛ ki ewa mɛ̃ Nziã kab.” <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ ŋ'embaal Endɔɔ e Nziã bvɛɛ, elweel onkɔɔ o byam. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Byɛ baal a pfuru eli! Edzayi áli y'ɔ̃dzoo wu élieel ndɛ ãndɔɔ m'ã́fi ola Nziã me ndɔɔ a byɛ, ndiri:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />“Baal ba, abelweel mɛ̃ kɛn a m'ɔ̃nwã,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:8">kɛn ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ ɛ̃li lala ye mɛ̃.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Obuɛɛn b'ebuɛɛn bɔ mɛ̃ k'oli y'otsɛn wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:9">ãndɔɔ m'ebeyiool bɔ ãli kɛn ãngel m'ébuo baal.”»<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãndɔɔ m'ãsuul mbuul ye mbiin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mak 7.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oti embuul e baal mbel, bu ayɛɛn ndiri: «Eyoo mɛ̃ bvool ekwaal otsɛn o ndɔɔ yi. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Ki esuul mbuul ye mbiin ke nkwel a Nziã, ke ki esam onse ɔ̃nywã a ndɛ wɛ. Ki esuul mbuul ye mbiin ke nkwel a Nziã, ki epal onse ɔ̃nywã a ndɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Obobɔ, ayio asyel tsotsoo a Yeso, bu afuul ndɛ bubu: «Yɛ yɛɛ kwɛn ãyɛɛn omɔ̃ ãbiil Afalisaye ɛ̃kwal?» <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Ɔ̃ti ndyam wueel wɛn ke wu ekwɛn Tal a mɛ̃ wa ke ywel wɛ̃, akieel ayeb ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Eyɔɔl bɔ: Bɔ ali ɛ̃nkwa-mviil mi ɛ̃biri ɛ̃nkwa-mviil. Ŋɛn ɔ̃nkwa mviil obiri ɔ̃nkwa-mviil, bɔ ange-buaal àbva onse ywɛn.» <verse eid="MAT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Piɛɛl ayebvuru oyɛɛn, olieel Yeso bubu: «Wa bee otsɛn o mboo oyɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yeso olieel bɔ ndiri: «Onkyam byɛ hɛ̃, ŋɛn kɛn k'eli y'ãyal wɛ? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Byɛ k'ebɔɔ otsɛn wɛ? Eluɔ kieel ki esam onse ɔ̃nywã a mbuul eyi onse ɔ̃la a ndɛ, Ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ani kyɛ ke nkiin. <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Kɛn a ki epal onse ɔ̃nywã a mbuul, ki efa onse ɔ̃kwal. Kyɛ okyɛ ki esuul mbuul ye mbiin ke nkwel a Nziã. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ɔ̃kwal a mbuul, mboo yi ebefa ãndɔɔ mã bu: Ãtsam m'ãbi-ãbi m'ãtam mbuul k'abam baal, odzuu y'ɔ̃kal wuo y'ɔ̃lam a mbuul, osa b'ãndɔɔ m'esio, oturu o pfuul, oburu o ngaa-ndoo mbuul ãndɔɔ, y'osiaan. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Omɔ̃ ãndɔɔ m'ãbesuul mbuul ye mbiin ke nkwel a Nziã. Ki ebesuul mbuul ye mbiin ke nkwel a Nziã, ke me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ odzi k'asuɔɔl mviɔɔl wɛ wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okiool b'ɔ̃kaal wa Kanaan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mak 7.24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yeso ombal oŋɔ̃, bu ayɛn ke nsie yi éli bviil li Tiil ye li Sidɔ̃. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ wu-ɔ̃fi Kanaan wu akal ke nsie oyɔ obvi obiool ndiri: «Mfam, Muaan a David, sio mɛ̃ nyiĩ! Ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi abetuaal muaan a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃kaal mpal yam bibi.» <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Kɛn a Yeso k'abveel ndɛ ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ wɛ. Ayio a ndɛ asyel tsotsoo a ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi aliaal ndɛ bubu: «Tswɛɛl ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ abekuaal ɛ̃sɔɔl ke mbee a bia-byɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Áyuɔɔl mɛ̃ kɛn ol'emɛ̃mɛɛ̃ bvi nzɔ a Isalayel bvi édziɔɔn.» <verse eid="MAT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Kɛn ɔ̃kaal ondɛ oyebva ãbuo ke nkwel a Yeso y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Mfam, wuaal a mɛ̃!» <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «K'eli ngesɛ wɛ k'awal bvi-odza e baan, atyal bvɛ ola baan b'amva.» <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Ɔ̃kaal obveel Yeso bubu: «Mfam, yɛɛ y'ɔ̃dzoo. Ke baan b'amva mpii abedza ãmpiɛɛl m'eluɔ m'ãtswal ke nsɛn amisa b'amfam a bɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Obobɔ, Yeso olieel ndɛ bubu: «Ee ngu, Okiool o yɛ oli b'onɛn! Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã asa yɛ b'edzii yɛ!» Kɛn a me lio alili, muaan a ndɛ obvuul.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oboo anga-ãluu bibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:31">Mak 7.31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yeso ombal oŋɔ̃, oyɛn nku-a-nku a baã li Ngalile. Ndɛ owueel nkio, bu abvi nsɛn oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Embuul e baal eyi ola ndɛ. Bɔ ayi ye baal b'adzuu tetɔɔ̃, y'ɛ̃nkwa-mviil, y'akɛn, ye b'áli y'elyam, y'anga-ãluu akyam bibi. Asuul bɔ ke mviil ɛ̃ ndɛ, ndɛ bu aboo bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Baal akam bibi ŋ'emwɛn bɔ ankɛn ayɛɛn, b'áli y'elyam abvuul, b'adzuu tetɔɔ̃ adzuu, ɛ̃nkwa-mviil amwɛn. Bɔ alweel Nziã a Isalayel.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso bvool oliil ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mak 8.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yeso oti ayio a ndɛ mbel, bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Mɛ̃ ndi ye nyiĩ me ndɔɔ a baal ba, ke ngwel wɛ eyii ãtsoo ãtyel m'eli bɔ ye mɛ̃, mɛn bɔ ki adza pyɛ. Mɛ̃ ke nzii k'ebveel bɔ me nzal wɛ, owɛɛl bɔ ayebva leel me nkuul.» <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Ayio afuul ndɛ bubu: «Nkal ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ wu, amampa abo-bool b'eliil ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal wu, kwɛn eyebɔɔ?» <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yeso ofuul bɔ bubu: «Byɛ amampa kwɛ eli a bɔ?» Bɔ abveel bubu: «Nsiaan, y'ebe-baan bvi answi ke kwɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Obobɔ, Yeso otam baal ndiri abva nsɛn me nsie. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Ndɛ owel amampa ange-nsiaan y'answi, obveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a bɔ, otsiil amampa, owi ayio a ndɛ, bɔ bu akab baal bueel bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Baal bueel adzi ayool. Obobɔ, abiri etswel bvi esiil. Bvɛ eluul etsaka nsiaan. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Baal b'ádzi áli nku-a-kuu amiil anã (4.000), oŋɔ̃ ŋɛn k'atsiɔ akaal ye baan b'atsi-atsi wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Ke mbee a ŋ'ebveel Yeso baal, ndɛ osam onse ãsua, bu ayɛn ke nsie yi Mangadã.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso y'amfam b'Ayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mak 8.11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12.54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Afalisaye y'asaduseyɛ̃ asyel tsotsoo a Yeso. Me ndɔɔ yi akie ndɛ, bɔ asɔɔ ndɛ emvieel ki esuo kwɛn ndɛ ofi ola Nziã. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «M'ãnkunkwal, byɛ ebeyɛɛn wɛn: “Ɔ̃suu, lio èkal ngesɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ywel ebie.” <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />M'epal-epal, byɛ ebeyɛɛn wɛn: “Nonɔ̃ ŋã, mvel àndwɔɔ, ke ngwel wɛ ywel emeepiin.” Obobɔ, byɛ eyɛɛ k'etal emfa ki eli ywel, kɛn a byɛ k'ekoo k'eyɛɛ otsɛn b'ãndɔɔ m'ãtal ãlio mã meba wɛ! <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Baal ba lio li ali baal b'abi-abi, bvool k'akuru nzuru me Nziã wɛ. Bɔ abii emvieel, k'eli y'emvieel ekyam ki asuo bɔ wɛ, emvieel ki asuo bɔ kɛn a ki Yonas.» Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso osiil bɔ, bu ayɛn.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lebviil li Afalisaye y'asaduseyɛ̃</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mak 8.14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Ŋ'ékebwel ayio ongwel a baã, bɔ adzɛɛn k'abiri amampa. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yeso olieel bɔ ndiri: «Esa ãyal bvool ekal y'onkyab me lebviil li Afalisaye ye li Asaduseyɛ̃!». <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Ayio abvi otsam bvool abvi oyɛɛn bam-a-bam bubu: «Ki eyɛɛn ndɛ obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bia-byɛ k'ebiri amampa wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yeso oyɛɛ ãtsam ã bɔ, bu alieel bɔ ndiri: «Otsɛn omã b'etsam byɛ bvool eyɛɛn wɛn, byɛ k'ebiri amampa wɛ? Baal b'okiool otsi-tsiri! <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Byɛ k'ekwaal otsɛn kɛn wɛ! Eyeel ndɔɔ a amampa ataan b'ákab baal amiil ataan (5.000). Me tsoo olɔ, byɛ etsaka kwɛ ébiri? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Eyeel ndɔɔ a amampa nsiaan b'ákab baal amiil anã (4.000). Me tsoo olɔ, byɛ etsaka kwɛ ébiri? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Emfa emã kyɛn byɛ k'ekwaal otsɛn wɛ wɛn, mɛ̃ ke ndɔɔ amampa ngyɛɛn wɛ, ŋe ndieel mɛ̃ byɛ wɛn: Esa ãyal bvool ekal y'onkyab me lebviil li Afalisaye y'asaduseyɛ̃?»<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Obobɔ, ayio abɔɔ otsɛn ndiri, Yeso k'alieel bɔ k'akal y'onkyab me lebviil li ebiin amampa wɛ, me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ m'ebeyiool Afalisaye y'asaduseyɛ̃.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛɛl olieel ndiri Yeso Mãsia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mak 8.27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yeso otɔ nsie yi Tsedzale wa Filipe. Ndɛ ofuul ayio a ndɛ bubu: «Baal omã abeyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a Muaan a mbuul?» <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Bɔ abveel ndiri: «Bɛn ndiri yɛ Dzaã Batis, bɛn ndiri yɛ Eli. Bɛn bvool ndiri yɛ Yelemi wuo ngɔmɔ̃ onse aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã.» <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yeso bu afuul bɔ ndiri: «Obobɔ, ke byɛ, byɛ eyɛɛn wɛn mɛ̃ nã ndi?» <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl obveel ndiri: «Yɛ, yɛ li Mãsia, Muaan a Nziã wa mwiĩ!» <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Yeso bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Simɔ̃, muaan a Yonas, yɛ li y'esɛ bibi. Ke ngwel wɛ, wu oyɛɛl yɛ ndɔɔ oyɔ ke mbuul wɛ, wu oyɛɛl yɛ yɔ kɛn a Tal a mɛ̃ wa ke ywel. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɛ wɛn, yɛ li Piɛɛl, ke ywel a nkɔɔn yi, mɛ̃ ètuu Ebvɔɔn e mɛ̃. Edzoo bvi ola o b'ákwi-ákwi k'ekoo k'ebvel lɔ mpɛn wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Mɛ̃ èwa yɛ ɛ̃wɔɔl mi Okwɛn o ywel. Ndɔɔ yi èkuru yɛ me nsie, ke ywel hɛ̃ àkuru yɔ. Ndɔɔ yi ènyiɔɔn yɛ me nsie, ke ywel hɛ̃ ànyiɔɔn yɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Yeso bu awi ayio ãnkunkwa ndiri abee mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ oliaal ndiri ndɛ Mãsia.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso olieel ndiri ndɛ àkwa bvool àsiool</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-34">Mak 8.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk 9.22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Fa lio olɔ, Yeso obɛɛn ayio a ndɛ osuo ndiri ebvaan ndɛ ayi Yelusalem, amwɛn fool lam boo-boo li ètuaal akuul-kuul, y'amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã, y'ayiool b'ãngel ndɛ. Bɔ àbam ndɛ, kɛn a ndɛ àsiool me tsoo li ãtyel. <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Piɛɛl odzuru ndɛ me pyɛ, bu abvi ndɛ mbyel owa ndiri: «Yɔɔl Nziã akiaal yɛ, Mfam! Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ k'ã̀ya me yɛ wɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Kɛn a Yeso okɔɔl, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yi lala ye mɛ̃, Ɔ̃pfu! Yɛ mɛ̃ kio alɔ, ke ngwel wɛ ãtsam ã yɛ ke mã Nziã wɛ, m'ombuul.»<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emfa ki aluɛɛn a Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:34-9:1">Mak 8.34–9.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23-27">Luk 9.23-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso olieel ayio a ndɛ bubu: «Okɛɛn mbuul odzii k'aluɛɛn a mɛ̃, ebvaan ndɛ abee omwiĩ o ndyam bvool obesiɔɔl. Ndɛ abiri enkulusu e ndɛ, bvool aluɛɛn a mɛ̃. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu odzii k'abvuul omwiĩ o ndɛ, wu àywɛn a bɔ. Kɛn a mbuul wu àywɛn omwiĩ o ndɛ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃, wu àbɔɔ bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Ŋɛn mbuul obɔɔ opfel b'ɔ̃kiri a nsie ndyam wueel, bvel e mã li ebɔɔ ndɛ, okɛɛn ndɛ oywɛn a omwiĩ o ndɛ? Wuo eluɔ emã kyɛn mbuul okoo k'awa ke mboo a omwiĩ o ndɛ? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Muaan a mbuul àyeya onse omfam o Tal a ndɛ, y'ãnzwel ã ndɛ. Obobɔ, ndɛ akieel afuru mbuul bwɛn a mbuul m'emfa ki ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, baal bakyɛ onse ŋã k'àmwɛn epfu wɛ, ye k'emwɛn bɔ Muaan a mbuul aya onse okwɛn o ndɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso oswɛɛl emfa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mak 9.2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Ke mbee ãtsoo ãsɛɛn, Yeso owel Piɛɛl, ye Dzak bwɛn a Dzaã wu muaan-ngoo a ndɛ wu Dzak, ndɛ oyɛn ye bɔ me pyɛ nkal a nkio yi nda. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Okɔ, ndɛ oswɛɛl emfa ke mviil ã bɔ: Osu o ndɛ obvi onyɛɛn onge tal, ekɔ e ndɛ hɛ̃ eyii bvam afuu-afuu onge mwiĩ. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Pfa, ayio ange-atyel amwɛn Moyize y'Eli ambwɔɔ ye ndɛ! <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Piɛɛl olieel ndɛ bubu: «Mfam, eli ngesɛ kwɛn bia-byɛ ekal ŋã! Okɛɛn ye dzii, mɛ̃ ètuu asɛɛ atyel ŋã: Ngɔmɔ̃ wa yɛ, ngɔmɔ̃ wa Moyize, ngɔmɔ̃ wu Eli.» <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Me lio li ékeyɛɛn ndɛ, epɛn ngemɔ̃ ki ékenyɛɛn eyefoo bɔ. Nkii ngamɔ̃ fa onse epɛn, bu eyɛɛn ndiri: «Wu bu Muaan a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃tio, wu ndi mɛ̃ y'esɛ me ndɛ: Eyoo ndɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Ŋ'eyoo ayio nkii oyɔ, buɔ bo bibi obɔɔ bɔ, bɔ bu abvi ãbuo mbwii me nsie. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yeso osyel tsotsoo a bɔ, obiɛɛn bɔ, bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Etɛɛn, ebee buɔ oyoo!» <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Bɔ aseel mviil, k'amwɛn mbuul ɔ̃kyam wɛ, wu emwɛn bɔ kɛn a Yeso ndyam. <verse eid="MAT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Ŋ'eyii esool bɔ nkal a nkio, Yeso owi bɔ ãnkunkwa ndiri: «Byɛ mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ m'emwɛn byɛ oliaal wɛ, tiil ye k'esiool Muaan a mbuul onse b'ákwi-ákwi.»<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Ayio bu afuul Yeso ndiri: «Otsɛn omã b'ebeyɛɛn ayiool b'ãngel ndiri ŋ'ɛ̃kwel kɛn ebvaan Eli aya?» <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ bubu: «Ngwanyã, Eli àya me ndɔɔ yi ayefaal ãndɔɔ mbueel. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ndɛ amaaya, kɛn a bɔ k'ayɛɛ ndɛ wɛ, bu ási ndɛ onge b'édzii bɔ. Emfa kiki, bɔ àtuaal Muaan a mbuul mpal.» <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Ayio bu abɔɔ otsɛn ndiri ndɛ akeyɛɛn bɔ me Dzaã Batis.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso obvuul muaan ngɔmɔ̃ wu ákekwa esiɔ̃</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mak 9.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9.37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ tsotsoo embuul e baal, bɔɔl ngɔmɔ̃ oyebva ãbuo ke nkwel a Yeso. <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />Ndɛ olieel Yeso ndiri: «Mfam, me sio mɛ̃ muaan wu bɔɔl wu nyiĩ! Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ abekwa esiɔ̃ bvool abemwɛn fool lam bibi. Ãlio bibi, ndɛ abebva onse mbaa y'onse ãdza. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Mɛ̃ mbiri ndɛ ola ayio a yɛ, kɛn a bɔ aboo ndɛ okwɛɛn.» <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yeso bu ayɛɛn ndiri: «Byɛ eli yam e baal b'abi bvool eywɛn a okiool! Mɛ̃ èkal ye byɛ tiil mpwanki? Mɛ̃ ekuru ɔ̃kwal wu ekal ye byɛ tiil lio emã? Eya mɛ̃ ye ndɛ ŋã!» <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yeso ongal ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi, ndɛ bu apal onse muaan. Kɛn a me lio olɔ, muaan ondɛ obvuul. <verse eid="MAT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Obobɔ, ayio asyel tsotsoo a Yeso, bu afuul ndɛ me pyɛ ndiri: «Otsɛn omã bɛn bee ekwɛɛn k'etwsɛɛl ɔ̃fel ondɛ bee-myam?» <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ okiool oli otsi-tsiri. Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, okɛɛn byɛ eli y'okiool bɛn onge esia li mutaade, byɛ ekoo k'eyɛɛn nkio yi wɛn: “Mbal ŋã, yi ku”, yɔ èmbal. Ndɔɔ yi èkwɛɛn byɛ osa k'èkal wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />[Ɔ̃fel wa bubu abepal kɛn a m'ebuɛɛn y'ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi, k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃kaan mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>.»]<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso bvool olieel ndiri ndɛ àkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mak 9.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, ayio ábvɔɔn mboo mɔ̃ ke Ngalile. Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «Àtiɔ Muaan a mbuul me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Bɔ àbam ndɛ, kɛn a ndɛ àsiool me tsoo li ãtyel.» Ayio ãwua bu ãbɔɔ bɔ mam bibi.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso ye mpal e Nzɔ a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Ŋ'etɔ Yeso y'ayio a ndɛ ke Kapelanahum, baal b'awal mpal e Nzɔ a Nziã ayefuul Piɛɛl ndiri: «Mfam a byɛ ŋ'abefuru mpal e Nzɔ a Nziã?» <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃!» Ŋ'esam ndɛ onse nzɔ, Yeso abvuru oyɛɛn nkwel, ofuul ndɛ bubu: «Simɔ̃, yɛ tsam bwɛn? B'afuru mpal wuo nzi ol'akwɛn b'ɔ̃kiri anã? Baan a bɔ wuo anzii?» <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Piɛɛl obveel ndiri: «Anzii.» Obobɔ, Yeso olieel ndɛ bubu: «Okɛɛn obobɔ, ŋɛn baan a bɔ k'afuru yɔ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Kɛn a me ndɔɔ yɛn ebee bɔ ɛ̃kwal obiil, yi nzal, tyal ndab m'ãdza. Nswi wu ɛ̃kwel wu èdzuru yɛ, dzweel ɔ̃nywã a ndɛ, yɛ àmwɛn nzi yi ãbvieel. Wal yɔ, wa bɔ me ndɔɔ a bia-yɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Okuaal o nzuru y'odzeel o bakyɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mak 9.33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Me lio olɔ, ayio asyel tsotsoo a Yeso, bu afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Wu onduru bakyɛ onse Okwɛn o ywel nã?» <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yeso oti muaan wu ɔ̃tsi-tsiri ngɔmɔ̃ mbel, bu asuul ndɛ kal-a-kal a bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />Ndɛ bu alieel ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, okɛɛn byɛ k'eswɛɛl epfuũ me ndɔɔ yi ekal onge baan b'atsi-atsi wɛ, byɛ k'ekoo k'esam onse Okwɛn o ywel wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mbuul wu àkuaal nzuru onge muaan wu ɔ̃tsi-tsiri wu, àkal wu onduru bakyɛ onse Okwɛn o ywel. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Okɛɛn mbuul oyɔɔ muaan wu ɔ̃tsi-tsiri wɛn onge wu me nkuũ a mɛ̃, ŋ'ayɔɔ myam. <verse eid="MAT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Kɛn okɛɛn mbuul osi kwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ onse ebebaan bvi ekiool mɛ̃ bvi ebva onse obi, onsoo akuru ndɛ nkɔɔn yi enɛn me nkii, atyal ndɛ ke nsɛn ãdza. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Ãwua bibi m'ɔ̃kiri me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ m'ãbal baal onse obi! Mɔ̃ k'ãkoo k'ãywɛn wɛ. Kɛn ãwua bibi me mbuul wu apoo mɔ̃! <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Okɛɛn kuɔɔl wuo kuul e yɛ ebal yɛ onse obi, tsiil elyam obvɛ, ta bvɛ pfɛɛ lala ye yɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, eli ngesɛ me yɛ k'asam onse elaã ye kuɔɔl wuo ye kuul ɔ̃mbɔɔn, ye k'ekal yɛ ye mviil wuo ye mviɔɔl ɛ̃nge-mviaal bvool atyal yɛ onse mbaa yi ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Okɛɛn dziil e yɛ hɛ̃ ebal yɛ onse obi, mbaal lɔ, ta lɔ pfɛɛ lala ye yɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, eli ngesɛ me yɛ k'asam onse elaã ye dziil ngelemɔ̃ ye k'ekal yɛ ye mviil ãnge-mbuaal bvool atyal yɛ onse ywɛn e mbaa.»<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mboo a emɛɛmɛɛ̃ ki edziɔɔn bvool edzuul</para>
  <para style="r">( <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15.3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />«Ekal y'onkyab kwɛn byɛ ebee ngɔmɔ̃ onse ebebaan bvi opfiɔɔl. Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ke ywel, ãnzwel ã bɔ ãli lio lueel ke nkwel a Tal a mɛ̃ wa ke ywel. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />[Ke ngwel wɛ, Muaan a mbuul oyebvuul b'ádziɔɔn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi, k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>.]<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />Byɛ etsam omã? Okɛɛn mbuul oli y'emɛmɛɛ̃ ɔ̃nkam (100), emɛmɛɛ̃ ngemɔ̃ edziɔɔn, ndɛ olɔ k'asiil emɛmɛɛ̃ ɛ̃kuun-bva ye bva (99) bvi esiil nkal a nkio, me ndɔɔ yi ayebii ngemɔ̃ ki edziɔɔn okyɛ wɛ? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ kyɛ, esɛ ki eyoo ndɛ me ndɔɔ a kyɛ enduru ki eyoo ndɛ me ndɔɔ emɛmɛɛ̃ ɛ̃kuun-bva ye bva (99) bvɛn k'edziɔɔn wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Emfa kiki, Tal a byɛ wa ke ywel k'adzii kwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ onse ebebaan bvi adziɔɔn wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obi y'odzeel o bakyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />«Okɛɛn muaan-ngoo a yɛ osi yɛ obi, yi y'asuo ndɛ obi b'esi ndɛ, byam ange-buaal. Okɛɛn ndɛ oyoo yɛ, yɛ ŋe bveel ondoo o byɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Kɛn okɛɛn ndɛ k'ayoo yɛ wɛ, kɔɔl yi y'atal ndɛ ye mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wuo baal buaal, onge b'ákel ndiri “ndɔɔ yueel asoo yɔ ke mbee a ɔ̃tsweel wu etsweel amwɛn buaal wuo atyel<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Det 19.15</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Okɛɛn ndɛ obee k'ayoo bɔ, yɛɛn ndɔɔ oyɔ ol'Ebvɔɔn. Okɛɛn ndɛ obee k'ayoo Ebvɔɔn hɛ̃, oŋɔ̃ wal ndɛ onge mbuul wɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ, wuo onge ɔ̃twal mpal. <verse eid="MAT 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ndɔɔ yueel yi èkuru byɛ me nsie, àkuru yɔ hɛ̃ ke ywel. Ndɔɔ yueel yi ènyiɔɔn byɛ me nsie, ànyiɔɔn yɔ hɛ̃ ke ywel. <verse eid="MAT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ bvool eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, okɛɛn baal buaal onse byɛ abvool ãtsam me nsie me ndɔɔ yi asɔɔ eluɔ k'emã, Tal a mɛ̃ wa ke ywel àwa bɔ kyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mboo yi ebvɔɔn baal buaal wuo atyel me nkuũ a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi onse bɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mboo a ɔ̃sal wu abee k'adzeel wumɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Obobɔ, Piɛɛl osyel tsotsoo a Yeso, bu afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, okɛɛn ndoo a mɛ̃ osi mɛ̃ obi, mɛ̃ èdzeel ndɛ̃ nsa kwɛ? Mɛ̃ èdzeel ndɛ tiil nsa nsiaan?» <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Mɛ̃ ke ndieel yɛ wɛn tiil nsa nsiaan wɛ, kɛn a mɛ̃ ndieel wɛn tiil nsa ɛ̃kuun-nsiaan (70) nsa nsiaan<note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke mboo yi, bakyɛ ndiri: «Nsa ɛ̃kuun nsiaan ye nsiaan (77) nsa nsiaan».</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, Okwɛn o ywel oli m'emfa ki: Ɔ̃kwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ ádzii k'asiɔɔl nzi e ndɛ y'asal a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Ŋ'ebɛɛn ndɛ yɔ osiɔɔl, ayi ndɛ y'ɔ̃sal ngɔmɔ̃ wu áli y'ebiin e ndɛ ki nzi yam yi bibi. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Onge bɛn ɔ̃sal ondɛ k'áli y'eluɔ ki afuru wɛ, mfam a ndɛ otam kwɛn atiɔ ndɛ, ndɛ y'ɔ̃kal, ye baan, ye bvieel bvi éli a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi afuru ebiin e ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Ndɛ obel nzuru me nsie, obvi ãbuo ke nkwel a mfam, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: “Mekuru mwiĩ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ekieel efuru ebiin e yɛ kyam kieel!” <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Mfam osio ndɛ nyiĩ yam bibi, ombaal ebiin e ndɛ, bu ayɔɔl ndɛ ayɛn. <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Ŋ'epal ɔ̃sal ondɛ, ndɛ omwɛɛn ye ngɔmɔ̃ onse anga-ndoo a ndɛ b'ɔ̃sal, wu áli y'ebiin e ndɛ ki nzi nsi-nsiri. Ndɛ obvuru ndɛ, obvi opɛn ke ngɔ-a-bwel y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: “Furu ebiin e mɛ̃!” <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Nga-ndoo a ɔ̃sal obvi ãbuo ke mviil ɛ̃ ndɛ, bu abuɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: “Mekuru mwiĩ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ekieel efuru ebiin e yɛ!” <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Kɛn a ndɛ obee, bu ayeywɛɛn wumɔ̃ me bwal, tiil k'efuru ndɛ ebiin e ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Ŋ'emwɛn anga-ndoo b'ɔ̃sal emfa ki ebwel ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ aluul m'ãwua, bu ayeliaal mfam a bɔ mbueel m'ãbwel. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Obobɔ, mfam otam ɔ̃sal ondɛ mbel ota, bu alieel ndɛ bubu: “Ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃bi! Mɛ̃ mbaal ebiin e yɛ kyam kieel me ndɔɔ yɛn yɛ alɛɛn mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ a kyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Yɛ hɛ̃ ale ke koo k'asio nga-ndoo a yɛ wu ɔ̃sal nyiĩ onge b'esio mɛ̃ yɛ nyiĩ wɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Mfam a ndɛ oyi mpuru, bu awi ndɛ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal b'atuaal baal mpal, tiil ye k'efuru ndɛ ebiin e ndɛ kieel. <verse eid="MAT 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Okyɛ emfa ki ekieel esa Tal a mɛ̃ wa ke ywel byɛ, okɛɛn ngɔmɔ̃ ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ k'adzeel muaan-ngoo a ndɛ m'ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃ wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Okwa o bal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mak 10.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Ŋ'eman Yeso ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ oliaal, ndɛ ombal nsie yi Ngalile, bu ayɛn ke nsie ki Yude yi ongwel a nzal yi Dzolodɛ̃. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Embuul ki bibi eluɛɛn a ndɛ, oŋɔ̃ ndɛ oboo anga-ãluu. <verse eid="MAT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Afalisaye ke kwɛ asyel tsotsoo a ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi aywiin ndɛ bɛɛ m'ɔ̃mfuul wu: «Awi bɔɔl nkuul yi abee ɔ̃kal m'elyal kyam k'emã?» <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ k'etsiɔ m'ákel mã wɛ: “K'obɛɛn Nziã wu ábuo ɔ̃kiri ási mbuul bɔɔl y'ɔ̃kaal wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Obɛ 1.27</ref></char></note>?” <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Nziã bvool álieel bubu: “Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, bɔɔl akieel ambal ola tal ye ngoo a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi akuru nzuru m'ɔ̃kal a ndɛ, obobɔ bɔ ange-buaal akieel akal nzuru ngamɔ̃<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Obɛ 2.24</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />M'emfa okyɛ, bɔ k'àbekal baal buaal wɛ, ayii kɛn a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃.” Oŋɔ̃ yɔɔl kwɛn b'ebvool Nziã, mbuul abee bɔ otsal!» <verse eid="MAT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Afalisaye afuul ndɛ ndiri: «K'otsɛn omã b'éwi Moyize ngel yɛn bɔɔl m'obee b'ɔ̃kal, obvie owi ndɛ ɔ̃nkaan wu okwa o bal?» <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ bubu: «Okɛɛn Moyize áwi byɛ nkuul yi ebee akal me ndɔɔ ɛ̃tswɛ mpɛn ɛ̃ byɛ. K'obɛɛn, k'éli obobɔ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mbuul wu obee ɔ̃kal, okɛɛn ke me ndɔɔ abɔɔl wɛ, bvool oyebaal ɔ̃kal ɔ̃kyam, ŋ'adzuu y'anga-ɔ̃kal.»<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Ayio alieel ndɛ ndiri: «K'okɛɛn emfa ki ekal ɔ̃lam ke nkwel a ɔ̃kal kyɛ okyɛ, onsoo abee obaal.» <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ bubu: «Baal bueel k'abɔɔ oyɛɛn obɔ otsɛn wɛ, b'abɔɔ bɔ otsɛn kɛn a b'ewi Nziã mpwee oyɔ. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Ke ngwel wɛ, eli y'ãndɔɔ bibi m'ãsa kwɛn baal k'abebaal wɛ: Bɛn me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ ɛ̃nguo ɛ̃́kwi fa mwiĩ a ngoo, bɛn me ndɔɔ yɛn ámbaal bɔ obɔɔl, bɛn bvool me ndɔɔ Okwɛn o ywel. Yɔɔl kwɛn wu okoo k'akwaal otsɛn, akwaal otsɛn!»<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso ye baan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mak 10.13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, abiri baan ola Yeso, kwɛn ndɛ andɔɔl bɔ mviɔɔl bvool abuɛɛn me bɔ. Kɛn ayio ayiaan baal obɔ. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Obobɔ, Yeso oyɛɛn ndiri: «Eyɔɔl baan, ebee bɔ nkuul okii yi aya ola mɛ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, Okwɛn o ywel oli bo baal b'ali onge bɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Ndɛ ondɔɔl bɔ mviɔɔl, bu ambal oŋɔ̃.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsam a bɔɔl yi ɔ̃pfel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mak 10.17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Enseel oŋɔ̃, bɔɔl ngɔmɔ̃ osyel tsotsoo a Yeso, bu afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee, yi esa mɛ̃ yi mvɛ mã, kwɛn mɛ̃ mbɔɔ elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu?» <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ndɔɔ mã yi efuul yɛ mɛ̃ ɔ̃mfuul me b'otal ndɔɔ yi mvɛ? Mbuul wu ɔ̃bvɛ kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃. Okɛɛn yɛ dzii k'asam onse elaã, kiaal ãngel.» <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Ndɛ ofuul Yeso ndiri: «Ãngel mɛn?» Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Oyɛɛ ke bam mbuul wɛ. Oyɛɛ ke dzuu y'ɔ̃kal wuo y'ɔ̃lam a mbuul wɛ. Oyɛɛ ke buru mbuul ãndɔɔ wɛ. Oyɛɛ ke turu eluɔ e mbuul wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />Lweel tal ye ngoo a yɛ, bvool dzii ngaburu-mbuul onge b'edzii yɛ nzuru a yam.» <verse eid="MAT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Nsam a bɔɔl elieel Yeso ndiri: «Mɛ̃ nkieel ãngel omɔ̃ mbueel. Ki eywɛn me mɛ̃ bvool emã?» <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yeso olieel ndɛ bubu: «Okɛɛn yɛ dzii k'akal mbuul wu ɔ̃koo, yi, tiɔ opfel o yɛ bueel, kab aywal nzi oyɔ. Obobɔ, yɛ àbɔɔ opfel ke ywel. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ya, bvool luɛɛn a mɛ̃!» <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Ŋ'eyoo nsam a bɔɔl obobɔ, ndɛ oyɛn y'ãwua mbueel. Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ áli y'obɔɔ bibi. <verse eid="MAT 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Yeso olieel ayio a ndɛ bubu: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, eli ye fool kwɛn ɔ̃pfel asam Okwɛn o ywel. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Mɛ̃ bvool eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, eli ye fool kwɛn nyam wu ɔ̃mbiri ãpfuũ wu ata me swamo abwel onse pfee e nyuɔ̃. Kɛn osam b'ɔ̃pfel Okwɛn o Nziã, oyɔ ndɔɔ yi enduru fool yam.» <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Ŋ'eyoo ayio obobɔ, bɔ akam bam bibi, bu ayɛɛn ndiri: «Ke m'emfa okyɛ, wɛn ol'obvuul nã?» <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yeso otal bɔ, bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Ãndɔɔ mɛn baal k'akoo k'asa wɛ, Nziã okoo k'asa mɔ̃ mbueel.» <verse eid="MAT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Piɛɛl ayebvuru oyɛɛn, olieel Yeso ndiri: «Meyoo, bee bam esiil eluɔ bvieel me ndɔɔ yi eluɛɛn a yɛ. Kieel bwɛn ekal me ndɔɔ a bee?» <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ b'eluɛɛn a mɛ̃ wɛn, ŋ'ekieel ebva Muaan a mbuul nsɛn nkal a kiri e ndɛ li lweel onse ɔ̃kiri wu ɔ̃nyiɔɔn, byɛ hɛ̃ ekieel ebva nsɛn nkal ãkiri kuun ye mbuaal me ndɔɔ yi etsiil ãndɔɔ m'ãyam ãnge-kuun ye mbuaal m'Isalayel. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Bvool mbuul wueel wɛn me ndɔɔ a nkuũ a mɛ̃ osiil ãnzɔ, baan-ngoo b'abɔɔl ye b'akaal, tal, ngoo, baan wuo ãnguun, akieel abɔɔ eluɔ obvɛ nsa ɔ̃nkam (100), y'elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Baal bibi ba nkwel akieel akal ba mbee, bvool baal bibi ba mbee akieel akal ba nkwel.»<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Mboo a asal b'onse nguun a bvine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />«Ke ngwel wɛ, etal emfa ki eli Okwɛn o ywel: Mfam a nzɔ ngɔmɔ̃ opal epal-epal kwɔɔl me ndɔɔ yi ayebii baal b'ayesal onse nguun a ndɛ yi bvine. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Ndɛ ye bɔ akuru kwɛn furu li ɔ̃sal a bɔ me tsoo eli li nzi yi ãbvieel ngamɔ̃. Ndɛ bu ayuɔɔl bɔ onse nguun a bvine a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Ndɛ bvool opal m'epal sua lio li bva, omwɛn baal akyam b'akɛɛn ke taan. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: “Byɛ hɛ̃, eyi onse nguun a mɛ̃ yi bvine, mɛ̃ èwa byɛ furu li ekoo.” <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Bɔ bu ayɛn okɔ. Ndɛ bvool opal ŋ'eyii sua tal dzu bvool me lio ãtyel ŋ'emeebɔɔn tal, bu asi bubu. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Ndɛ bvool opal sua lio li ãtaan ŋ'emebɔɔn tal, bu amwɛn baal akyam b'atɛɛn ke taan. Ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: “Ndɔɔ mã yi etɛɛn byɛ ŋã ki esa pyɛ pipi wu ɔ̃tsiin?” <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: “Me ndɔɔ yɛn mbuul wu owel bee k'ɔ̃sal pyɛ.” Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: “Oŋɔ̃ byɛ hɛ̃ eyi onse nguun a mɛ̃ ye bvine.”»<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />«Ŋ'etɔ ãnkunkwal, nga-nguun a bvine olieel mbuul wu atal ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ ndiri: “Ta asal mbel, wa bɔ furu e bɔ. Bɛɛn me b'ãmbee, sɛɛl me b'ɛ̃kwel.” <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Baal b'ewel ndɛ sua lio li ãtaan ŋ'emeebɔɔn tal, ayi, abɔɔ furu li nzi yi bvieel ngamɔ̃ me mbuul bwɛn a mbuul. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Ŋ'etɔ ɔ̃nkaal wa baal b'ɛ̃kwel, bɔ ayii atsam ndiri bɔ al'abɔɔ nzi yi enduru. Kɛn a bɔ hɛ̃ abɔɔ kɛn a furu li nzi yi bvieel ngamɔ̃ me mbuul bwɛn a mbuul. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Ŋ'ebɔɔ bɔ lɔ, bɔ ayoo nkyee ye nga-nguun, <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />bu alieel ndiri: “Baal b'ayi ãmbee ba, asal kɛn a me lio ngemɔ̃, yɛ furu bɔ emfa ngemɔ̃ ye bee b'esal eyool a mwiĩ pipi wu ɔ̃tsiin, ɛ̃furu ɛ̃fi!” <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Ndɛ obveel ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ bubu: “Ndoo a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ke nsi yɛ obi wɛ. Bia-yɛ k'ekuru wɛn furu li ɔ̃sal a yɛ eli li nzi yi ãbvieel ngamɔ̃ wɛ? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Wal furu e yɛ, yi li yam. Myam mbuul wu nzii k'ewa wu obɛɛn ɔ̃sal ãmbee furu lili li mfuru mɛ̃ yɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Mɛ̃ ke nkoo k'esa be nzi mɛ̃ me nzi e myam wɛ? Wuo, yɛ akwa mɛ̃ nsɔɔ me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ ndi mbuul wa ngesɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Obɔbɔ, ba nkwel akieel akal ba mbee, ba mbee akieel akal ba nkwel.»<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso oyɛɛn li nsa tyel me ndɔɔ okwa y'osiool o ndɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mak 10.32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Ŋ'ékeyi Yeso Yelusalem, ndɛ obiri ayio kuun ye buaal me pyɛ, olieel bɔ me nkuul a nkuul ndiri: <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />«Etal, bia-byɛ ŋ'eyi Yelusalem, okɔ àtiɔ Muaan a mbuul me mviɔɔl mi amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'ayiool b'ãngel. Bɔ àwa ndɛ etumbu ki epfu. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Bɔ àtiɔ ndɛ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ, kwɛn bɔ asɔɔl ndɛ, abɛɛl ndɛ, bvool abɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu. Me tsoo li ãtyel, ndɛ àsiool.»<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngoo a Dzak bwɛn a Dzaã osɔɔ ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃ ola Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mak 10.35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Obobɔ, ngoo a baan a Dzebede oyi tsotsoo a Yeso ye baan a ndɛ b'abɔɔl, obvi ãbuo ke nkwel a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi asɔɔ ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃ ola ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yeso bu afuul ndɛ bubu: «Ki edzii yɛ mã?» Ndɛ obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Kiool kwɛn, onse Okwɛn o yɛ, baan a mɛ̃ ange-buaal ba abva nsɛn, wɛn me nkuɔɔl e yɛ ki elam, wɛn me ki ekal.» <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yeso obveel ndiri: «Byɛ k'eyɛɛ ki esɔɔ byɛ wɛ. Byɛ ol'ekoo k'enywã mbiɔ yi eyenywã mɛ̃?» Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Bee ol'ekoo.» <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ ekieel enywã mbiɔ a mɛ̃. Kɛn a me b'otal obva o nsɛn me kuɔɔl e mɛ̃ ki elam wuo ki ekal, wu atsiil ndɔɔ oyɔ ke mɛ̃ wɛ, ãmboo omɔ̃ ãli mã baal b'éyɛɛl Tal a mɛ̃ bɔ mɔ̃.»<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Ŋ'eyoo ayio kuun b'asiil ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ ayoo nkyee ye baan-ngoo ange-buaal. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Obobɔ, Yeso oti bɔ mbel, bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn, b'ebewal baal onge amfam b'ɛ̃kiri atuaal baal a bɔ mpal, baal b'anɛn hɛ̃ abenyam ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃ bɔ m'onyam. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Kɛn a yɔɔl kwɛn ebee obobɔ okal onse byɛ. Mbuul wu odzii k'anduru bakyɛ onse byɛ, àkal ɔ̃sal a byɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Bvool mbuul wu odzii k'akal wu ɛ̃kwel onse byɛ, àkal ɔ̃nkyal a byɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, Muaan a mbuul k'ayi me ndɔɔ yɛn baal asal me ndɔɔ a ndɛ wɛ, ndɛ oyi me ndɔɔ yi asal me ndɔɔ a baal bvool me ndɔɔ yi awa elaã e ndɛ onge ɔ̃bvɛn wu afuru, me ndɔɔ yi abvuul ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal.»<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso obvuul ɛ̃nkwa-mviil mviaal ke Dzeliko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mak 10.46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Ŋ'epal Yeso y'ayio a ndɛ onse Dzeliko, embuul ki bibi eluɛɛn a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Baal b'ɛ̃nkwa-mviil buaal abvi nsɛn me pyɛ e nkuul. Bɔ ayoo ndiri Yeso abwel, bu abvi obiool ndiri: «Muaan a David, Mfam, sio bee nyiĩ!» <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Embuul ebvi bɔ opɛɛn ndiri: «Esuul nkyal!» Kɛn a bɔ bvool abiool bam kokɔ ndiri: «Mfam, Muaan a David, sio bee nyiĩ!» <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yeso otɛɛn bvool oti bɔ mbel, bu afuul bɔ ndiri: «Ndɔɔ mã yi edzii byɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ nsa byɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, yɔɔl kwɛn mviil ã bee ãdzweel nzuru!» <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yeso nyiĩ a bɔ ebɔɔ, ndɛ bu anywɛn me mviil ã bɔ, ɛ̃nkiri-a-nka oŋɔ̃, bɔ abɛɛn omwɛn bvool. Bɔ bu aluɛɛn a ndɛ.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Osam o Yeso Yelusalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-11">Mak 1.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Dzã 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Yeso y'ayio a ndɛ atɔ tsotsoo a Yelusalem, sua ola bo Betefadze, nku-a-ku a nkio a ɛ̃ti mi Olibve. Ndɛ bu atam ayio buaal. <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Eyi onse ola b'otaal ke nkwel a byɛ ba, byɛ èmwɛn ane wu ɔ̃kal wu atsɔɔn me swɛ, ye muaan wu ɔ̃lam tsotsoo a ndɛ, enyiɔɔn bɔ, eya mɛ̃ ye bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Okɛɛn mbuul ofuul byɛ ɔ̃mfuul, byɛ ebveel ndɛ wɛn: “Mfam oli ye kɔɔ e bɔ.” Alili oŋɔ̃, ndɛ àyɔɔl bɔ aya.» <verse eid="MAT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Ãndɔɔ ãbwel obobɔ, kwɛn asa ndɔɔ yi élieel ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ndiri:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />«Eliaal nsam a ɔ̃kaal wa Siɔ̃ wɛn:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Tal, Ɔ̃kwɛn a yɛ aya ola yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">ndɛ oluul m'efyɛ, onɔɔn nkal ane wu ɔ̃kal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">nkal a muaan a ane wu ɔ̃lam, muaan a nyam wu ɔ̃mbiri ãpfuũ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:9">Dzã 9.9</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Ayio ayesa b'etam Yeso bɔ osa. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Bɔ abiri ane wu ɔ̃kal ye muaan wu ɔ̃lam. Bɔ ayel ekɔ e bɔ nkal a bɔ, Yeso bu abvi nsɛn ke ywel a bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Embuul e baal ki bibi eyel ekɔ e bɔ nkal a nkuul. Bakyɛ atsiil epuun bvi ɛ̃ti, bu ayel bvɛ nkal a nkuul. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Embuul ki ékeyi ke nkwel a Yeso ye ki ékeya ke mbee a ndɛ bu ebvi obiool ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">«Odzana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Odzana </char><char style="ft" closed="false">M'ɔ̃nywa wu Ebele ŋ'aliaal ndiri: «Y'awuaal a bee!» </char></note> me Muaan a David!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Yɔɔl kwɛn wu aya me nkuũ a Mfam akal y'ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Odzana ke ywel li enduru ɔ̃ndel!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Ãnz 118.25-26</ref> </char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Ŋ'esam Yeso onse Yelusalem, ekiin ebvi onse bviil lam lueel. Baal abvi ofuul ndiri: «K'ondɛ mbuul nã?» <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Embuul ékebveel ndiri: «Eli Yeso wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã wa bviil li Nadzalet ke Ngalile.»<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso otswɛɛl atiɔ onse Nzɔ a Nziã</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mak 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Dzã 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yeso osam onse Nzɔ a Nziã, bu abvi baal bueel b'áketiɔ ye b'ákesuun eluɔ onse yɔ otswɛɛl. Ndɛ obal amisa a b'ákeswɛɛl nzi y'ãkiri ã b'áketiɔ ãkuun. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Onse ɔ̃nkaan wa ngel, ákel bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:13">“Nzɔ a mɛ̃, àta yɔ me nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn”.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:13">Kɛn a byɛ, byɛ emeekaal yɔ eyii mboo yi edziɔɔn baal a pfuul!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Edz 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Dze 7.11</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Ɛ̃nkwa-mviil ye baal b'adzuu tetɔɔ̃ asyel tsotsoo a Yeso onse Nzɔ a Nziã, ndɛ bu oboo bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Kɛn amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã, y'ayiool b'ãngel ayoo nkyee bibi ŋ'emwɛn bɔ ãndɔɔ m'ɛ̃kam m'ékesa ndɛ, ye ŋ'emwɛn bɔ baan b'ákebiool onse Nzɔ a Nziã ndiri: «Odzana me Muaan a David!» <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Bɔ alieel Yeso ndiri: «Yɛ ayoo m'eyɛɛn baan ba?» Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃! Byɛ lɔɔ-okal kɛn etsiɔ ãyɛɛn mã wɛ ndiri: “M'ɔ̃nywã a baan b'atsi-atsi ye wa b'anywã ãbiaal, yɛ bɔɔ lweel<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:3">Ãnz 8.3</ref></char></note>”?» <verse eid="MAT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ osiil bɔ, opal onse bviil, oyɛn Betani, bu alaal okɔ.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃ti a fig wu oywɛn a nsia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mak 11.12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />M'epal, ŋ'eyii ebvool ndɛ bviil, ndɛ nzal ewel. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Ndɛ omwɛn ɔ̃ti a fig nku-a-nku a nkuul. Ndɛ osyel tsotsoo a ndɛ, omwɛn kɛn a ãsɔɔ ãtu. Ndɛ bu alieel ɔ̃ti ondɛ bubu: «Yɛ kieel k'abeburu esia lam wɛ!» Ɛ̃kiri-a-nka oŋɔ̃, ɔ̃ti okɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Ŋ'emwɛn ayio obobɔ, bɔ akam bibi. Bɔ afuul Yeso ndiri: «Ɔ̃ti a fig wu okɛɛ kɛn ɛ̃kiri-a-nka ŋã, bwɛn a bwɛn?» <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, m'eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ŋɛn byɛ eli y'okiool, bvool k'esi enkyam wɛ, byɛ k'esa kɛn a be nsi mɛ̃ m'ɔ̃ti a fig wu wɛ. Kɛn a ŋɛn byɛ hɛ̃ eyɛɛn nkio yi wɛn: “Mbal oŋɔ̃ y'atyal nzuru onse ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa”, ãndɔɔ ãbwel obobɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Ãndɔɔ mbueel m'èbii byɛ m'ãbuɛɛn y'okiool, byɛ èbɔɔ mɔ̃.»<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omfam o Yeso kwɛn ofi?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mak 11.27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yeso bvool oyɛn onse Nzɔ a Nziã. Me lio li éketee ndɛ, amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'akuul-kuul ayefuul ndɛ bubu: «Omfam b'ebesa yɛ ãndɔɔ mã bɛn? Wu owi yɛ omfam obɔ nã?» <verse eid="MAT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ èfuul byɛ ɔ̃mfuul ndyam ngɔmɔ̃. Byɛ ebveel mɛ̃ ndɛ, mɛ̃ èyɛɛn byɛ omfam b'ebesa mɛ̃ ãndɔɔ mã. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Wu áyuɔɔl Dzaã me ndɔɔ yi awa baal opongo nã: Nziã wuo baal?» Bɔ bu abvi otsuun bam-a-bam ndiri: «Bia-byɛ ebveel ndɛ wɛn: “Wu áyuɔɔl ndɛ Nziã”, ndɛ mpii ol'ofuul bia-byɛ ndiri: “Ke byɛ ébee ndɛ okiool emã?” <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Kɛn a ŋɛn bia-byɛ ebveel ndɛ wɛn: “Wu áyuɔɔl ndɛ baal”, oŋɔ̃ bia-byɛ ekal y'onkyab me ndɔɔ embuul! Ke ngwel wɛ bɔ bueel abekiool ndiri Dzaã áli ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã.» <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Obobɔ, bɔ abveel Yeso ndiri: «Bee k'eyɛɛ wɛ.» Yeso bu abveel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ k'èyɛɛn byɛ omfam b'ebesa mɛ̃ ãndɔɔ mã wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mboo a baan buaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />Yeso olweel bubu: «Byɛ etsam omã me ndɔɔ yi: Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ áli ye baan b'abɔɔl buaal. Ndɛ olieel muaan wu ɛ̃kwel ndiri: “Muaan a mɛ̃, yi y'asal nonɔ̃ onse nguun a bvine.” <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Muaan obveel ndɛ ndiri: “Mɛ̃ ke nzii wɛ.” Kɛn a ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ oswɛɛl ãtsam, bu ayɛn. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Tal olieel muaan wa buaal ndɔɔ yiyi. Muaan obveel bubu: “Hɛɛ̃, mɛ̃ èyi taal.” Kɛn a ndɛ k'ayɛn wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Onse bɔ ange-buaal, muaan wu osi b'edzii tal nã?» Bɔ abveel ndiri: «Eli muaan wu ɛ̃kwel.» Obobɔ, Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, atwal-mpal y'akaal-nga-esio asam Okwɛn o Nziã nkwel a byɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Dzaã oyi ola byɛ me ndɔɔ yi asuo byɛ nkuul yi dzu, byɛ k'ekiool ndɛ wɛ. Kɛn atwal-mpal y'akaal-anga-abɔɔl akiool ndɛ. Onkyam ŋ'emwɛn byɛ obobɔ, byɛ k'eswɛɛl ãtsam ã byɛ, me ndɔɔ yi ekiool ndɛ wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mboo a asal a bvine b'abi-abi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mak 12.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />«Eyoo mboo yinkyɛ. Éli ye mfam a nzɔ ngɔmɔ̃ wu ákwɛn nguun a bvine. Ndɛ odzii yɔ ekɔɔ, otsam ywɛn onse yɔ me ndɔɔ yi akɛɛl nsia, bvool otuu nzɔ yi nkal a ywel yi ekal ɔ̃nkiaal. Ndɛ osiil yɔ me mviɔɔl mi asal, bu ayɛn dzwɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Ŋ'eyii koo lio li aka nsia, ndɛ oyuɔɔl ankyal a ndɛ ol'asal ba ke nguun, kwɛn bɔ awa boo e bvine li ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Kɛn asal asiin ankyal obɔ, abɛɛl wumɔ̃, abam wukyɛ, wumɔ̃ bvool bɔ atyel ãnkɔɔn. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Ndɛ oyuɔɔl bvool ankyal akyam b'anduru b'ɛ̃kwel m'olɔɔ. Asal asi obɔ hɛ̃ emfa kiki. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />K'osɛɛl, ndɛ oyuɔɔl bɔ muaan a ndyam, y'ãtsam mã: “Bɔ ol'awel muaan a myam ye bvɛɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Kɛn a ŋ'etaal asal muaan, bɔ abvi bam-a-bam oyɛɛn ndiri: “Etal wu akieel awal ɔ̃swal! Eya ebam ndɛ, kwɛn ɔ̃swal akal wa bia-byam!” <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Obobɔ, bɔ asiin ndɛ, apaal ndɛ onse nguun a bvine, bu abam ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Ke ŋ'èya nga-nguun a bvine, ndɛ asal obɔ bwɛn asa?» <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã abveel Yeso ndiri: «Ndɛ àtam k'abam asal b'abi obɔ, nyiĩ pyɛ. Ndɛ àbuun nguun a ndɛ a bvine m'asal akyam, bɛn me lio li aka nsia, awa boo e bvine li ndɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yeso bu alieel bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ lɔɔ-okal kɛn etsiɔ m'ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã mã wɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“Nkɔɔn yi éti atuu pfɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">eyii nkɔɔn yi nkiin yi nzɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Ndɔɔ oyɔ efi ola Mfam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">eli ndɔɔ yi ɛ̃kam ke mviil ã bia-byɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Ãnz 118.22-23</ref></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Yeso olweel bubu: «Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, akieel ambaal Okwɛn o Nziã me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ byɛ, àwa bɔ me yam e baal ekyam li ekieel eburu nsia e bɔ. [<verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Mbuul wu àbva nkal a nkɔɔn oyɔ, àkiɔɔl. Yɔ ebva nkal a mbuul, yɔ èkyɛɛl ndɛ<note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>.]»<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Ŋ'eyoo amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'Afalisaye ãmboo omɔ̃, bɔ abɔɔ otsɛn kwɛn Yeso ákeyɛɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ me bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Obobɔ, bɔ aboobii ãyal m'asiin ndɛ, kɛn a bɔ ayoo buɔ o baal, me ndɔɔ yɛn baal ákewal ndɛ onge ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Mboo a pfuun li bal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14.15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yeso oyɛɛn bvool y'embuul m'ãmboo. Ndɛ olieel ndiri: <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />«Okwɛn o ywel oli onge ɔ̃kwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ wu obɛɛl pfuun li bal e muaan a ndɛ wu bɔɔl. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Ndɛ oyuɔɔl asal a ndɛ ayeta baal b'ati mbel ke pfuun mbel. Kɛn a bɔ k'adzii k'aya wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Ndɛ oyuɔɔl asal akyam, y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: “Eyeyɛɛn b'ati mbel ke pfuun wɛn: Mɛ̃ emeeyɛɛl bvi-odza. Mɛ̃ emeetam k'abam angwɛmbɛ y'anyam a mɛ̃ ba ye mbaal. Mbueel amaayɛɛl, eya pfuun!” <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Kɛn a b'áti mbel ke pfuun k'asiɔɔl mbel yi áti bɔ wɛ, ayɛn li bam. Wɛn oyɛn ãnguun mã ndyam, wɛn oyeta obɔɔ̃ bo ndyam. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Kɛn a b'asiil asiin asal obɔ, atueel mpal, bu abam. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Obobɔ, ɔ̃kwɛn mpuru eyi, ndɛ otam ambwel-mbwel a ndɛ k'ayebweel baal obɔ b'abam asal a ndɛ, bvool k'ayetsoo bviil e bɔ mbaa. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Ndɛ bu alieel asal a ndɛ ndiri: “Bvi-odza e bal amaayɛɛl. Kɛn a b'ati mbel k'abvaan m'odza o bvɛ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Oŋɔ̃ eyi k'ãmboo m'ebvɔɔn ɛ̃siɔɔn, eliaal baal bueel b'èmwɛn byɛ ayedza ke pfuun.” <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Asal ayɛn m'ɛ̃siɔɔn, abvool baal bueel b'emwɛn bɔ okɔ, abi y'abvɛ. Etswi e nzɔ e pfuun bu eluul me b'ati mbel. <verse eid="MAT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Ɔ̃kwɛn osam me ndɔɔ yi atal b'ati mbel. Ndɛ omwɛn mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn k'alaal ekɔ e bal wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Ndɛ ofuul mbuul ondɛ ndiri: “Ndoo a mɛ̃, yɛ ŋã bwɛn-a-bwɛn sam ekɔ e bal pyɛ?” Kɛn a ndɛ k'abɔɔ yi abveel wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Ɔ̃kwɛn bu alieel asal ndiri: “Ekuru ndɛ mviɔɔl ye mviil, etyal ndɛ onse empeel li onkwel-a-nzi. Oyɔ mboo yi ekieel ekal y'elel y'odza o miin.” <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Ke ngwel wɛ, b'ati mbel ali bibi, kɛn a b'asueel ali atsi-tsiri.»<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpal yi ɔ̃kwɛn Sedzaal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mak 12.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Obobɔ, Afalisaye ayekuru mfoo me ndɔɔ yi abii elyal ki asiin Yeso m'ãyɛɛn ã ndyam. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Bɔ ayuɔɔl ndɛ ayio a bɔ ke kwɛ ye baal ba nkel yi Elode ayefuul ndɛ ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee, bee eyɛɛ kwɛn yɛ abeliaal otaa-taa bvool abeyiool baal nkuul a Nziã onse otaa-taa bueel. Yɛ ke li ye buɔ o mbuul wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ yɛ ke li y'ɔ̃bɛɛ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Oŋɔ̃ meliaal bee bam b'etsam yɛ me ndɔɔ yi: Awi baal nkuul yi afuru mpaa yi ɔ̃kwɛn Sedzaal, wuo k'awi yɔ wɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Kɛn a Yeso wu ayɛɛ ãtsam ã bɔ m'ãbi, obveel bɔ bubu: «Baal a pfuru! Ki eywiin byɛ mɛ̃ bɛɛ emã? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Esuo mɛ̃ nzi yi abefuru mpal.» Bɔ asuo ndɛ nzi yi ãbvieel ngamɔ̃. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Ndɛ ofuul bɔ ndiri: «Nkal a nzi yi eli y'osu o mbuul ye nkuũ a ndɛ. Ke mbuul ondɛ nã?» <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Bɔ abveel ndiri: «Mbuul ondɛ Sedzaal.» Yeso bu alieel bɔ ndiri: «Eluɔ bvi Sedzaal, ewa Sedzaal, bvi Nziã, ewa Nziã.» <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Ŋ'eyoo bɔ ɔ̃mveel ondɛ, esi bɔ ɛ̃kam bibi. Bɔ asiil ndɛ, bu asiin nkuul ayɛn.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔ̃mfuul me ndɔɔ osiool o b'ákwi-ákwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mak 12.18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Tsoo alili, asaduseyɛ̃ ayi ola Yeso. Bɔ baal bɛn k'abekiool wɛ kwɛn b'ákwi akieel asiool. Bɔ afuul Yeso bubu: <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />«Ɔ̃tee, Moyize álieel ndiri: “Ŋɛn bɔɔl okwi k'asiil muaan wɛ, muaan-ngoo a ndɛ àwal ɔ̃pfiil, kwɛn bɔ abuo ɔ̃pfu esii e baal<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Det 25.5-6</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, onse bee baan b'abɔɔl áli nsiaan. Muaan wu ɛ̃kwel obaal ɔ̃kal, okwi. Onge bɛn ndɛ k'abɔɔ muaan y'ɔ̃kal ondɛ wɛ, ndɛ osiil ɔ̃pfiil me muaan-ngoo. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Esi kɛn a obobɔ, me muaan wa buaal, ye wu atyel tiil wa nsiaan. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Ke mbee a bɔ bueel, ɔ̃kaal ondɛ hɛ̃ okwi. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Ke ŋ'ekieel esiool b'ákwi-ákwi, ndɛ àkal ɔ̃kal nã onse baan-ngoo ange-nsiaan? Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ bueel ábaal ndɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ k'eli y'ɔ̃dzoo wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ k'eyɛɛ m'ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã wɛ, byɛ hɛ̃ k'eyɛɛ waan e ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'ekieel esiool baal, akaal y'abɔɔl k'àbaal bakyɛ wɛ. Kɛn a bɔ akieel akal onge ãnzwel ke ywel. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Me b'otal osiool o b'ákwi-ákwi, byɛ kɛn etsiɔ b'élieel Nziã byɛ wɛ? Ndɛ mpii álieel ndiri: <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />“Mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi Nziã a Abalayam, Nziã a Isak, Nziã a Dzakab<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Opa 3.6</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 3:15">15</ref></char></note>.”» Yeso olweel bubu: «Nziã k'ali Nziã a b'ákwi-ákwi wɛ, ndɛ oli Nziã a baal b'amwiĩ-mwiĩ.» <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Embuul e baal ki ékeyoo ndɛ ékekam bibi me m'ékeyiool ndɛ.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngel yi enduru mãkyɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mak 12.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Afalisaye ayoo ndiri Yeso okuru asaduseyɛ̃ ɛ̃nywã. Bɔ bu abvɔɔn. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ áli ɔ̃yiool-ãngel. Me ndɔɔ yi akie Yeso, ndɛ oyefuul ndɛ ndiri: <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />«Ɔ̃tee, onse ãngel mam mbueel, ngel yi enduru mãkyɛ yɛn?»<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yeso obveel ndiri: «“Yɛ àdzii Mfam Nziã a yɛ m'ɔ̃kwal a yɛ ndyam wueel, m'omwiĩ o yɛ bam bueel, m'ãtsam ã yɛ mam mbueel<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Det 6.5</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Oyɔ ngel yi enduru mãkyɛ bvool yi nkiin. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Tal yi mbuaal yi efɛɛn onge oyɔ: “Yɛ àdzii ngaburu-mbuul onge b'edzii yɛ nzuru a yam<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Ngel a Moyize yam yueel y'ãtee m'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã mam mbueel ãli onse ãngel ãnge-mbuaal omɔ̃.»<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mãsia ye David</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mak 12.35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Afalisaye ábvɔɔn mboo mɔ̃, Yeso bu afuul bɔ ɔ̃mfuul wu: <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />«B'etsam byɛ omã me Mãsia? Ndɛ Muaan a nã ali?» Bɔ abveel ndiri: «Mãsia oli muaan a David.» <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yeso olieel bɔ ndiri: «K'otsɛn omã bɛn David, ŋ'éluul ndɛ m'Ɔ̃fel áti ndɛ me “Mfam”? Ke ngwel wɛ, David álieel ndiri:<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />“Mfam oyɛɛn ye Mfam a mɛ̃ bubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">Y'abva nsɛn ke kuɔɔl e mɛ̃ ki elam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">tiil ye k'esuul mɛ̃ ataal a yɛ ke nsɛn a ntaã e yɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Ãnz 110.1</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />«Okɛɛn David oti Mãsia me “Mfam”, emfa emã kyɛn Mãsia bvool akal muaan a David?» <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ onse Afalisaye k'ákoo k'abveel Yeso ndɔɔ wɛ. Obobɔ, bɛɛn tsoo olɔ, mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ wu ákie bvool k'afuul ndɛ ɛ̃mfuul k'áli wɛ.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso odzuru ayiool b'ãngel y'Afalisaye ãtswi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mak 12.38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luk 11.43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Obobɔ, Yeso olieel embuul e baal y'ayio a ndɛ bubu: <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />«Ayiool b'ãngel y'Afalisaye, ɔ̃sal a bɔ wu abeyiool baal Ngel a Moyize. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Obobɔ, esa bvool elweel ãndɔɔ mam mbueel m'eyɛɛn bɔ byɛ. Kɛn a byɛ ebee epfuũ e bɔ onɔɔn. Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ k'abesa m'ebeyiool bɔ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Bɔ abekuru ãpfuũ m'ãli y'olyam, mã ye mpal m'obiri, bvool abendɔɔl baal mɔ̃ nkal esɔɔ̃. Kɛn a bam k'adzii k'anywɛn a mɔ̃ si ekal me nswɛɛ a ɔ̃liɛɛn wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ bɔ mvieel, bɔ abesa myɛ̃ kwɛn baal atal bɔ. Obobɔ, bɔ abelweel okuun o baan<note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baan b'ãkab omɔ̃, bɔ ákelaal mɔ̃ me mviɔɔl wuo me mbwii, me lio li ãbuɛɛn.</char></note> b'ãnkab ã bɔ m'ãli y'ãndɔɔ ã Nziã onse mwiĩ. Bɔ hɛ̃ asuul ãnswɛɛ m'ekɔ ã bɔ m'ãla.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:8">Det 6.8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:12">22.12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Bɔ adzii ãmboo mã dzuun k'ãpfuun, bɔ hɛ̃ adzii ãmboo mã nkwel onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Bɔ adzii kwɛn abio bɔ ke taan, bvool kwɛn ata bɔ “m'Atee”. <verse eid="MAT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Kɛn a byɛ, yɔɔl kwɛn abee byɛ “m'Atee” ota. Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ Ɔ̃tee oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃, byɛ bam bueel hɛ̃ eli baan-ngoo. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Oyɛɛ k'eta mbuul me “Taal” me nsie wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ byɛ Tal oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃, Taal wa ke ywel. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Yɔɔl kwɛn abee byɛ ota “m'Amfam”. Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ Mfam oli kɛn a ngɔmɔ̃, Mfam ondɛ Mãsia. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Mbuul wu onduru bakyɛ onse byɛ àkal ɔ̃sal a byɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Mbuul wu àndɛɛl nzuru, àkuaal ndɛ, kɛn a wu àkuaal nzuru, àndɛɛl ndɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pfuru li amfam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Ãwua ola byɛ, byɛ b'ayiool b'ãngel y'Afalisaye, baal a pfuru! Byɛ ekuru baal nkuul a Okwɛn o ywel, byam bam hɛ̃ k'esam onse bɔ wɛ. B'adzii k'asam bɔ, byɛ ekii bɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 23:13">[ <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Ãwua ola byɛ, byɛ b'ayiool b'ãngel y'Afalisaye, baal a pfuru! Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ ebekuaal eluɔ bvi akaal b'apfiil, byɛ ebesa ãbuɛɛn m'ãla-m'ãla, me ndɔɔ yi epfuru baal. M'emfa okyɛ, Nziã akieel awa byɛ etumbu ki enduru ki baal b'asiil mpuru<note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi, k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>.]<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Ãwua ola byɛ, byɛ b'ayiool b'ãngel y'Afalisaye, baal a pfuru! Byɛ edzuu ãmboo mbueel me nsie y'ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa, kwɛn byɛ ebɔɔ onkyam mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu akiool onkɔɔ o byɛ. Ŋ'ebɔɔ byɛ ndɛ, byɛ bvool esuul ndɛ mbuul wa ywɛn e mbaa, wu onduru byam m'obi nsa yuaal.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Ãwua ola byɛ, byɛ b'ambiri b'ɛ̃kwa-mviil! Byɛ etɔ m'oyɛɛn wɛn: “Okɛɛn mbuul olab ɔ̃kyel me nkuũ a Nzɔ a Nziã, k'esa ndɔɔ wɛ. Kɛn a mbuul wu alab ɔ̃kyel me nkuũ a ɔɔl li eli onse Nzɔ a Nziã, ebvaan ndɛ asa ndɔɔ yi elab ndɛ ɔ̃kyel.” <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Ewool e baal! Ɛ̃nkwa-mviil! Eluɔ ki enduru ɔ̃bvɛn emã, ɔɔl wuo Nzɔ a Nziã yi esuul ɔɔl olɔ li ngel? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Byɛ etɔ m'oyɛɛn bvool wɛn: “Okɛɛn mbuul olab ɔ̃kyel me nkiin yi awa Nziã kab, k'esa ndɔɔ wɛ. Kɛn a mbuul wu alab ɔ̃kyel me kab li eli nkal a nkiin yi awa Nziã kab, ebvaan ndɛ asa ndɔɔ yi elab ndɛ ɔ̃kyel.” <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Ɛ̃nkwa-mviil! Eluɔ ki enduru ɔ̃bvɛn emã, kab wuo nkiin yi awa Nziã kab yi esuul kab olɔ li ngel? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu alab ɔ̃kyel me nkiin yi awa Nziã kab, ŋ'alab ɔ̃kyel me nkiin ye bvieel bvi eli nkal a yɔ. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Mbuul wu alab ɔ̃kyel me Nzɔ a Nziã, ŋ'alab ɔ̃kyel me Nzɔ a Nziã ye Nziã wu oli onse yɔ. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Mbuul wu alab ɔ̃kyel me ywel, ŋ'alab ɔ̃kyel me kiri li Okwɛn o Nziã ye Nziã wu obvi nsɛn nkal a lɔ.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Ãwua ola byɛ, byɛ b'ayiool b'ãngel y'Afalisaye, baal a pfuru! Byɛ ebewa Nziã boo ngemɔ̃ onse ãboo kuun li ekwɛn bvi ãnguun bvi: mɛnte, fenuye ye Kumin. Kɛn onse Ngel a Moyize, byɛ ebedzɛɛn ãndɔɔ mã nkiin mã: okal dzu, nyiĩ, y'okiool. Omɔ̃ ãndɔɔ mɛn ebvaan byɛ ekeesa, m'ãsiil odzɛɛn wɛ.<verse eid="MAT 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Ambiri b'ɛ̃nkwa-mviil! Byɛ ebekyal ãdza me ndɔɔ yi embaal tob, kɛn a byɛ ebemɛn nyam wu ɔ̃mbiri ãpfuũ wu ata me swamo!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />Ãwua ola byɛ, byɛ b'ayiool b'ãngel y'Afalisaye, baal a pfuru! Byɛ ebesuɔɔl mbiɔ ye saan onkwel-a-nzi, kɛn a onse mwiĩ, bvɛ eluul m'eluɔ e pfuul y'efua bvi ebi-ebi! <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Ɔ̃falisaye wu ɔ̃nkwa-mviil! Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel kɛn, suɔɔl mbiɔ onse mwiĩ, m'emfa okyɛ mbee a mbiɔ hɛ̃ èkal tsɛ-tsɛ.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />Ãwua ola byɛ, byɛ b'ayiool b'ãngel y'Afalisaye, baal a pfuru! Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ eli onge ãmpiɛɛn m'ákel eyuɛ̃, mɛn onkwel-a-nzi ãsuo obvie, kɛn a onse mwiĩ ãluul m'ɛ̃ywee ɛ̃ b'ákwi-ákwi ye mbiin yi emfa bwɛn emfa. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Emfa kiki hɛ̃, onkwel-a-nzi byɛ esuo kwɛn byɛ baal ba dzu ke mviil ã baal, onse mwiĩ byɛ eluul me pfuru y'ãndɔɔ m'ãbi.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />Ãwua ola byɛ b'ayiool b'ãngel y'afalifaye, baal a pfuru! Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ ebeboo ãmpiɛɛn m'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, bvool ebefaal mã baal ba dzu. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Byɛ etɔ m'oyɛɛn wɛn: “Okɛɛn bee éli me lio li ankiɔɔn a bee, kɛn bee k'ékeebvɔɔn ye bɔ m'otsal b'ãkel m'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã wɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Ŋ'eyɛɛn byɛ obobɔ, byam ŋ'esuo kwɛn byɛ eli atiɔɔl a baal b'ábam aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Obobɔ, embɛɛl ɔ̃sal wu ébɛɛn ankiɔɔn a byɛ osa! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Byɛ antaal eli, yam li ampel! Emfa emã ki etsam byɛ wɛn byɛ ol'ekoo k'ebal etumbu ki ywɛn e mbaa? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ ndyam ekieel eyuɔɔl byɛ aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn, y'ãnga-ãyal, y'ayiool b'ãngel. Byɛ ekieel ebɛɛl bakyɛ m'enkulusu bvool ebam bɔ, epfel bakyɛ ɔ̃dzii onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn ã byɛ, bvool etuaal bɔ mpal me bviil bwɛn a bviil. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Obobɔ, ãkel m'ankinkyam mbueel m'étsal byɛ me nsie ãbva nkal ɛ̃tswɛ ɛ̃ byɛ, bɛɛn m'ãkel m'Abɛl wa dzu tiil mã Dzakali, wu muaan a Balaki, wu ébam byɛ mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a nkiin yi awa Nziã ãkab ye Nzɔ a Nziã<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Obɛ 4.8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20-21">2Ãl 24.20-21</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, etsob okyɛ èbva nkal a baal ba nɔnɔ̃ ba!»<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ãwua ã Yeso me ndɔɔ a Yelusalem</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk 13.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Aa, baal a Yelusalem! Baal a Yelusalem! Byɛ b'ebebam aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, b'ebetyal baal b'eyuɔɔl Nziã byɛ ãnkɔɔn! Nsa kwɛ yi édzii mɛ̃ k'ebvool byɛ tsotsoo a mɛ̃ onge b'epfee nswee baan onse ãpab! Kɛn a byɛ k'édzii obobɔ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Oŋɔ̃, nzɔ a byɛ, ŋ'esiil ndii. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, byɛ k'èbemwɛn mɛ̃ bam wɛ, tiil lio li ekieel eyɛɛn byɛ ndiri: “Yɔɔl kwɛn wu àya me nkuũ a Mfam akal y'ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Ãnz 118.26</ref></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso oyɛɛn ndiri akieel atsal nzɔ a Nziã</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mak 13.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yeso opal onse Nzɔ a Nziã, bu abvi oyi. Ayio a ndɛ ayesuo ndɛ emfa ki átuu yɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Ndɛ abvuru oyɛɛn, olieel bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ emwɛn eluɔ bvi bvieel? Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn k'èkal ye nkɔɔn si ngamɔ̃ y'ekieel esiil nkal a yinkyɛ wɛ: Bvam bvieel ekieel etsɔɔn.»<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fool y'otuaal o mpal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mak 13.3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yeso áli me nsɛn ke nkio a ɛ̃ti mi olibve, ayio ayefuul ndɛ me pyɛ ndiri: «Meyɛɛn bee, lio emã li ekieel eya ãndɔɔ omɔ̃? Eliĩ emã ki ekieel esuo oya o yɛ ye ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri?» <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Ndɛ bu abveel bɔ bubu: «Ekal y'onkyab, kwɛn mbuul abee byɛ opfuru. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, baal bibi akieel aya me nkuũ a mɛ̃ ndiri: “Mɛ̃ ndi Mãsia” bvool bɔ akieel apfuru ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Byɛ èyoo ɔ̃sam wu ãmvel ye wu ɔ̃nyiin wu ãmvel, oŋɔ̃ ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ ɛ̃bee ke ywel okal. Ke ngwel wɛ, ebvaan kwɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãbwel. Kɛn oyɔ kieel k'ekal ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri kɛn wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Nzal-a-ŋɛn, ɔ̃kiri ngɔmɔ̃ akieel adzwaan ye wumɔ̃, okwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ hɛ̃ okieel odzwaan ye bokyɛ. M'ãmboo bibi, ekieel ekal y'ɛ̃lɔɔ, nsie hɛ̃ ekieel enziool nzuru. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel ãkieel ãkal onge obɛɛn b'obaan o mwiĩ b'eyoo ɔ̃kaal wu oyii ayi oburu. <verse eid="MAT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Obobɔ, akieel atiɔ byɛ kwɛn atuaal byɛ mpal, bvool akieel abam byɛ. Ãyam ã baal mbueel ãkieel ãbyal byɛ me ndɔɔ a nkuũ a mɛ̃. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />M'emfa okyɛ, baal bibi akieel ayɔɔl okiool. Bɔ akieel atiɔ bakyɛ bam-a-bam, akieel abyal bakyɛ bam-a-bam. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a mfya bibi akieel apal bvool apfuru ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Onge bɛn obi kieel olɔɔ kɛn onge olɔɔ, dzii e baal bibi ekieel ekwal. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Kɛn a wu akieel akuru ɔ̃kwal tiil ntɔ, wu akieel abvuul. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Obobɔ, Nsia yi Ngesɛ y'Okwɛn yi, akieel atsal yɔ m'ɔ̃kiri a nsie wueel. Oŋɔ̃ me lio olɔ, ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri ètɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eluɔ ki ongɛɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mak 13.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />«Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ŋ'ekieel emwɛn byɛ “eluɔ ki ongɛɛ”, ki élieel Daniɛɛn wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9.27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11.31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12.11</ref></char></note>etɛɛn onse mboo yi ngel, oŋɔ̃ yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul wu atsiɔ ãndɔɔ mã, akwaal otsɛn o mɔ̃ ngesɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Obobɔ, yɔɔl kwɛn b'akieel akiɔɔl ke nsie a Yude abal onse ãnkio. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul wu akieel akal ke ywel a sɛɛ e nzɔ<note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Me b'otal sɛɛ, etal </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 2:6">Dzo 2.6</ref></char>.</note>, abee obesool me ndɔɔ yi ayewal eluɔ onse nzɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Yɔɔl kwɛn mbuul wu akieel akal k'ãnguun, abee nzɔ obekɔɔl me ndɔɔ yi ayewal kadzaka. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Ãwua bibi m'ãtsoo omɔ̃ m'akaal b'akieel akal y'ãyam, ye b'akieel awa baan ãbiaal! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Ebuɛɛn, kwɛn oŋɔ̃, obal o byɛ obee okal me lio e mfyɛ wuo me tsoo e saba! <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ekieel ekal ye fool lam bibi, m'emfa kyɛn fool li obobɔ lɔ-okal kɛn amwɛn lɔ wɛ fa k'ébɛɛn ɔ̃kiri tiil lio li, bvool lɔ kieel k'ebekal bam wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Okɛɛn Mfam k'ákueel ɔ̃bvɛn wu ãtsoo omɔ̃ wɛ, k'ekekal ye mbuul wu abvuul wɛ. Kɛn a me ndɔɔ a baal b'ésueel ndɛ, ndɛ akieel akuaal ɔ̃bvɛn a mɔ̃. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Obobɔ, okɛɛn mbuul olieel byɛ ndiri: “Mãsia oli ŋã!” Wuo, “ndɛ oli ku!” Ebee ndɛ okiool. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Ke ngwel wɛ, amãsia ba mfya y'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a mfya akieel apal. Bɔ akieel asa ãndɔɔ m'ãnɛn y'emvieel, me ndɔɔ yi apfuru baal. Okɛɛn bɔ akoo, bɔ àpfuru onkyam baal b'ésueel Nziã. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Mɛ̃ bu ngwi byɛ ãnkunkwa obɔ! <verse eid="MAT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Okɛɛn alieel byɛ ndiri: “Etal, Mãsia oli onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ!” Ebee okɔ oyi. Wuo okɛɛn alieel byɛ ndiri: “Etal, ndɛ oli onse mboo yi m'edziɔɔn!” Ebee okiool. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Ke ngwel wɛ, oya o Muaan a mbuul okieel okal onge ɔ̃bɛɛn a nzyel wu ayɛɛl ɔ̃kiri fa etswi ki epal tal tiil etswi ki edziin lɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Mboo yi èkal ebiĩ, yi èbvɔɔn angɔ-nywɛn<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:37">Luk 17.37</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eliĩ e Muaan a Mbuul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mak 13.24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />«Tswa-a-tswa, ke mbee ãtsoo ã fool omɔ̃,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">tal ekieel epiin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">nswii k'abepaal mvieel wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">angam-a-ngam afa ywel atswal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">Ɛ̃fel ɛ̃ waan mi ke ywel ɛ̃kieel ɛ̃tiɔɔl.»<verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />«<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.30</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abɔɔl buaal b'akieel asal mboo mɔ̃ onse ãnguun, akieel abiri ngɔmɔ̃, akieel asiil wumɔ̃. Ãyɛɛn omɔ̃ k'ãli onse ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ Nziã mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>Obobɔ, eliĩ e Muaan a Mbuul ekieel epal ke ywel. Ãyam ã baal a nsie mbueel ãkieel ãluɔɔl. Mɔ̃ ãkieel ãmwɛn k'eya Muaan a mbuul onse epɛn e ywel y'omfam ye waan li bibi. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Ŋ'ekieel ebel mvel-a-mvel wu ɔ̃nɛn, Muaan a mbuul akieel ayuɔɔl ãnzwel ã ndɛ. M'etswi enge-enã bvi ɔ̃kiri a nsie, fa ntɔ a ywel tiil yinkyɛ, mɔ̃ ãkieel ãbvool baal b'ésueel ndɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mboo a ɔ̃ti a fig</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mak 13.28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />«Eyɔɔl mboo a ɔ̃ti wa fig ewa byɛ ãyal: Ŋ'emwɛn byɛ kwɛn ãpɔɔ̃ ã ndɛ ãyii dzoo-dzoo, bvool ãbvi ãnyuɔ̃ opaal, oŋɔ̃ byɛ eyɛɛ wɛn ɔ̃bvu wu alili oyii tsotsoo. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Emfa kiki, ŋ'ekieel emwɛn byɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel, eyɛɛ wɛn Muaan a mbuul oyii tsotsoo k'edzoo. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, baal ba lio li kieel k'akwa wɛ, ye k'èya ãndɔɔ omɔ̃. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Ywel ye nsie ekieel ebwel, kɛn ãyɛɛn ã mɛ̃ kieel k'ãbwel mam wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wu oyɛɛ lio e ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri nã?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mak 13.32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17.26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />«Me b'otal tsoo ye lio, mbuul wu oyɛɛ mɔ̃ pyɛ, onkyam ãnzwel ke ywel, onkyam Muaan, kɛn a Taal ndyam. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Ŋ'ekieel eya Muaan a mbuul, ãndɔɔ ãkieel ãbwel onge m'ébwel mɔ̃ me lio e Nowa. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ye k'ebva mpel yi nɛn, baal ákedza bvool ákenywã, ákebaal bvool ákewa baan a bɔ k'ãbal, tiil tsoo li ésam Nowa onse ebɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Kɛn a bɔ, yi ékeyɛɛ bɔ yam pyɛ, tiil ye k'ebvi mpel yi enɛn, ebam baal bam bueel. Ekieel ekal emfa kiki me lio li ekieel eya Muaan a mbuul. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Obobɔ, abɔɔl buaal b'akieel akal k'ãnguun, akieel abiri ngɔmɔ̃, akieel asiil wumɔ̃. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Akaal buaal b'akieel akyɛɛl nsia, akieel abiri ngɔmɔ̃, akieel asiil wumɔ̃. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Obobɔ, ekal angɔ-mwiĩ, ke ngwel wɛ byɛ k'eyɛɛ tsoo li ekieel eya Mfam a byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Eyɛɛ ngesɛ bubu: Okɛɛn nga-nzɔ abeyɛɛ lio li eya mbuul a pfuul me tsia, ndɛ awal ɔ̃tsiil, bvool k'awa ndɛ nkuul yi abwel ndɛ nzɔ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, byɛ hɛ̃, ewal ɔ̃yɛɛl! Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ k'eyɛɛ lio li èya Muaan a mbuul wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃bi wuo ɔ̃bvɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk 12.41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />«Ɔ̃sal wa ye lweel bvool wa y'ãkaã wɛn mfam a ndɛ osuul ndɛ mbuul wu atal asal bakyɛ, kwɛn ndɛ awa bɔ bvi-odza me lio li ngesɛ, wɛn? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Esɛ ol'ɔ̃sal ondɛ, wɛn ŋ'èyebvool mfam a ndɛ, àyebɔɔ ndɛ abesa ɔ̃sal m'emfa okyɛ! <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mfam àsuul ɔ̃sal ondɛ mbuul wu atal ãndɔɔ ã ndɛ mbueel. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Kɛn a ŋɛn ndɛ oli ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃bi wu ayɛɛn ndyam-a-ndyam ndiri: “Mfam a mɛ̃ kɛn ol'oyiil m'oya”, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />bvool obvi asal bakyɛ obɛɛl, obvi odza y'onywã ye baal b'ebebɔɔ mbal, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />obobɔ mfam a ndɛ àyebvool me tsoo lɛn ndɛ k'aketsam wɛ, bvool me lio lɛn ndɛ hɛ̃ k'ayɛɛ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Obobɔ, mfam àwa ndɛ etumbu kyam ki enɛn, bvool àsuul ndɛ onse nkel a baal a pfuru. Oyɔ mboo yi elel y'odza o miin.»<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Mboo a ãnsam m'akaal kuun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />«Obobɔ, Okwɛn o ywel òkal m'emfa ki: Ãnsam m'akaal kuun áwel ambunda a bɔ me ndɔɔ yi ayemwɛɛn y'ɔ̃baal. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Onse bɔ, ataan áli ewool, ataan áli anga-ãyal. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />B'ewool awel ambunda a bɔ, k'ayɛɛl mbaal wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Kɛn anga-ãyal awel ambunda, ye mbaal mãkyɛ m'ɛ̃langa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɛ̃langa mi bɔ, mi ábuo m'ɔ̃bwɛɛ.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Onge bɛn ɔ̃baal ákeyiil m'oya, ãnsam m'akaal omɔ̃ mbueel twal epuo, bu ayiool me twal. <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Nkal a kuku, abiool ndiri: “Ɔ̃baal oyi, epal eyeyɔɔ ndɛ!” <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Obobɔ, ãnsam m'akaal omɔ̃ mbueel ãsiool me twal, bu ãbvi ambunda a bɔ ofaal. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />B'ewool asɔɔ ol'anga-ãyal ndiri: “Emeewa bee mbaal ã byɛ ãkyɛ, ke ngwel wɛ bee ambunda ayii adzam!” <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Anga-ãyal abveel bɔ ndiri: “Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, k'obobɔ wɛ! Ke ngwel wɛ, mbaal olɔ k'ãkoo me bee ye byɛ wɛ. Eyi ola b'atiɔ mɔ̃, eyesuun mã byam.” <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Kɛn a ŋ'eyii eyi ewool mbaal osuun, ɔ̃baal otɔ. B'áli ye mbaal ã bɔ asam onse mboo yi asa bal, edzoo e nzɔ, bu awɔɔl. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ãnsam m'akaal mãkyɛ omɔ̃ ãtɔ hɛ̃, bu ãbiool ndiri: “Mfam, Mfam dzweel bee nzɔ!” <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Kɛn ɔ̃baal obveel bɔ ndiri: “Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ byɛ wɛ.”» <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Yeso bu alweel ndiri: «Oŋɔ̃, ekal angɔ-mwiĩ! Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ k'eyɛɛ tsoo wɛ, k'eyɛɛ lio hɛ̃ wɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mboo a nzi yi obɔɔ̃</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19.11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />«Okwɛn o ywel okieel okal m'emfa ki: Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ abooyi odzuu, oti asal a ndɛ mbel, bu awi bɔ opfel o ndɛ otal. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Ndɛ owi ngɔmɔ̃ nzi yi ãbvieel mã ɔɔl ɛ̃nkam ɛ̃taan (500), wukyɛ ndɛ owi ɛ̃nkam mviaal (200), wu atyel ndɛ owi ɔ̃nkam (100). Ndɛ owi mbuul bwɛn a mbuul m'emfa kyɛn ndɛ okoo k'asa me nzi oyɔ. Ndɛ bu ayɛn odzuu. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Tswa-tswa oŋɔ̃, ɔ̃sal wu abɔɔ nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃nkam ɛ̃taan (500) oyɛn oyesa obɔɔ̃ me nzi oyɔ, bu abɔɔ ɔ̃ndɔɔl wa nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃nkam ɛ̃taan (500). <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Ɔ̃sal wu abɔɔ nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃nkam mviaal (200) osi emfa kiki, bu abɔɔ ɔ̃ndɔɔl wa nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃nkam mviaal (200). <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Me b'otal ɔ̃sal wu abɔɔ nzi yi ãbvieel ɔ̃nkam (100), ndɛ otsam ywɛn onse nsie, bu akwee nzi e mfam a ndɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />«Ke mbee a lio li ela, mfam a asal obɔ oyebvool. Ndɛ ofuul bɔ ki esi bɔ me nzi e ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Ɔ̃sal wu abɔɔ nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃nkam ɛ̃taan (500) oyi, osuo ɔ̃ndɔɔl wa nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃nkam ɛ̃taan (500) wu ebɔɔ ndɛ, y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: “Mfam, yɛ awi mɛ̃ nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃nkam ɛ̃taan (500), mɛ̃ mbɔɔ ɔ̃ndɔɔl wa nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃nkam ɛ̃taan (500), yɔ bu.” <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Mfam a ndɛ olieel ndɛ ndiri: “Ngesɛ, yɛ li ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃bvɛ bvool wa ye lweel! Yɛ suo kwɛn yɛ li dzu me ndɔɔ yi nsi-nsiri. Obobɔ, mɛ̃ èsuul yɛ mfam wu atal ãndɔɔ m'ãnɛn. Oŋɔ̃ sam onse esɛ e mfam a yɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Ɔ̃sal wu abɔɔ nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃nkam mviaal (200) oyi, osuo ɔ̃ndɔɔl wa nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃nkam mviaal (200) wu ebɔɔ ndɛ, y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: “Mfam, yɛ awi mɛ̃ nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃nkam mviaal (200), mɛ̃ mbɔɔ ɔ̃ndɔɔl wa nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃nkam mviaal (200), yɔ-bu.” <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Mfam a ndɛ olieel ndɛ ndiri: “Ngesɛ, yɛ li ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃bvɛ bvool wa ye lweel! Yɛ suo kwɛn yɛ li dzu me ndɔɔ yi nsi-nsiri. Obobɔ, mɛ̃ èsuul yɛ mfam wu atal ãndɔɔ m'ãnɛn. Oŋɔ̃ sam onse esɛ e mfam a yɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ɔ̃sal wu abɔɔ nzi yi ãbvieel ɔ̃nkam (100) oyi, y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: “Mfam, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ wɛn yɛ li mbuul wa ye mviil mpɛn, ke ngwel wɛ yɛ atsam ke mboo yɛn yɛ k'akwɛn wɛ, yɛ aka nsia ke mboo yɛn yɛ k'akwɛn wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ ngyoo buɔ, bu ngyɛn ye nkwee nzi e yɛ onse nsie. Nzi e yɛ yɔ-bu, wal.” <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Mfam a ndɛ obveel ndɛ bubu: “Ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃bi bvool wa y'obwal! Yɛ ayɛɛ wɛn mɛ̃ wu etsam ke mboo yɛn mɛ̃ k'ekwɛn wɛ, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ wu eka nsia ke mboo yɛn mɛ̃ k'ekwɛn yɔ wɛ, <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />ke yɛ abee nzi e mɛ̃ ke nzɔ yi abekwɛɛ nzi oyesuul emã? Yɛ okɛɛn asi obobɔ, ŋemvool mɛ̃ ŋã, kɛn mɛ̃ ekeewal nzi e mɛ̃ y'ɔ̃ndɔɔl! <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Oŋɔ̃ ewɛɛl ndɛ nzi yi ãbvieel ɔ̃nkam (100) oyɔ, ewa yɔ ola wu oli ye nzi yi ãbvieel ɛ̃nkam kuun (1.000). <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu oli ndyam y'eluɔ, àlweel ndɛ bvikyɛ, kwɛn ndɛ abɔɔ bvi enduru ɔ̃ndel. Kɛn a wɛn kyam pyɛ, àmbaal onkyam k'emã-mã ki eli a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Me b'otal ɔ̃sal wu empwɛɛn, etyal ndɛ onse empeel li nkwel-a-nzi. Oyɔ mboo yi ekieel ekal y'elel y'odza o miin.”»<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otsiil b'ãndɔɔ ã baal bo ntɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />«Ŋ'ekieel eya Muaan a mbuul onse omfam o ndɛ y'ãnzwel mbueel, ndɛ akieel abva nsɛn nkal a kiri e ndɛ li Okwɛn li dzuun. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Ãyam ã baal b'ɔ̃kiri a nsie wueel ãkieel ãbvɔɔn ke nkwel a ndɛ. Obobɔ, ndɛ akieel akab baal ebaal bviaal, onge ɔ̃mbuaal-anywam wu akab emɛ̃mɛɛ̃ y'antab. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Ndɛ akieel asuul emɛ̃mɛɛ̃ me kuɔɔl e ndɛ ki elam, antab me ki ekal. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Obobɔ, ɔ̃kwɛn akieel aliaal baal b'ali me kuɔɔl e ndɛ ki elam ndiri: “Eya, byɛ baal b'ebɔɔ ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl o Tal a mɛ̃, ewal Okwɛn b'éyɛɛl ndɛ byɛ fa k'ábuo ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ éli ye nzal, byɛ éwi mɛ̃ bvi-odza. Mɛ̃ éli ye nzuaal, byɛ éwi mɛ̃ ãdza. Mɛ̃ éli ɔ̃nzii, byɛ éyɔɔ mɛ̃ ola byɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Mɛ̃ éli odzuũ, byɛ éwi mɛ̃ ekɔ. Mɛ̃ éli y'ãluu, byɛ éwueel a mɛ̃. Mɛ̃ éli onse bwal, byɛ éyi mɛ̃ otal.” <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Obobɔ, baal ba dzu akieel abveel ndɛ ndiri: “Ke Mfam, tsoo emã li émwɛn bee yɛ áli ye nzal, bee bu ewi yɛ bvi-odza, wuo li éli yɛ ye nzuaal, bee bu ewi yɛ ãdza? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Tsoo emã li émwɛn bee yɛ áli ɔ̃nzii, bee bu eyɔɔ yɛ ola bee, wuo li éli yɛ odzuũ, bee bu ewi yɛ ekɔ? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Tsoo emã li émwɛn bee yɛ y'ãluu, wuo onse bwal, bee bu eyi yɛ otal?” <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Ɔ̃kwɛn akieel abveel bɔ ndiri: “Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, nsa yueel yi ési byɛ obobɔ me ngɔmɔ̃ wu obvool mbee onse baan-ngoo a mɛ̃ ba, ŋ'ési me mɛ̃.”»<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />«Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ɔ̃kwɛn akieel aliaal b'akieel akal me kuɔɔl e ndɛ ki ekal ndiri: “Embal, esyal lala ye mɛ̃, byɛ baal b'ápuul! Eyi onse mbaa yɛn k'edzam wɛ, yi áyɛɛl me ndɔɔ a ɔ̃pfu y'ãnzwel ã ndɛ! <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ éli ye nzal, byɛ k'éwi mɛ̃ bvi-odza wɛ. Mɛ̃ éli ye nzuaal, byɛ k'éwi mɛ̃ ãdza wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Mɛ̃ éli ɔ̃nzii, byɛ k'éyɔɔ mɛ̃ ola byɛ wɛ. Mɛ̃ éli odzuũ, byɛ k'éwi mɛ̃ ekɔ wɛ. Mɛ̃ éli y'ãluu bvool éli onse bwal, byɛ k'éyi mɛ̃ otal wɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Obobɔ, bɔ hɛ̃ akieel abveel ndɛ ndiri: “Mfam, tsoo emã li émwɛn bee yɛ áli ye nzal, wuo áli ye nzuaal, wuo áli ɔ̃nzii, wuo áli odzuũ, wuo áli y'ãluu, wuo áli onse bwal, bee bu ebee yɛ owuaal?” <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Ɔ̃kwɛn akieel abveel bɔ ndiri: “Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, nsa yueel yɛn byɛ k'ési obobɔ me ngɔmɔ̃ onse b'abvool mbee ba wɛ, ŋɛn k'ési me mɛ̃ wɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Obobɔ, bɔ obɔ akieel ayi k'etumbu ki ɔ̃bu. Kɛn a baal ba dzu akieel ayi k'elaã li ɔ̃bu nzal ɔ̃bu.»<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Amfam b'Ayuda ayɛn Yeso mfoo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mak 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Dzã 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Ŋ'eman Yeso ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel oyiool, ndɛ olieel ayio a ndɛ ndiri: <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />«Byɛ eyɛɛ kwɛn ãtsoo ãsiil mbuaal m'abɛɛl Pfuun li Onduru. M'emfa okyɛ, àtiɔ Muaan a mbuul, kwɛn abɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu.»<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Obobɔ, amfam b'anga-a-Nziã y'akuu-kuul b'Ayuda abvɔɔn ke nzɔ a ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn wu ata me Kayif. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Bɔ akuru k'asiin Yeso m'ãyal bvool abam ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Kɛn a bɔ ayɛɛn ndiri: «Ebee ndɛ osiin onse pfuun, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ tsungaa abee onse baal obva.»<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ oyiri Yeso ãnasi m'ɔ̃tswɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mak 14.3-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Dzã 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Ŋ'éli Yeso k'ola bo Betani onse nzɔ a Simɔ̃ wɛn tsɔɔn áli y'ãluu me leba, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ osyel tsotsoo a ndɛ me lio li ékedza ndɛ. Ndɛ áli y'ɔ̃langa wu alebat wu áluul m'ãnasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ãnasi ŋã mbaal ã nswel. </char></note> mã nzi bibi. Ndɛ oyiri ndɛ mɔ̃ m'ɔ̃tswɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Ŋ'emwɛn ayio obobɔ, bɔ ayoo nkyee, bu alieel bubu: «Li ebɔɔ̃ li bwɛn-a-bwɛn? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Al'akoo k'atiɔ ãnasi omɔ̃ nzi bibi, bu awel nzi oyɔ awi aywal.» <verse eid="MAT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Ŋ'eyɛɛ Yeso obobɔ, ndɛ olieel ndiri: «Otsɛn omã b'esa byɛ ɔ̃kaal wu? Ndɔɔ yi esi ndɛ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ eli ngesɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Aywal, byɛ èkal ye bɔ lio lueel. Kɛn a mɛ̃, byɛ k'èkal ye mɛ̃ lio lueel wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Okɛɛn ndɛ oyiri mɛ̃ ãnasi mã me nzuru, me ndɔɔ yi afaal odziool o mɛ̃. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ãmboo mbueel m'akieel atsal Nsia yi ngesɛ yi, m'ɔ̃kiri ndyam wueel, akieel ayɛɛn me ndɔɔ yi esi ɔ̃kaal wu, me ndɔɔ yi atsam ndɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda abii mpwee yi atiɔ Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mak 14.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Obobɔ, ngɔmɔ̃ onse antam kuun ye buaal wɛn nkuũ Yuda Isikaliot, oyetal amfam b'anga-a-Nziã. <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />Ndɛ ofuul bɔ bubu: «Ki èwa byɛ mɛ̃ emã, ŋɛn mɛ̃ ntiɔ byɛ Yeso?» Bɔ bu awi ndɛ nzi yi ãbvieel ãku-ãtyel<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12">Dza 11.12</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Bɛɛn lio olɔ, Yuda oyii abebii mpwee yi ngesɛ yi etiɔ ndɛ bɔ Yeso.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃yɛɛl me ndɔɔ a pfuun li Onduru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-16">Mak 14.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luk 22.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Me tsoo li ɛ̃kwel li pfuun li adza amampa bɛn k'abiin wɛ, ayio ayefuul Yeso ndiri: «Yɛ dzii kwɛn bee eyeyɛɛl yɛ ɔ̃laan wa pfuun li Onduru kwɛn?» <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Eyi onse bviil, ola mfungetie, eliaal ndɛ bubu: “Ɔ̃tee oyɛɛn ndiri: Lio e mɛ̃ eyii ekoo. Ola yɛ, mboo yi èyedza mɛ̃ pfuun li Onduru y'ayio a mɛ̃.”» <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Ayio asi ãndɔɔ kɛn a m'emfa ki etam Yeso bɔ osa. Bɔ bu awel ɔ̃yɛɛl wa pfuun li Onduru.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso odzi ɔ̃laan wa pfuun li Onduru y'ayio a ndɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:17-26">Mak 14.17-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-23">Luk 22.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Dzã 13.21-30</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Ŋ'etɔ ãnkunkwal, Yeso owel mboo me ndɔɔ yi adza y'antam kuun ye buaal. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Ŋ'eyii edza bɔ, ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ àtiɔ mɛ̃.» <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Ayio ayii bam ãwua-ãwua, bu abvi ndɛ ofuul wɛn ke mbee a wɛn ndiri: «Mfam, mɛ̃?» <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yeso obveel ndiri: «Wu olɔ kuɔɔl ye mɛ̃ onse saan, ndɛ ondɛ wu àtiɔ mɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Muaan a mbuul ŋ'àyi m'emfa ki ákel me ndɔɔ a ndɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:2-19">Ãnz 22.2-19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53">Edz 53</ref></char></note>. Kɛn ãwua m'ãnduru ɔ̃ndel ola mbuul wu àtiɔ Muaan a mbuul! Me ndɔɔ a mbuul ondɛ, ngesɛ ále k'ábee ndɛ oburu!» <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yuda wu àtiɔ Yeso abvuru oyɛɛn, ofuul ndɛ ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee, eli mɛ̃?» Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ee, yɛ bu yɛɛn yɔ obɔ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃laan a Mfam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Ŋ'eyii edza bɔ, Yeso owel mampa, obveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn, otsiil ndɛ, owi ayio ndɛ y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Ewal edza, yi-bu nzuru a mɛ̃.» <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ owel mbiɔ a mbal ã bvine, obveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn, owi ayio y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Enywã mɔ̃ byɛ bam bueel, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />mã-bu ãkel ã mɛ̃, ãkel m'ondoo, m'ãtsɔɔn me ndɔɔ ɔ̃bobɔ a baal, kwɛn bɔ abɔɔ odzeel b'ãbi. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, bɛɛn nonɔ̃, mɛ̃ bvool kieel k'ebenywã mbal ã bvine mã wɛ, tiil tsoo li ekieel enywã mɛ̃ mɔ̃ m'emfa ekyam ye byɛ onse Okwɛn o Tal a mɛ̃.» <verse eid="MAT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Ke mbee a ŋ'eyam bɔ ãnziĩ, bɔ apal me ndɔɔ yi ayi nkio a ɛ̃ti mi Olibve.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso olieel ndiri Piɛɛl akieel atwɛn ndiri ndɛ k'ayɛɛ ndɛ wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Obobɔ, Yeso olieel bɔ ndiri: «Kɛn a me tsia wu, m'ã̀ya me mɛ̃ ã̀nziool byɛ bueel onse okiool. Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel bubu: “Mɛ̃ èbɛɛl ɔ̃mbuaal-anyam, ɔ̃kel wu emɛ̃mɛɛ̃ àtsɔɔn<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Dza 13.7</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Kɛn a ke mbee osiool o mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ètsɔɔn nkwel a byɛ ke Ngalile.» <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Piɛɛl abvuru oyɛɛn, olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, onkyam ŋɛn m'ã̀ya me yɛ ãnziool bakyɛ bueel, mɔ̃ k'ã̀nziool mɛ̃ bam wɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yesu bu abveel ndɛ bubu: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɛ wɛn, kɛn a me tsia wu, ye k'ekuaal nswee, yɛ àtwɛn nsa tyel wɛn yɛ ke yɛɛ mɛ̃ wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Piɛɛl olieel ndiri: «Onkyam ŋɛn ebvaan mɛ̃ ekwa ye yɛ, mɛ̃ ke nkoo k'etwɛn wɛn mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ yɛ wɛ!» Obobɔ, ayio bueel ayɛɛn kɛn a bubu.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ãbuɛɛn ã Yeso ke Ngetesemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mak 14.32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso otɔ y'ayio ke mboo yi ata me Ngetesemane. Ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Ebva nsɛn ŋã, mɛ̃ èsyal ku me ndɔɔ yi eyebuɛɛn.» <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Ndɛ owel Piɛɛl, ye baan a Dzebede b'abɔɔl ange-buaal. Ndɛ obvi ãwua y'ãnyiĩ oyoo. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Ndɛ bu alieel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ eyoo ãwua mɛn mɛ̃ ngyii ekɔɔ y'epfu. Esiil ŋã, ekal angɔ-mwiĩ ye mɛ̃.» <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Ndɛ osyel muaan-lala, obvi ãbuo mbwii me nsie, bu abuɛɛn bubu: «Taal, okɛɛn yɛ dzii, siaal mbiɔ yi lala ye mɛ̃. Kɛn a yɔɔl kwɛn yɛ bee be nzii mɛ̃ osa, yɛ sa b'edzii yɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Ndɛ okɔɔl ol'ayio ange-atyel, oyebɔɔ bɔ amaayiool me twal. Ndɛ bu alieel Piɛɛl bubu: «Obobɔ, byɛ ŋɛn k'eman k'ekal angɔ-mwiĩ si ekal lio ngemɔ ye mɛ̃ wɛ! <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Ekal angɔ-mwiĩ bvool ebuɛɛn, kwɛn byɛ ebee m'ɔ̃mbio obva. Ɔ̃fel oli ye mpɛn, kɛn a nzuru eli y'okwal.» <verse eid="MAT 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Ndɛ osyel muaan-lala li nsa yuaal, bu abuɛɛn bubu: «Taal, okɛɛn mbiɔ yi, k'akoo k'asiaal yɔ lala ye mɛ̃ wɛ, kɛn ebvaan mɛ̃ enywã yɔ, oŋɔ̃ yɔɔl kwɛn yɛ sa b'edzii yɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Ndɛ okɔɔl bvool ol'ayio, oyebɔɔ bɔ amaayiool me twal, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ mviil ãl'ãyii y'olyam. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Ndɛ bvool osiil bɔ, osyel lala me ndɔɔ yi ayebuɛɛn li nsa tyel. Ndɛ oyɛɛn ãndɔɔ mãmã. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Ŋ'ekɔɔl ndɛ ol'ayio, ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ kɛn eli me twal bvool ebewuun! Lio ekoo, ŋ'àtiɔ Muaan a mbuul me mviɔɔl mi anga-ãbi. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Etɛɛn, bia-byɛ eyi! Mbuul wu àtiɔ mɛ̃ oyii tsotsoo.»<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asiin Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mak 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Dzã 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Ŋ'ékeyɛɛn Yeso kɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, mbuul wu ata me Yuda, wu áli ngɔmɔ̃ onse ayio kuun ye buaal otɔ. Ndɛ áli y'embuul e baal b'ábiri epwel y'ɛ̃mpaã. B'áyuɔɔl baal obɔ amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'akuul-kuul a yam. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Yuda wu àtiɔ Yeso al'amaaliaal baal obɔ eliĩ ki èsa ndɛ, ndiri: «Mbuul wu èbuun mɛ̃, ndɛ ondɛ, esiin ndɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Tswa-a-tswa oŋɔ̃, Yuda osyel tsotsoo a Yeso, olieel ndɛ bubu: «Enswɛɛn obɔ, Ɔ̃tee!» Ndɛ bu abuun ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yeso bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Ndoo a mɛ̃, b'eyi yɛ osa, sa bɔ.» Obobɔ, baal obɔ asyel tsotsoo a Yeso, asiin ndɛ, bu akuru ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Ngɔmɔ̃ onse b'áli ye Yeso oyɔɔ epwel, opfel ɔ̃sal a ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn kyɛ, bu atsɔɔ ndɛ tswi. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Kɛn a Yeso olieel ndɛ bubu: «Bveel epwel e yɛ ke mboo a kyɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, baal bueel b'akieel awa epwel, akieel akwa hɛ̃ m'epwel. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Yɛ atsam wɛn mɛ̃ ale ke nkoo k'eta Tal a mɛ̃ mbel, kwɛn ndɛ ayuɔɔl mɛ̃ alili ŋã nkel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Me lio olɔ, ola baal a Lom, nkel ngamɔ̃ éli m'ambwel-mbwel amiil asɛɛn (6.000).</char></note> a ãnzwel yi enduru kuun ye mbuaal wɛ? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Ke mɛ̃ esa obobɔ, emfa emã ki ekoo ãndɔɔ m'ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã? Ke ngwel wɛ, mɔ̃ ayɛɛn ndiri ebvaan ãndɔɔ ãbwel m'emfa okyɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso olieel embuul e baal ndiri: «Byɛ ewal mɛ̃ onge edzuul, kwɛn byɛ eya ola mɛ̃ y'epwel y'ɛ̃mpaã me ndɔɔ yi esiin mɛ̃? Ãtsoo mbueel, mɛ̃ ékebva nsɛn onse Nzɔ a Nziã me ndɔɔ yi eyiool, kɛn a byɛ k'ésiin mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Kɛn a m'asi mã mbueel, me ndɔɔ yɛn ãyɛɛn m'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã m'ákel ãkoo. Obobɔ, ayio bueel ayiri ndɛ, bu abal.»<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ke nkwel a mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mak 14.53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22.54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Dzã 18.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Baal b'ásiin Yeso abiri ndɛ ola Kayif wu ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn. Ayiool b'ãngel y'akuul-kuul ábvɔɔn okɔ. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Piɛɛl ákeluɛɛn a Yeso lala tiil ekɔɔ e nzɔ a ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn. Ndɛ osam onse mwiĩ a kyɛ, bu abvi nsɛn y'ankiaal a kyɛ, me ndɔɔ yi atal emfa ki esɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃. <verse eid="MAT 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã ye mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda yueel ákebii elyal ki mfi-mfya ki akel Yeso, kwɛn awa ndɛ etumbu ki epfu. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Kɛn a bɔ k'abɔɔ kyɛ wɛ, onkyam ŋɛn baal ákeya ndɛ ãndɔɔ oburu. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, amwɛn buaal ba mfya ayi. <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />Bɔ ayɛɛn bubu: «Mbuul wu álieel ndiri: “Mɛ̃ nkoo k'etsal Nzɔ a Nziã bvool k'etuu yɔ m'ãtsoo mbuaal<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Dzã 2.19</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="MAT 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Obobɔ, ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn otɛɛn bvool ofuul Yeso ndiri: «Yɛ yi abveel pyɛ? B'eyɛɛn yɛ omã m'ãbuu m'eliaal baal ba me ndɔɔ a yɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Kɛn a Yeso owuun pi. Ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Mɛ̃ etam yɛ k'alab ɔ̃kyel me nkuũ a Nziã wa mwiĩ, me ndɔɔ yɛn yɛ yɛɛn bee okɛɛn yɛ ndyam li Mãsia wu Muaan a Nziã.» <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ bu lieel yɔ obɔ. Kɛn a mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, bɛɛn meba ŋã, byɛ ekieel emwɛn Muaan a mbuul me nsɛn me kuɔɔl ki elam ki Nga-Waan, bvool k'eya ndɛ onse epɛn ke ywel.» <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Obobɔ, ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn okɔɔl ekɔ, y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Ndɛ osiaan Nziã! Bia-a-byɛ bvool k'eli ye kɔɔ e mbuul wu ayɛɛn bia-byɛ ãndɔɔ mã wɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn byam eyoo k'esiaan ndɛ Nziã.» <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Byɛ ekuru omã? Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ndɛ ebvaan akwa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.66 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:7">Dzã 19.7</ref></char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, bɔ afaan Yeso ãntɛɛ m'osu, bvool anyam ndɛ ɛ̃nkwaã. Bakyɛ ayuul ndɛ ãmpal y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />«Mãsia, okɛɛn yɛ li ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, ta bvua, wu obɛɛl yɛ nã!»<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piɛɛl otwɛn ndiri ndɛ k'ayɛɛ Yeso wɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mak 14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Dzã 18.15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Piɛɛl ábvi nsɛn onkwel-a-nzi, onse ekɔɔ. Ɔ̃sal ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kaal osyel tsotsoo a ndɛ, bvool olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ, yɛ hɛ̃ áli ye Yeso wu ɔ̃fi-Ngalile!» <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Kɛn a Piɛɛl otwɛn ke nkwel a baal bueel ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ b'edzii yɛ oyɛɛn wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Onge bɛn ndɛ al'oyii ayi mpyal ɔ̃nywã wu ekɔɔ, ɔ̃sal ɔ̃kyam wu ɔ̃kaal omwɛn ndɛ bvool olieel b'áli oŋɔ̃ ndiri: «Mbuul wu áli ye Yeso wa Nadzalet.» <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Piɛɛl bvool otwɛn ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ndab ɔ̃kyel wɛn, mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ mbuul ondɛ wɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Ke mbee a muaan-lio, b'áli oŋɔ̃ asyel tsotsoo a Piɛɛl bvool alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, yɛ hɛ̃ li ngɔmɔ̃ onse baal obɔ, ke ngwel wɛ eyɛɛn e yɛ efɛn yɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Piɛɛl bu abvi oyɛɛn ndiri: «Yɔɔl Nziã awa mɛ̃ etumbu, okɛɛn mɛ̃ epfuru! Mɛ̃ ndab ɔ̃kyel wɛn mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ mbuul ondɛ wɛ!» Kɛn alili oŋɔ̃, nswee okueel. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Obobɔ, Piɛɛl bu ayeel ãyɛɛn m'éyɛɛn Yeso ndɛ ndiri: «Ye k'ekuaal nswee nonɔ̃, yɛ àtwɛn nsa tyel wɛn yɛ ke yɛɛ mɛ̃ wɛ.» Ndɛ bu apal nkwel-a-nzi, bu abvi olel ye nkyɛɛl yueel.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Abiri Yeso ola Pilate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mak 15.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk 23.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Dzã 18.28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />M'epal-epal kwɔɔl, amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã bueel y'akuul-kuul ayɛn Yeso mfoo. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Bɔ akuru ndɛ ebwal, abiri ndɛ, bu awi ndɛ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ Pilate wu mfam a Lom ke nsie yi Ayuda.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda olɔ bwel swɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Ɛ̃sa 1.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Ŋ'emwɛn Yuda wu átiɔ ndɛ kwɛn awi ndɛ etumbu, ndɛ oswɛɛl ãtsam, bu ayebveel nzi y'ãbvieel ãku-ãtyel (30) oyɔ ol'amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'akuul-kuul. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ nsi obi, ŋe ntiɔ mɛ̃ ɔ̃nkinkyam kwɛn abam ndɛ.» Kɛn a bɔ abveel ndɛ bubu: «Obɔ k'otal bee wɛ, otal yam!» <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Yuda otyel nzi onse Nzɔ a Nziã, bu ambal oŋɔ̃. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ oyelɔ bwel swɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã atwel nzi oyɔ, bu ayɛɛn bubu: «Ãngel k'ãwa bia-byɛ nkuul wɛ yi alɔ nzi yi onse nkab yi abelɔ ãkab. Ke ngwel wɛ, yɔ eli nzi y'ãkel!» <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Ke mbee a k'ekuru bɔ mfoo, me nzi oyɔ, bɔ asuun nguun a mbuul wu abebuo eluɔ m'ɔ̃bwɛɛ, kwɛn mboo oyɔ ekal yi abedziool anzii. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, tiil nonɔ̃ ŋã, abeta nguun oyɔ me «Nguun a ãkel<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:19">Ɛ̃sa 1.19</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Obobɔ, asi ndɔɔ yi élieel ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã Yelemi ndiri: «Bɔ awel nzi y'ãbvieel ãku-ãtyel. Ondɛ ɔ̃bvɛn wu ékuru baal b'Isalayel k'afuru me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />Bɔ awi yɔ me ndɔɔ yi asuun nguun a mbuul wu abebuo eluɔ m'ɔ̃bwɛɛ, onge b'étam Mfam mɛ̃ osa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:1-3">Dze 18.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:1-2">19.1-2</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilate ofuul Yeso ɛ̃pfuul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mak 15.2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Dzã 18.33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Abiri Yeso ola Pilate wu mfam. Ndɛ ofuul Yeso ndiri: «Yɛ ndyam ɔ̃kwɛn Ayuda li?» Ndɛ obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yam mbuul wu olieel yɔ.» <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'akuul-kuul abvi Yeso ofɛn, ndɛ yi abveel pyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Obobɔ, Pilate ofuul ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ k'ayoo ãndɔɔ mbueel m'efɛn bɔ yɛ wɛ?» <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Kɛn a ndɛ k'abveel ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ wɛ. Bu esi mfam ɛ̃kam myam bibi.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Awi Yeso etumbu ki epfu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mak 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Dzã 18.39–19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Me pfuun bwɛn a bwɛn li Onduru, mfam ákepaal mbuul a bwal ngɔmɔ̃ wu ékesuaal baal. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, me lio olɔ éli ye mbuul a bwal ngɔmɔ̃ wu áli ye nsia, wɛn nkuũ Yeso-Balabas. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Ŋ'emwɛn Pilate embuul ebvɔɔn, ndɛ ofuul bɔ ndiri: «Wu edzii byɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ mpaal onse bwal nã? Mpaal byɛ Yeso-Balabas wuo mpal byɛ Yeso wu ata me Mãsia?» <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ áyɛɛ ngesɛ kwɛn bɔ áwi Yeso me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndɛ m'ɔ̃kwal nsɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Me lio li ebvi Pilate nsɛn ke mbal, ke mboo yi ebetsiil ndɛ ãndɔɔ, ɔ̃kal a ndɛ oyuɔɔl ndɛ ɔ̃kiɛɛn ndiri: «Oyɛɛ ke sam onse ndɔɔ a mbuul wa dzu wu wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, nonɔ̃ ŋã, mɛ̃ mwɛn fool bibi onse ɔ̃tswɛ a twal me ndɔɔ a ndɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Kɛn amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'akuul-kuul atsɛɛn baal k'asɔɔ kwɛn apaal Balabas, abam Yeso. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Pilate ofuul bɔ ndiri: «Onse bɔ ange-buaal, wu edzii byɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ mpaal byɛ ndɛ nã?» Bɔ abveel ndiri: «Balabas!» <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilate ofuul bɔ bubu: «Ke Yeso wu ata me Mãsia, mɛ̃ ndɛ emã èsa?» Bɔ bueel abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Bɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu!» <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Ndɛ bvool ofuul ndiri: «K'obi omã b'esi ndɛ?» Kɛn a bɔ awɛɛl mpɛn m'obiool ndiri: «Bɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu!» <verse eid="MAT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilate omwɛn kwɛn ndɛ bvool yi akoo k'abesa pyɛ, kwɛn ŋɛn tsuunga wu abebva kɛn obva, ndɛ owel ãdza, osuɔɔl mviɔɔl ke nkwel embuul, bu alieel bubu: «Epfu e mbuul wu k'etal mɛ̃ wɛ, oyɔ ndɔɔ a byam!» <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Baal bueel abveel ndiri: «Yɔɔl kwɛn ãkel ã ndɛ ãkal nkal ɛ̃tswɛ ɛ̃ bee ye baan a bee!» <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Pilate bu ayɔɔl bɔ Balabas. Ndɛ otam k'abɛɛl Yeso asukɔrɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asukɔrɔ obɔ, ási bɔ m'ebaan bvi anyam, bvi átsɔɔn ãndaa y'angabwal. </char></note>, bu awi bɔ ndɛ kwɛn abɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ambwel-mbwel asɔɔl Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mak 15.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Dzã 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Ambwel-mbwel a Pilate abiri Yeso k'ekɔɔ e ndɛ wu mfam, bu alɔ ndɛ kal-a-kal a nkel yi nɛn yi ambwel-mbwel. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Bɔ ambaal ndɛ ekɔ, bu alaal ndɛ ki bɛ ki abendɔɔl ke ywel. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Bɔ atuu ekɔrɔ ki okwɛn m'ɛmbɛɛl mi ãnsiɛɛn, bu andɔɔl ndɛ kyɛ nkal a ɔ̃tswɛ. Bɔ hɛ̃ alɔ ndɛ ɔ̃mpaã onse kuɔɔl ki elam. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, bɔ abvi ãbuo ke nkwel a ndɛ, bu abvi ndɛ osɔɔl ndiri: «Ɔ̃kwɛn a Ayuda, bee ebio yɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Bɔ afaan ndɛ ãntɛɛ, awel ɔ̃mbɛɛl, abɛɛl ndɛ ndɛ m'ɔ̃tswɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Ke mbee a ŋ'esɔɔl-esɔɔl bɔ ndɛ, bɔ ambaal ndɛ ekɔ ki abendɔɔl ke ywel, abveel ndɛ ekɔ e ndɛ, bu abiri ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi ayebɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abɛɛl Yeso m'enkulusu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mak 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Dzã 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Ŋ'epal ambwel-mbwel, bɔ amwɛɛn ye mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃fi-Silɛn wɛn nkuũ Simɔ̃. Bɔ bu aywɛɛn ndɛ k'abiri enkulusu e Yeso. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ ke mboo ngamɔ̃ yi ata me Ngolongota, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri «mboo yi ebiɔ ki ɔ̃tswɛ», <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />bɔ awi Yeso mbal a bvine m'alɔ ãsɔɔ ã nkaa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Ãnz 69.22</ref></char></note>. Kɛn a ŋ'embio ndɛ mɔ̃, ndɛ obee mɔ̃ onywã. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, bɔ abɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu, bu akab ekɔ e ndɛ ke mbee a k'eti bɔ bvɛ ebie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:19">Ãnz 22.19</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Bɔ bu abvi nsɛn oŋɔ̃ me ndɔɔ yi akiaal ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Ke ywel ɔ̃tswɛ a ndɛ, ásuul muaan-ebɛɛ wu ákel ãmpiri m'ã́kewa otsɛn b'áwi ndɛ etumbu. Áswɛn bubu: «Wu-bu Yeso wu ɔ̃kwɛn a Ayuda.» <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Bɔ abɛɛl edzuul bviaal m'enkulusu tsotsoo a ndɛ, kyɛn me kuɔɔl e ndɛ ki elam, kyɛn me kuɔɔl e ndɛ ki ekal<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Edz 53.12</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Baal b'ákebwel áketoo ndɛ, asiɔ ɛ̃tswɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />Bɔ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Yɛ akedzii k'atsal nzɔ a Nziã bvool atuu yɔ m'ãtsoo ãtyel. Okɛɛn yɛ li Muaan a Nziã, bvuul nzuru a yɛ yam bvool sool m'enkulusu!» <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Emfa kiki, amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã, y'ayiool b'ãngel, y'akuul-kuul ákesɔɔl ndɛ ndiri: <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />«Ndɛ wu akebvuul bakyɛ, k'amekoo k'abvuul nzuru a ndyam wɛ! Ndɛ ndiri ɔ̃kwɛn a Isalayel, k'amesool m'enkulusu kwɛn bia-byɛ ekiool ndɛ ti! <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Ndɛ ati kaã e ndɛ me Nziã. Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã abvuul ndɛ meba ŋã, okɛɛn ndɛ odzii ndɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:9">Ãnz 22.9</ref></char></note>. Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ al'ayɛɛn ndiri: “Mɛ̃ ndi Muaan a Nziã.”» <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Edzuul bvi ábɛɛl m'enkulusu tsotsoo a ndɛ ebvi ndɛ otoo, m'emfa kiki.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Epfu e Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mak 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Dzã 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Bɛɛn tal dzu tiil lio li ãtyel ŋ'emeebwɔɔn lɔ, empeel ebvi m'ɔ̃kiri wueel. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Ŋ'eyii nku-a-nku a lio li ãtyel, Yeso obiool bam me nkii yi kokɔ ndiri: «Eli, Eli, lama sabakatani?» Ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri: «Nziã a mɛ̃, Nziã a mɛ̃, otsɛn omã b'eyiri yɛ mɛ̃?» <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Baal bakyɛ b'áli oŋɔ̃, ŋ'eyoo bɔ obobɔ, alieel ndiri: «Ndɛ oŋɔ̃ Eli mbel ata!» <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ otsuu ntiin, oyewal epɔ̃dze, oluul kyɛ me mbal a ãŋɛɛ̃, okuru kyɛ me nswɛɛ a ɔ̃mbɛɛl, bu awi Yeso mɔ̃ me ndɔɔ yi anywã. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Kɛn a bakyɛ alieel ndiri: «Yɔɔl, emetal okɛɛn Eli àyebvuul ndɛ!»<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Yeso bvool obiool me nkii yam yi kokɔ, bu abveel ɔ̃fiaal ola Nziã. <verse eid="MAT 27:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Me lio olɔ, ekɔ ki enɛn ki onse Nzɔ a Nziã ebɔɔl ebaal bviaal fa ywel tiil nsie. Nsie enziool nzuru, ãnkɔɔn ãbɔɔl. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Ãmpiɛɛn ãdzweel nzuru, akiool bibi b'ámaakwa asiool. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Bɔ apal onse ãmpiɛɛn, ke mbee osiool o Yeso, bɔ asam onse Yelusalem, bviil li ngel. Baal bibi amwɛn bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Mbiri ambwel-mbwel ɔ̃nkam wa lom y'ambwel-mbwel b'áli oŋɔ̃ me ndɔɔ yi akiaal Yeso, ŋ'emwɛn bɔ k'enziool nsie ye mbueel m'ãbwel, bɔ ayoo buɔ bibi, bvool alieel ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mbuul wu ali Muaan a Nziã.» <verse eid="MAT 27:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Akaal bibi áli oŋɔ̃, bɔ áketal ndɛ lala: Bɔ áyi ndɛ osuul fa Ngalile, me ndɔɔ yi asal me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Onse akaal obɔ, éli ye Mali wu ola bo Magadala, ye Mali wu ngoo a Dzak ye Dzedzef, ye ngoo a baan a Dzebede.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adziool ebiĩ e Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mak 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Dzã 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Ŋ'etɔ ãnkunkwal, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃pfel wɛn nkuũ Dzedzef, ɔ̃fi-bviil li Ayuda li Alimate oyi. Ndɛ hɛ̃ áli ngɔmɔ̃ onse ayio a Yeso. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Ndɛ oyɛn ola Pilate, osɔɔ ebiĩ e Yeso. Pilate bu atam k'awa ndɛ kyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Ndɛ owel ebiĩ, odzii kyɛ onse ekɔ ki enyiɔɔn. <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />Ndɛ odziool kyɛ onse mpiɛɛn yi alili yi étsam ndɛ onse ãnkɔɔn me ndɔɔ a ndyam. Ndɛ okeel nkɔɔn yi nɛn k'ɔ̃nywã a mpiɛɛn, bu ayɛn. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Mali wu ola bo Magadala, ye Mali wumɔ̃ áli me nsɛn oŋɔ̃ nsɔ̃-a-nsɔ̃ a mpiɛɛn.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ambwel-mbwel akieel mpiɛɛn a Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Ela esiool, éli tsoo li enɔɔn li awal ɔ̃yɛɛl a saba. Amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'Afalisaye abvɔɔn ola Pilate. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Bɔ alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, bee eyeel wɛn ŋ'éli mbuul a mfya wu mwiĩ, ndɛ álieel ndiri: “Ke mbee a ãtsoo ãtyel, m'èsiool m'epfu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Oŋɔ̃ yɔɔl kwɛn yɛ yuɔɔl baal ayekiaal mpiɛɛn oyɔ tiil tsoo li ãtyel. Okɛɛn k'obobɔ wɛ, ayio a ndɛ ol'ayeturu ebiĩ e ndɛ, bvool ayɛɛn baal ndiri: “Ndɛ osiool onse b'ákwi.” Mfya yi ãmbee oyɔ ol'enduru yi ɛ̃kwel.» <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilate olieel bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ eli y'ambwel-mbwel! Esuul bɔ ayekiaal mpiɛɛn m'emfa ki edzii byɛ!» <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Obobɔ, bɔ ayekyab mpiɛɛn, asi eliĩ me nkɔɔn, bu asuul baal b'akiaal yɔ.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Osiool o Yeso m'epfu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mak 16.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Dzã 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Ke mbee a saba, me tsoo li ɛ̃kwel li eyenge m'epal-epal kwɔɔl, Mali wa Magadala ye Mali wumɔ̃ ayetal mpiɛɛn. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Enseel oŋɔ̃, nsie enziool nzuru yam kokɔ. Nzal-a-ŋɛn ãnzwel ã Mfam ngãmɔ̃ ãfi ywel, ãsool ãyekeel nkɔɔn me pyɛ, bu ãbvi nsɛn nkal a yɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Mɔ̃ ã́kenyɛɛn onge ɔ̃bɛɛn a nzyel, ekɔ e mɔ̃ hɛ̃ éli bvam fuu. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Ankiaal buɔ bu obɔɔ, bɔ abvi otiɔɔl, bu ayii onge b'akwi. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Kɛn ãnzwel ãlieel akaal ndiri: «Byɛ, ebee buɔ oyoo. Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ wɛn byɛ Yeso wu abɛɛl m'enkulusu ebebii. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Ndɛ k'ali ŋã wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ amaasiool, onge b'élieel ndɛ byɛ. Eyetal mboo yi eli ndɛ bɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Eyi tswa-a-tswa eyeliaal ayio a ndɛ wɛn: “Ndɛ amaasiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi, ndɛ otsɔɔn nkwel a byɛ ke Ngalile<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mat 26.32</ref></char></note>. Okɔ ku èmwɛn byɛ ndɛ.” Ondɛ ɔ̃kiɛɛn wu yengyɛɛn mɛ̃ byɛ.» <verse eid="MAT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Akaal ambal mpiɛɛn tswa-a-tswa oŋɔ̃, amaaluul me buɔ y'esɛ ki bibi. Bɔ atsuu ntiin ayeliaal nsia oyɔ ol'ayio. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Enseel oŋɔ̃, Yeso oyemwɛɛn ye bɔ, bu alieel bɔ ndiri: «Ensuɛɛn obɔ!» Bɔ asyel tsotsoo a ndɛ, asiin ntaã e ndɛ, bu abvi ãbuo ke nkwel a ndɛ. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Yeso olieel bɔ ndiri: «Ebee buɔ oyoo. Eyeliaal baan-ngoo a mɛ̃ ndiri ayi Ngalile: Okɔ ku èmwɛn bɔ mɛ.»<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsia yi ewi ankiaal a mpiɛɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Ŋ'éli akaal me nkuul, ankiaal ke kwɛ b'ákekiaal mpiɛɛn ayɛn onse bviil. Bɔ alieel amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã mam mbueel m'ãbwel. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã abvɔɔn y'akuul-kuul. Ke mbee a k'ekuru bɔ mfoo, bɔ awi ambwel-mbwel ɔ̃bɔbɔ a nzi. <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />Bɔ atam bɔ k'ayɛɛn ndiri: «Ayio a ndɛ ayeturu ebiĩ e ndɛ me tsia, me lio li eli bee me twal. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Okɛɛn mbiri oyoo nsia oyɔ, bee baal b'èbuaal ndɛ ɔ̃kwal, bvool esa kwɛn byɛ ebee fool omwɛn.» <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Ambwel-mbwel awel nzi, bu asi b'atam bɔ osa. Nsia a ɔ̃sam ondɛ bu etsɔɔn onse Ayuda tiil nonɔ̃ ŋã.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso otam antam a ndɛ ontam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mak 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Dzã 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ɛ̃sa 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Me b'otal ayio kuun y'ɔ̃mɔ̃, bɔ ayɛn Ngalile, nkal a nkio yi élieel Yeso bɔ ndiri ayi. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Ŋ'emwɛn bɔ ndɛ, bɔ abvi ãbuo. Kɛn a bakyɛ onse bɔ áketa enkyam. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yeso osyel tsotsoo a bɔ, bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Áwi mɛ̃ okwɛn bueel ke ywel ye nsie. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Obobɔ, eyi, esa kwɛn onse ɛ̃kiri mvieel baal akal ayio a mɛ̃, ewa bɔ opongo me nkuũ a Taal, ye yi Muaan, ye yi Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Eyiool bɔ k'akiaal mam mbueel me ntam mɛ̃ byɛ osa. Me b'otal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ndi ye byɛ ãtsoo mbueel, tiil ntɔ a ɔ̃kiri.»<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>